(167072, 9436, 5212, '<td valign="top">This is so cute and great photo, too.  Maybe I would have cropped it a bit tighter, though??</td>', 'This is so cute and great photo, too.  Maybe I would have cropped it a bit tighter, though??', '2002-12-09 01:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
