(167084, 9378, 5475, '<td valign="top">I really like marble shots, but your background is a little distracting to me.  Also, I can see dust and small fibers on the marbles.  The colors and swirls are wonderful, though, and your method of lighting them works very well.<br/>Smelllyfish1002</td>', 'I really like marble shots, but your background is a little distracting to me.  Also, I can see dust and small fibers on the marbles.  The colors and swirls are wonderful, though, and your method of lighting them works very well.Smelllyfish1002', '2002-12-09 01:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(167085, 9459, 5212, '<td valign="top">This would have been a good one for motion!</td>', 'This would have been a good one for motion!', '2002-12-09 01:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(167088, 9482, 5212, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, cool photo</td>', 'Very pretty, cool photo', '2002-12-09 01:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(167090, 9386, 5212, '<td valign="top">I took some shots like this one this week, too.  Glad we didn''t both send one in, yours will likely be the "fire" out of my entry.  Good luck.</td>', 'I took some shots like this one this week, too.  Glad we didn''t both send one in, yours will likely be the "fire" out of my entry.  Good luck.', '2002-12-09 01:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(167091, 9463, 5475, '<td valign="top">I like this shot of the lemons... it has a nice shape to the composition.  I find the seed somwhat distracting, though.  Smellyfish1002</td>', 'I like this shot of the lemons... it has a nice shape to the composition.  I find the seed somwhat distracting, though.  Smellyfish1002', '2002-12-09 01:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(167092, 9369, 5475, '<td valign="top">Good Idea, but I find the small gap between apple slices to be distracting.  I imagine it was very difficult to put together, though.  Good effort!<br/>Smellyfish1002</td>', 'Good Idea, but I find the small gap between apple slices to be distracting.  I imagine it was very difficult to put together, though.  Good effort!Smellyfish1002', '2002-12-09 01:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
