(167099, 9417, 5475, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait , but I find the border to be a bit too much.  Maybe if it weren''t so wide.  It does draw out the blue in his collar, though.   Smellyfish1002</td>', 'Nice portrait , but I find the border to be a bit too much.  Maybe if it weren''t so wide.  It does draw out the blue in his collar, though.   Smellyfish1002', '2002-12-09 01:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
