(167416, 9582, 1856, '<td valign="top">Looks like a christmas card.  Nice composition and great job producing an evenly lit background.  I would prefer the ball were a bit redder (instead of orangey) and wish that branch wasn''t sticking into the foreground messing up your otherwise perfect dof. Great job!  8</td>', 'Looks like a christmas card.  Nice composition and great job producing an evenly lit background.  I would prefer the ball were a bit redder (instead of orangey) and wish that branch wasn''t sticking into the foreground messing up your otherwise perfect dof. Great job!  8', '2002-12-20 19:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(167420, 9575, 1856, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...for me, this image is just too small.  I really would have like to have seen it in a 640x480 size :(  Nice composition and colors.  Cute title.  The lighting is a tad harsh in a couple of spots.  7</td>', 'Hmmm...for me, this image is just too small.  I really would have like to have seen it in a 640x480 size :(  Nice composition and colors.  Cute title.  The lighting is a tad harsh in a couple of spots.  7', '2002-12-09 09:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(167422, 9531, 3724, '<td valign="top">I am impressed with this urban architectural elevation.  Shades of blue, teal, purple,  black, and grey-blue contrast dramatically with the fire reds.     Noticable fine grain is apparent- (or what ever it is).  To me this contributes a subtle texture to the image, and attenuates the feel of a solid building.  The strong architectural grid design,  seems to struggle with those elements that flatten - the grain- texture, amorphic window reflections, colour and optical foreshorting.  A very interesting image - a battle between 2d and 3d.</td>', 'I am impressed with this urban architectural elevation.  Shades of blue, teal, purple,  black, and grey-blue contrast dramatically with the fire reds.     Noticable fine grain is apparent- (or what ever it is).  To me this contributes a subtle texture to the image, and attenuates the feel of a solid building.  The strong architectural grid design,  seems to struggle with those elements that flatten - the grain- texture, amorphic window reflections, colour and optical foreshorting.  A very interesting image - a battle between 2d and 3d.', '2002-12-09 09:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(167423, 9312, 1856, '<td valign="top">Love the concept and colors.  Imo, the door takes away from an otherwise great image.  7</td>', 'Love the concept and colors.  Imo, the door takes away from an otherwise great image.  7', '2002-12-09 09:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(167443, 9561, 1280, '<td valign="top">WOWIE!  That''s a lot of BB''s.   Interesting pattern and composition.  I''m not crazy about the coloring...seems to have a blue/green overall cast.</td>', 'WOWIE!  That''s a lot of BB''s.   Interesting pattern and composition.  I''m not crazy about the coloring...seems to have a blue/green overall cast.', '2002-12-09 10:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
