(167575, 9543, 3087, '<td valign="top">Fantastic - would like it even more without the exaggerated contrast but that''s just personal preference. The DOF works well - I like that the framed view is out of focus compared to the detail of the wood. Great curved and just the right composition/ crop.</td>', 'Fantastic - would like it even more without the exaggerated contrast but that''s just personal preference. The DOF works well - I like that the framed view is out of focus compared to the detail of the wood. Great curved and just the right composition/ crop.', '2002-12-09 11:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(167578, 9578, 3087, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous...</td>', 'Gorgeous...', '2002-12-09 11:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(167581, 9575, 2780, '<td valign="top">Taking advantage of the new size limits i see :) Good choice as well. I think this photo really needs to be cropped small. It gives a cute feeling about the snail and makes it seem small, like it really is. I think if you were closer it would take away that nice mood of the photo. Is this scale 1:1 ? The fork looks about normal size. Great photo. 9</td>', 'Taking advantage of the new size limits i see :) Good choice as well. I think this photo really needs to be cropped small. It gives a cute feeling about the snail and makes it seem small, like it really is. I think if you were closer it would take away that nice mood of the photo. Is this scale 1:1 ? The fork looks about normal size. Great photo. 9', '2002-12-09 11:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(167586, 9552, 3087, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2002-12-09 11:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(167587, 9550, 3087, '<td valign="top">funky :)</td>', 'funky :)', '2002-12-09 11:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(167590, 9521, 3087, '<td valign="top">WOW!<br/>Perfect juxtaposition of foreground and background subjects. Really powerful.</td>', 'WOW!Perfect juxtaposition of foreground and background subjects. Really powerful.', '2002-12-09 11:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(167592, 9482, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is truly quite magnificent...</td>', 'This is truly quite magnificent...', '2002-12-09 11:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(167629, 9521, 5600, '<td valign="top">I like this..<br/>Interesting way of playing with contrast.</td>', 'I like this..Interesting way of playing with contrast.', '2002-12-09 11:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(167655, 9526, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a particularly nice photo... I really enjoy the contrasting theme of the summertime canoe fun and the snow covered background.  When warm weather comes back to your part of the world, maybe these boats will be back in service again :)  I also love the color combination here... great shot :) - setzler</td>', 'This is a particularly nice photo... I really enjoy the contrasting theme of the summertime canoe fun and the snow covered background.  When warm weather comes back to your part of the world, maybe these boats will be back in service again :)  I also love the color combination here... great shot :) - setzler', '2002-12-09 12:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(167657, 9543, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot... It reminds me of some Edward Weston shots I have seen in the past... = 10 - setzler</td>', 'This is a great shot... It reminds me of some Edward Weston shots I have seen in the past... = 10 - setzler', '2002-12-09 12:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(167658, 9538, 772, '<td valign="top">My favorite in this challenge... excellent work and kudos on choosing black and white :) = 10 - setzler</td>', 'My favorite in this challenge... excellent work and kudos on choosing black and white :) = 10 - setzler', '2002-12-09 12:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(167681, 9313, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, nice shadows. Angle/ viewpoint feels a bit funny...</td>', 'Nicely done, nice shadows. Angle/ viewpoint feels a bit funny...', '2002-12-09 12:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(167682, 9369, 5344, '<td valign="top">THIS IS WAY COOL, IF I COULD VOTE I WOULD HAVE GIVEN IT A NINE ONLY BECAUSE YOU DID NOT DO THE WHOLE APPLE.  ONCE AGAIN THIS IS WAY COOL.</td>', 'THIS IS WAY COOL, IF I COULD VOTE I WOULD HAVE GIVEN IT A NINE ONLY BECAUSE YOU DID NOT DO THE WHOLE APPLE.  ONCE AGAIN THIS IS WAY COOL.', '2002-12-09 12:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(167684, 9567, 5344, '<td valign="top">ONE WORD...AMAZING!!!!</td>', 'ONE WORD...AMAZING!!!!', '2002-12-09 12:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(167687, 9583, 5344, '<td valign="top">SORRY, JUST DIDN''T DO MUCH FOR ME<br/></td>', 'SORRY, JUST DIDN''T DO MUCH FOR ME', '2002-12-09 12:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(167688, 9433, 5344, '<td valign="top">BEAUTIFUL</td>', 'BEAUTIFUL', '2002-12-09 12:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(167739, 9582, 258, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2002-12-09 13:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(167742, 9501, 258, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF.</td>', 'Nice DOF.', '2002-12-09 13:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(167743, 9465, 3294, '<td valign="top">I think her eyes are too centered vertically... I think it would be interesting to have her eyes at the bottom of the photo... with lots of "unknown" negative space above her... kinda like "whatchu lookin'' at?"  hehe</td>', 'I think her eyes are too centered vertically... I think it would be interesting to have her eyes at the bottom of the photo... with lots of "unknown" negative space above her... kinda like "whatchu lookin'' at?"  hehe', '2002-12-09 13:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(167745, 9559, 258, '<td valign="top">Too much zoom noise  :-)</td>', 'Too much zoom noise  :-)', '2002-12-09 13:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(167749, 9503, 885, '<td valign="top">I like the different textures of the floor, wall, and machine.  I like how you can see the streaks in the dust on the seat.  The off-kiltered-ness of it adds to the ''unused'' feeling, I think.  I think it could be a little more contrasty though.</td>', 'I like the different textures of the floor, wall, and machine.  I like how you can see the streaks in the dust on the seat.  The off-kiltered-ness of it adds to the ''unused'' feeling, I think.  I think it could be a little more contrasty though.', '2002-12-09 13:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(167751, 9543, 885, '<td valign="top">Lovely, I really like this photo.  Did you add noise for the grainyness?  I think it works well, it emphasizes the rough texture of the wood.  Not really sure if that''s water or something else through the hole.  I think the real high contrast brings out the grain of the wood as well.</td>', 'Lovely, I really like this photo.  Did you add noise for the grainyness?  I think it works well, it emphasizes the rough texture of the wood.  Not really sure if that''s water or something else through the hole.  I think the real high contrast brings out the grain of the wood as well.', '2002-12-09 13:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(167753, 9538, 885, '<td valign="top">Lovely smooth perfectly toned black and white.  Not easy to photograph a shiny subject like that, but I think you did well.</td>', 'Lovely smooth perfectly toned black and white.  Not easy to photograph a shiny subject like that, but I think you did well.', '2002-12-09 13:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(167756, 9383, 885, '<td valign="top">I really love this point of view on the trumpet.  It looks like it''s floating.  I think the depth of field works really well also.  And the different colored ''disco ball'' effect adds some interest :-)</td>', 'I really love this point of view on the trumpet.  It looks like it''s floating.  I think the depth of field works really well also.  And the different colored ''disco ball'' effect adds some interest :-)', '2002-12-09 13:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(167773, 9585, 885, '<td valign="top">Pretty portrait, nice expression.  The side of her nose looks a little blown out on my monitor, but I know that it has a tendency towards brightness.</td>', 'Pretty portrait, nice expression.  The side of her nose looks a little blown out on my monitor, but I know that it has a tendency towards brightness.', '2002-12-09 13:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(167777, 9396, 885, '<td valign="top">Neat graphically and compositionally.  Simple but pleasing.</td>', 'Neat graphically and compositionally.  Simple but pleasing.', '2002-12-09 13:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(167791, 9578, 885, '<td valign="top">The background of this is really nice.  I love the out of focus ice covered branches.  The only thing I''m not sure about is the branch on the right.  Can''t tell if I''d have liked it better without.</td>', 'The background of this is really nice.  I love the out of focus ice covered branches.  The only thing I''m not sure about is the branch on the right.  Can''t tell if I''d have liked it better without.', '2002-12-09 13:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(167796, 9494, 2011, '<td valign="top">Im a big fan of black and white, but this shot Im thinking color would have been better. There are so many intresting items. You just know the colors had to be great.</td>', 'Im a big fan of black and white, but this shot Im thinking color would have been better. There are so many intresting items. You just know the colors had to be great.', '2002-12-09 13:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(167799, 9469, 885, '<td valign="top">Neat, I''ve never seen snow-covered slips before.  It looks rather surreal, and the blue-ish tone emphasizes that.  It looks very symmetrical at first, but it''s actually not, which I think is a little disturbing.  I think I''d have preferred it to be more symmetrical (and I usually don''t like symmetry) because the slips themselves are so symmetrical.</td>', 'Neat, I''ve never seen snow-covered slips before.  It looks rather surreal, and the blue-ish tone emphasizes that.  It looks very symmetrical at first, but it''s actually not, which I think is a little disturbing.  I think I''d have preferred it to be more symmetrical (and I usually don''t like symmetry) because the slips themselves are so symmetrical.', '2002-12-09 13:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(167800, 9369, 2011, '<td valign="top">Happy Holidays to you too!</td>', 'Happy Holidays to you too!', '2002-12-09 13:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(167802, 9312, 2011, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. Love the color, the shapes, the simplisity.10</td>', 'Beautiful shot. Love the color, the shapes, the simplisity.10', '2002-12-09 13:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(167804, 9345, 5223, '<td valign="top">I love  the colour-well done</td>', 'I love  the colour-well done', '2002-12-09 13:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(167807, 9482, 5223, '<td valign="top">Well done great photo</td>', 'Well done great photo', '2002-12-09 13:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(167808, 9559, 2011, '<td valign="top">Good photographers eye. We walk past things like this everyday, and never stop to notice the textures, and shapes.</td>', 'Good photographers eye. We walk past things like this everyday, and never stop to notice the textures, and shapes.', '2002-12-09 13:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(167810, 9553, 2011, '<td valign="top">Merry Kissmas to you too!</td>', 'Merry Kissmas to you too!', '2002-12-09 13:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(167814, 9538, 2011, '<td valign="top">This is lovely. 10</td>', 'This is lovely. 10', '2002-12-09 13:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(167822, 9582, 885, '<td valign="top">This is odd in that it almost looks like a silk-screen somehow.  The ball looks sort of unreal.  Is it because the plane of focus is at the edge of the sphere, and the front of the ball is actually out of focus?  Quite nice though, lovely composition, simple and clean, though I''d prefer a little bit more white space.</td>', 'This is odd in that it almost looks like a silk-screen somehow.  The ball looks sort of unreal.  Is it because the plane of focus is at the edge of the sphere, and the front of the ball is actually out of focus?  Quite nice though, lovely composition, simple and clean, though I''d prefer a little bit more white space.', '2002-12-09 13:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(167823, 9506, 885, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, pretty scene.  Hard to tell the sense of scale (which in this case, I think, is positive).</td>', 'Nice lighting, pretty scene.  Hard to tell the sense of scale (which in this case, I think, is positive).', '2002-12-09 13:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(167824, 9521, 885, '<td valign="top">Really neat juxtaposition of the guy\''s face and the poster(?) in the background.</td>', 'Really neat juxtaposition of the guy\''s face and the poster(?) in the background.', '2002-12-09 13:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(167830, 9436, 885, '<td valign="top">Very cute.  I love how his little nose and tongue are so hot pink.  The little piece of leaf or bark to the left of him looks like a curved arrow pointing at him....which is odd.</td>', 'Very cute.  I love how his little nose and tongue are so hot pink.  The little piece of leaf or bark to the left of him looks like a curved arrow pointing at him....which is odd.', '2002-12-09 13:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(167835, 9417, 885, '<td valign="top">Cute doggie.  Nice pet portrait, the lighting works well.  I think that the crop could be a little more interesting...as it is now, the dog seems too isolated.  I think maybe a tighter crop would have it feel a little more intimate.</td>', 'Cute doggie.  Nice pet portrait, the lighting works well.  I think that the crop could be a little more interesting...as it is now, the dog seems too isolated.  I think maybe a tighter crop would have it feel a little more intimate.', '2002-12-09 13:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(167836, 9506, 3585, '<td valign="top">great impression of desolation, a beautifull place and somewhere you do not want to be at the same time. good job</td>', 'great impression of desolation, a beautifull place and somewhere you do not want to be at the same time. good job', '2002-12-09 13:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(167839, 9553, 3585, '<td valign="top">zen but suprisingly fills that frame rather well</td>', 'zen but suprisingly fills that frame rather well', '2002-12-09 13:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(167858, 9566, 3585, '<td valign="top">Very expressive, I would suggest a little more space in front of this person to give her gaze a place to go. (not qite sure of my english on this one...sorry)</td>', 'Very expressive, I would suggest a little more space in front of this person to give her gaze a place to go. (not qite sure of my english on this one...sorry)', '2002-12-09 14:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(167863, 9494, 3585, '<td valign="top">Fun mixture of objets, well ccomposed</td>', 'Fun mixture of objets, well ccomposed', '2002-12-09 14:04:16.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(167874, 9546, 3102, '<td valign="top">Excellent gloom!</td>', 'Excellent gloom!', '2002-12-09 14:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(167876, 9510, 3102, '<td valign="top">At first I thought the title said "Macro," and I thought, gee, that''s not macro at all.  But alas, it is indeed Marco!  :)  Nice DOF, good crisp shot!</td>', 'At first I thought the title said "Macro," and I thought, gee, that''s not macro at all.  But alas, it is indeed Marco!  :)  Nice DOF, good crisp shot!', '2002-12-09 14:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(167877, 9526, 3102, '<td valign="top">Which one was borrowed...?  :)</td>', 'Which one was borrowed...?  :)', '2002-12-09 14:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(167878, 9551, 3102, '<td valign="top">Somehow I had pictured more harps, puffy clouds and angels :)</td>', 'Somehow I had pictured more harps, puffy clouds and angels :)', '2002-12-09 14:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(167889, 9496, 3080, '<td valign="top">LOL...Looks kind of funny sitting there on it''s own.  The light seems pretty bright on the leaves, but looks like there is a shadow on the sign.  I would like to see it the oposite, with more light on the sign.  Otherwise, though, I like the angle and framing/cropping.  Your focus and clarity are good, and the color is good as well.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'LOL...Looks kind of funny sitting there on it''s own.  The light seems pretty bright on the leaves, but looks like there is a shadow on the sign.  I would like to see it the oposite, with more light on the sign.  Otherwise, though, I like the angle and framing/cropping.  Your focus and clarity are good, and the color is good as well.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-09 14:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(167892, 9345, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very nice DOF.  I like how the chain is in good focus and the surroundings are softer focus, putting the visual focus directly onto the chain.  The angle and framing/cropping are good. I like the strong diagonal. Color and lighting are very nice as well.  What a great find. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice DOF.  I like how the chain is in good focus and the surroundings are softer focus, putting the visual focus directly onto the chain.  The angle and framing/cropping are good. I like the strong diagonal. Color and lighting are very nice as well.  What a great find. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-09 14:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(167893, 9388, 2302, '<td valign="top">Great focus, good lighting. I really like this shot a lot. I like the natural patterns that are formed and how you can see the slight variations in the height of the spaghetti.</td>', 'Great focus, good lighting. I really like this shot a lot. I like the natural patterns that are formed and how you can see the slight variations in the height of the spaghetti.', '2002-12-09 14:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(167894, 9310, 3080, '<td valign="top">Cute kid, and cute shot.  I would have liked it better had the strong horizontal line (neck level) been horizontal, rather than have a right tilt.  Neck level isn''t really the best place for the horizontal line actually, it cuts his head right off.  Maybe I would opt for a totally different background.  However, the shot of the kid is nice and crisp.  Great focus and clarity.  Lighting is nice, and the angle on the kid is good as well. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Cute kid, and cute shot.  I would have liked it better had the strong horizontal line (neck level) been horizontal, rather than have a right tilt.  Neck level isn''t really the best place for the horizontal line actually, it cuts his head right off.  Maybe I would opt for a totally different background.  However, the shot of the kid is nice and crisp.  Great focus and clarity.  Lighting is nice, and the angle on the kid is good as well. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-09 14:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(167895, 9439, 3080, '<td valign="top">What a very pretty marble effect on the wall.  I like the shadows and the color is great.  I like the pattern.  You did a great job to show part of the actual window in the shot.  It gives a bit of symetry, without being symetrical, if that makes sense.  Your focus and clarity are great.  Very nice find. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'What a very pretty marble effect on the wall.  I like the shadows and the color is great.  I like the pattern.  You did a great job to show part of the actual window in the shot.  It gives a bit of symetry, without being symetrical, if that makes sense.  Your focus and clarity are great.  Very nice find. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-09 14:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(167899, 9473, 2302, '<td valign="top">Nice colors in the shot. A bit more lighting on the red would be nice. The background is also a bit distracting. I would have liked to see the stockings handing - it might have given a better picture of the Christmas theme. You could also try to take the shot from a bit more directly overhead - although then you run into the danger of it being too flat.</td>', 'Nice colors in the shot. A bit more lighting on the red would be nice. The background is also a bit distracting. I would have liked to see the stockings handing - it might have given a better picture of the Christmas theme. You could also try to take the shot from a bit more directly overhead - although then you run into the danger of it being too flat.', '2002-12-09 14:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(167900, 9450, 2302, '<td valign="top">Great colors. My only comment is that the glare in the upper right of the shot is a tiny bit distracting. Really nice detail here.</td>', 'Great colors. My only comment is that the glare in the upper right of the shot is a tiny bit distracting. Really nice detail here.', '2002-12-09 14:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(167902, 9396, 3080, '<td valign="top">Your focus and clarity are good on this shot.  I really like the patterns created by the eyes of the needles.  Angle and framing/cropping are great.  I think I would like to see this just as it is now, only with a colored string.  I think that would give it that little something extra to make it interesting to me.  You did a great job of showing the single little fibers in the thread.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Your focus and clarity are good on this shot.  I really like the patterns created by the eyes of the needles.  Angle and framing/cropping are great.  I think I would like to see this just as it is now, only with a colored string.  I think that would give it that little something extra to make it interesting to me.  You did a great job of showing the single little fibers in the thread.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-09 14:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(167905, 9559, 3080, '<td valign="top">The sky on this is quite white out and the photo seems to contain speckles. (noise?)  It might be the brightness of the sky in the background that makes the focus look soft.  The patterns are nice though, and the angle and framing/cropping you chose is nice.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The sky on this is quite white out and the photo seems to contain speckles. (noise?)  It might be the brightness of the sky in the background that makes the focus look soft.  The patterns are nice though, and the angle and framing/cropping you chose is nice.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-09 14:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(167906, 9526, 2302, '<td valign="top">I took a couple very similar shots - glad I didn''t submit one! Nice colors and focus.</td>', 'I took a couple very similar shots - glad I didn''t submit one! Nice colors and focus.', '2002-12-09 14:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(167908, 9546, 3080, '<td valign="top">What perfect focus! Look at the little branches on that tree!  I like the "color".  I don''t think "color" is the word I''m looking for rather the TONES of the photo.  Very nice exposure and contrast.  I love the sky. Great silhouettes. Angle and framing/cropping are good as well.  A lovely shot. GOod luck in the challenge.</td>', 'What perfect focus! Look at the little branches on that tree!  I like the "color".  I don''t think "color" is the word I''m looking for rather the TONES of the photo.  Very nice exposure and contrast.  I love the sky. Great silhouettes. Angle and framing/cropping are good as well.  A lovely shot. GOod luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-09 14:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(167911, 9546, 2302, '<td valign="top">Great tree - nice details in the branchs. I think I would like it a bit more if there was a way to capture the tree without the buildings in the picture - as it is now they are a bit distracting. Nice lighting - it captures the harsh feeling very well.</td>', 'Great tree - nice details in the branchs. I think I would like it a bit more if there was a way to capture the tree without the buildings in the picture - as it is now they are a bit distracting. Nice lighting - it captures the harsh feeling very well.', '2002-12-09 14:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(167915, 9559, 2170, '<td valign="top">An interesting angle, but the pixel-y colors distract.  Perhaps this photo has been oversharpened?  Oh!  I just noticed the bird -- I didn''t even see that before, unfortunately.  I just thought this was a shot of something a bird would be looking at.  Maybe this would be more effective in B/W since the sky color is so washed out already?</td>', 'An interesting angle, but the pixel-y colors distract.  Perhaps this photo has been oversharpened?  Oh!  I just noticed the bird -- I didn''t even see that before, unfortunately.  I just thought this was a shot of something a bird would be looking at.  Maybe this would be more effective in B/W since the sky color is so washed out already?', '2002-12-09 14:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(167916, 9340, 3080, '<td valign="top">Kind of strange.  Not totally my cup of tea, however, technically well done.  The color is nice, and your focus and clarity are good.  Angle and framig/cropping are good.  I don''t mind at all that this is centered.  The "halo" or yellow ring around it almost brings it out of the center and towards the upper left.  not litterally, but our eyes are drawn that way.  Had not been for that yellow circle around your object, I think this would look silly just sitting there.  So that was a great decision.  Lighting also seems good on the subject.  Nice shot. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Kind of strange.  Not totally my cup of tea, however, technically well done.  The color is nice, and your focus and clarity are good.  Angle and framig/cropping are good.  I don''t mind at all that this is centered.  The "halo" or yellow ring around it almost brings it out of the center and towards the upper left.  not litterally, but our eyes are drawn that way.  Had not been for that yellow circle around your object, I think this would look silly just sitting there.  So that was a great decision.  Lighting also seems good on the subject.  Nice shot. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-09 14:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(167918, 9436, 2170, '<td valign="top">A great shot, and a wonderfully captured moment.  The tree in the foreground is distracting, and I can''t figure out why the squirrel''s fur is so washed out.  The tail especially looks like there was a lot of sharpening and/or color correction and it looks unnatural.  Way to grab the moment, though....this is a great capture.</td>', 'A great shot, and a wonderfully captured moment.  The tree in the foreground is distracting, and I can''t figure out why the squirrel''s fur is so washed out.  The tail especially looks like there was a lot of sharpening and/or color correction and it looks unnatural.  Way to grab the moment, though....this is a great capture.', '2002-12-09 14:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(167920, 9336, 3080, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Is the an inverted  image?  I think you have framed it well.  I like how it falls out of the frame of the photo.  Your angle is good as well.  The color is quite pretty, although a bit un natural looking.  Not like I''d really know what the "natural" colors would be, but it almost look inverted.  I like the pattern as well.  Nice abstract kind of shot. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting. Is the an inverted  image?  I think you have framed it well.  I like how it falls out of the frame of the photo.  Your angle is good as well.  The color is quite pretty, although a bit un natural looking.  Not like I''d really know what the "natural" colors would be, but it almost look inverted.  I like the pattern as well.  Nice abstract kind of shot. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-09 14:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(167923, 9586, 2170, '<td valign="top">This might be a more effective B/W shot.  The numerous colors and harsh lighting make it difficult to tell what the subject is.  It could be a really slimy worm or something, but I don''t think there''s enough of an "icecicle-y" effect to give it that post-ice storm feeling.</td>', 'This might be a more effective B/W shot.  The numerous colors and harsh lighting make it difficult to tell what the subject is.  It could be a really slimy worm or something, but I don''t think there''s enough of an "icecicle-y" effect to give it that post-ice storm feeling.', '2002-12-09 14:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(167925, 9312, 2170, '<td valign="top">LOL...I really had to look twice at this.  It''s unfortunate that the door is there...otherwise this would be a much better illusion.  The shapes of the hangers and the rack are very strong and anchor the photo, though.</td>', 'LOL...I really had to look twice at this.  It''s unfortunate that the door is there...otherwise this would be a much better illusion.  The shapes of the hangers and the rack are very strong and anchor the photo, though.', '2002-12-09 14:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(167926, 9485, 3080, '<td valign="top">Lovely architecture. I wonder if this would benefit from a couple steps to the right.  More of a head on to the archway.  I like the person in the photo, and while I''m not a huge fan of exaggerated lights or shadows, the light coming from the window is nice in this situation.   Focus and clarity in this shot are great.  The detail we get to see is perfect.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Lovely architecture. I wonder if this would benefit from a couple steps to the right.  More of a head on to the archway.  I like the person in the photo, and while I''m not a huge fan of exaggerated lights or shadows, the light coming from the window is nice in this situation.   Focus and clarity in this shot are great.  The detail we get to see is perfect.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-09 14:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(167927, 9552, 2170, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color and detail.</td>', 'Beautiful color and detail.', '2002-12-09 14:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(167928, 9497, 2170, '<td valign="top">A great capture.  The fuzziness and artifacting distract from the image, and the color seems washed out somewhat.</td>', 'A great capture.  The fuzziness and artifacting distract from the image, and the color seems washed out somewhat.', '2002-12-09 14:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(167929, 9482, 2170, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous detail and a great capture!!  This would have been sooooo excellent for the motion challenge as well.  This is as good as it gets.</td>', 'Gorgeous detail and a great capture!!  This would have been sooooo excellent for the motion challenge as well.  This is as good as it gets.', '2002-12-09 14:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(167933, 9485, 2170, '<td valign="top">Nicely done...well framed and great focus.  The blast of light from the altar window is a bit much, but otherwise a very well-captured moment.</td>', 'Nicely done...well framed and great focus.  The blast of light from the altar window is a bit much, but otherwise a very well-captured moment.', '2002-12-09 14:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(167934, 9495, 2170, '<td valign="top">Sparkly!  I think I would have tried to focus in on one of the light "fixtures" and then blend the rest in the background somewhat fuzzily -- there''s a lot to take in here and one is really not sure what to focus on.</td>', 'Sparkly!  I think I would have tried to focus in on one of the light "fixtures" and then blend the rest in the background somewhat fuzzily -- there''s a lot to take in here and one is really not sure what to focus on.', '2002-12-09 14:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(167936, 9521, 2170, '<td valign="top">Well done!  Excellent candid and great photowork.  I love the poster in the background and how it''s almost like a "shadow" of the subject.  Great great great!</td>', 'Well done!  Excellent candid and great photowork.  I love the poster in the background and how it''s almost like a "shadow" of the subject.  Great great great!', '2002-12-09 14:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(167938, 9496, 2170, '<td valign="top">The sign itself seems a bit dark.  Love the title, though.</td>', 'The sign itself seems a bit dark.  Love the title, though.', '2002-12-09 14:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(167939, 9510, 2170, '<td valign="top">Excellent focus and detail.  This is a beautiful shot.  You can even make out the peach fuzz on his face!!</td>', 'Excellent focus and detail.  This is a beautiful shot.  You can even make out the peach fuzz on his face!!', '2002-12-09 14:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(167941, 9390, 2170, '<td valign="top">It''s like Xena!</td>', 'It''s like Xena!', '2002-12-09 14:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(167943, 9553, 2170, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the framing and the high contrast feel -- but this might even be too high-contrasty.  And that''s saying something for me.</td>', 'I enjoy the framing and the high contrast feel -- but this might even be too high-contrasty.  And that''s saying something for me.', '2002-12-09 15:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(167944, 9459, 2170, '<td valign="top">The fence gives great lines to the photo.  I would like to have seen one where you tried to follow  them with the camera while they were moving so the background would be blurred out too.</td>', 'The fence gives great lines to the photo.  I would like to have seen one where you tried to follow  them with the camera while they were moving so the background would be blurred out too.', '2002-12-09 15:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(167946, 9522, 3080, '<td valign="top">Focus and clarity are great.  I like the detail you show us in the wood.  The angle and framing/cropping are good.  I like the idea behind this shot.  It''s a very nice snow shot.  Good exposure and contrast.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Focus and clarity are great.  I like the detail you show us in the wood.  The angle and framing/cropping are good.  I like the idea behind this shot.  It''s a very nice snow shot.  Good exposure and contrast.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-09 15:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(167948, 9582, 2170, '<td valign="top">It''s so round and stark that it looks fake!  In this instance, I would like to have seen the needles in the foreground be more in focus and the others in the background more washed out.  The big blur right in the center of the photograph is the first thing one sees, and it''s sort of distracting.  I love the color and plain background...</td>', 'It''s so round and stark that it looks fake!  In this instance, I would like to have seen the needles in the foreground be more in focus and the others in the background more washed out.  The big blur right in the center of the photograph is the first thing one sees, and it''s sort of distracting.  I love the color and plain background...', '2002-12-09 15:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(167950, 9465, 2170, '<td valign="top">Kinda creepy -- I really like the floating head feel.  :)</td>', 'Kinda creepy -- I really like the floating head feel.  :)', '2002-12-09 15:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(167952, 9585, 2170, '<td valign="top">The lighting from the right is really really harsh and casts a shadow on her nose.  Except for that, this is a very well-taken image.  Great framing and detail and a lovely subject to boot!</td>', 'The lighting from the right is really really harsh and casts a shadow on her nose.  Except for that, this is a very well-taken image.  Great framing and detail and a lovely subject to boot!', '2002-12-09 15:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(167953, 9345, 3018, '<td valign="top">Excellent macro shot.  I love the colors and the textures.</td>', 'Excellent macro shot.  I love the colors and the textures.', '2002-12-09 15:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(167957, 9578, 2170, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail.  The shot of color from the leaf is just perfect.</td>', 'Excellent detail.  The shot of color from the leaf is just perfect.', '2002-12-09 15:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(167959, 9388, 2170, '<td valign="top">Great shot -- totally unexpected and interesting.  I wonder what lighting it from the bottom would have done -- would the darker patches in the middle have been lighter?</td>', 'Great shot -- totally unexpected and interesting.  I wonder what lighting it from the bottom would have done -- would the darker patches in the middle have been lighter?', '2002-12-09 15:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(167961, 9583, 2170, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!!  The wave of blue through the glass is really what makes this such a great shot!</td>', 'Fantastic!!  The wave of blue through the glass is really what makes this such a great shot!', '2002-12-09 15:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(167963, 9447, 2373, '<td valign="top">beutiful, good lighting</td>', 'beutiful, good lighting', '2002-12-09 15:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(167964, 9546, 2373, '<td valign="top">really cool</td>', 'really cool', '2002-12-09 15:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
