(167998, 9383, 2170, '<td valign="top">Do I see Christmas lights reflecting in the horn?  LOL  I enjoy the DOF in this image -- and the way it seems to be floating is well done as well.</td>', 'Do I see Christmas lights reflecting in the horn?  LOL  I enjoy the DOF in this image -- and the way it seems to be floating is well done as well.', '2002-12-09 15:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(168000, 9501, 2170, '<td valign="top">Great focus and a wonderful title.</td>', 'Great focus and a wonderful title.', '2002-12-09 15:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(168004, 9450, 3612, '<td valign="top">i really like the framing of this, but am put off by the reflection cast in the upper right hand side of the photo. i love the detail in the strings! (6) -satellitespeck</td>', 'i really like the framing of this, but am put off by the reflection cast in the upper right hand side of the photo. i love the detail in the strings! (6) -satellitespeck', '2002-12-09 15:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(168030, 9543, 3459, '<td valign="top">This is a beautifully composed image.  I can see either an eye with an eyebrow raised or an ear, reflecting or listening to the world deeper inside the blury part of the image.  The tonal range is that of an Ansel Adams picture, with very sharp well defined lines.  I would love to see it in a larger size, or in print.  Excellent job, a 10!</td>', 'This is a beautifully composed image.  I can see either an eye with an eyebrow raised or an ear, reflecting or listening to the world deeper inside the blury part of the image.  The tonal range is that of an Ansel Adams picture, with very sharp well defined lines.  I would love to see it in a larger size, or in print.  Excellent job, a 10!', '2002-12-09 16:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(168035, 9583, 3459, '<td valign="top">What an excellent composition!  The colour, the softly flowing yet sharp lines, the tonality of red, and the striking yellow; beautiful.  Personally, I like this image particularry for what it isn''t, and as I don''t know wether you would be oftended by it or not by my impression, I will keep that to myself.  Exceptional, a 10!</td>', 'What an excellent composition!  The colour, the softly flowing yet sharp lines, the tonality of red, and the striking yellow; beautiful.  Personally, I like this image particularry for what it isn''t, and as I don''t know wether you would be oftended by it or not by my impression, I will keep that to myself.  Exceptional, a 10!', '2002-12-09 16:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(168040, 9482, 3459, '<td valign="top">The way, a single instance is captured in this image is exceptional; and the way it is returned back into the mosaic of time, through your use of coloured background, is even more astounding!  The saturation is perfect, and the clarity is excellent.  A very fine example of what it means to be a photographer, congratulations!</td>', 'The way, a single instance is captured in this image is exceptional; and the way it is returned back into the mosaic of time, through your use of coloured background, is even more astounding!  The saturation is perfect, and the clarity is excellent.  A very fine example of what it means to be a photographer, congratulations!', '2002-12-09 16:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(168044, 9575, 3459, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  The small image size, I think complements this photograph, it adds intimacy, and creates a relationship with the snail.  Great job!</td>', 'Great composition.  The small image size, I think complements this photograph, it adds intimacy, and creates a relationship with the snail.  Great job!', '2002-12-09 16:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(168048, 9578, 3459, '<td valign="top">Beautifully seen, and presented.  The colours are exceptional, and the detail is excellent.  On the technical side, I am especially impressed with the way you were able to capture the clarity of the ice, and the full saturation of the subjects enclosed.  Excellent work!</td>', 'Beautifully seen, and presented.  The colours are exceptional, and the detail is excellent.  On the technical side, I am especially impressed with the way you were able to capture the clarity of the ice, and the full saturation of the subjects enclosed.  Excellent work!', '2002-12-09 16:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(168053, 9313, 3459, '<td valign="top">Great choice of subject and background, as well a very appealing overall composition.  I am a bit surprised at the way you lighted this shot, for me personally, if you removed the shadow on the left side the image would be flawless.  Great effort, nevertheless.</td>', 'Great choice of subject and background, as well a very appealing overall composition.  I am a bit surprised at the way you lighted this shot, for me personally, if you removed the shadow on the left side the image would be flawless.  Great effort, nevertheless.', '2002-12-09 16:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(168080, 9313, 327, '<td valign="top">Well, my knee jerk reaction is .....I wish this was turned so I could see the plug. On longer look--- I think I see why you shot it like this. The color, focus, background, DOF are all good. I just think the composition could of been different. |&lt;?&gt;</td>', 'Well, my knee jerk reaction is .....I wish this was turned so I could see the plug. On longer look--- I think I see why you shot it like this. The color, focus, background, DOF are all good. I just think the composition could of been different. |<?>', '2002-12-09 16:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(168082, 9447, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty blue eyes, pretty skin, hair.....my gosh, she is lovely. Sweet. This is a good portrait, casual, relaxed, lovely natural model. WOW. Like it. Good color and composition.<br/>The light could of been bumped up a bit, but ya know it''s nice. Justine</td>', 'Pretty blue eyes, pretty skin, hair.....my gosh, she is lovely. Sweet. This is a good portrait, casual, relaxed, lovely natural model. WOW. Like it. Good color and composition.The light could of been bumped up a bit, but ya know it''s nice. Justine', '2002-12-09 16:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(168086, 9485, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice shot....I wish the man would of been a little lighter. Good focus, composition.</td>', 'Nice shot....I wish the man would of been a little lighter. Good focus, composition.', '2002-12-09 16:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(168088, 9495, 327, '<td valign="top">Happy Holiday to you also. Nice. Love shots of lights and this one is very colorful.</td>', 'Happy Holiday to you also. Nice. Love shots of lights and this one is very colorful.', '2002-12-09 16:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
