(168170, 9417, 327, '<td valign="top">Wonderful portrait of a cute dog. Good work. Might of cropped this tighter there is a lot of dead space. Also I''d of like to have been a little closer to this sweet dog. Golden? Wonderful face, loyal friend.</td>', 'Wonderful portrait of a cute dog. Good work. Might of cropped this tighter there is a lot of dead space. Also I''d of like to have been a little closer to this sweet dog. Golden? Wonderful face, loyal friend.', '2002-12-09 17:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
