(168177, 9521, 2302, '<td valign="top">Great catch if this is someone that you did not have pose. I love how the background photo frames the portrait. Great color, great lighting. The white sections are a bit distracting but cropping them out would have meant a loss of more important elements of the shot.</td>', 'Great catch if this is someone that you did not have pose. I love how the background photo frames the portrait. Great color, great lighting. The white sections are a bit distracting but cropping them out would have meant a loss of more important elements of the shot.', '2002-12-09 17:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
