(168181, 9298, 327, '<td valign="top">Not crazy for the structure on the left here.....did we need that in the shot? .....Or maybe should of had more of it? The colors are fantastic and the sky is wonderful. The focus is soft for my liking.</td>', 'Not crazy for the structure on the left here.....did we need that in the shot? .....Or maybe should of had more of it? The colors are fantastic and the sky is wonderful. The focus is soft for my liking.', '2002-12-09 17:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(168182, 9568, 2302, '<td valign="top">Nice framing - great catch with the bird flying by. I wish there were a bit more lighting on the statue - or perhaps just taken from a different angle to catch more of the details. Perhaps shot from directly in front or on the side? That might have introduced unwanted features in the background for you though. Overall I like the idea but the shot is just a bit too dark for my taste. = 6</td>', 'Nice framing - great catch with the bird flying by. I wish there were a bit more lighting on the statue - or perhaps just taken from a different angle to catch more of the details. Perhaps shot from directly in front or on the side? That might have introduced unwanted features in the background for you though. Overall I like the idea but the shot is just a bit too dark for my taste. = 6', '2002-12-09 17:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(168183, 9522, 327, '<td valign="top">Hum. I think this shot is okay but has room for improvement. The fact that the left is cut off bothers me. The top is cut off too short. Also the shot is not sitting straight.The light, focus are okay.</td>', 'Hum. I think this shot is okay but has room for improvement. The fact that the left is cut off bothers me. The top is cut off too short. Also the shot is not sitting straight.The light, focus are okay.', '2002-12-09 17:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
