(168221, 9436, 4388, '<td valign="top">very nice composition and good exposure.  i like that the tree is included. it looks like there is some kind of white effects around the claws and the two things on top of the snow, but it''s not real bad. i wonder if the tail got that way because you startled the squirrel. good color with the pink nose and white snow. goodtempo</td>', 'very nice composition and good exposure.  i like that the tree is included. it looks like there is some kind of white effects around the claws and the two things on top of the snow, but it''s not real bad. i wonder if the tail got that way because you startled the squirrel. good color with the pink nose and white snow. goodtempo', '2002-12-09 18:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(168223, 9340, 4388, '<td valign="top">it looks like you may have used the flash on the camera because of the single light reflection on the bead in the center and because of the shadow.  the shadow keeps it from looking like an eye, but i don''t know how else you would have done it with other reflections and all using more than one light source.  composition and color is good. the overall picture doesn''t have that wow effect for a high score.</td>', 'it looks like you may have used the flash on the camera because of the single light reflection on the bead in the center and because of the shadow.  the shadow keeps it from looking like an eye, but i don''t know how else you would have done it with other reflections and all using more than one light source.  composition and color is good. the overall picture doesn''t have that wow effect for a high score.', '2002-12-09 19:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
