(168339, 9417, 4811, '<td valign="top">I know people think pets are overdone, but you can''t complain if the photo is done well, and this shot has a lot going for it...A distraction free background coupled with a great expression! Focus seems a little blurry at the tip of the nose, perhaps everywhere, could be an effect of post-editing? Still great shot! Nice gleam in the eye too. Can''t vote but it would have been an 8.</td>', 'I know people think pets are overdone, but you can''t complain if the photo is done well, and this shot has a lot going for it...A distraction free background coupled with a great expression! Focus seems a little blurry at the tip of the nose, perhaps everywhere, could be an effect of post-editing? Still great shot! Nice gleam in the eye too. Can''t vote but it would have been an 8.', '2002-12-09 20:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(168340, 9510, 2634, '<td valign="top">beautiful little boy..nice focus. the only thing i would change is to take it with a different background. the horizontal lines have a slight distraction. being that it might not have been possible, you did a great job with the DOF to blur the background to a maximum.</td>', 'beautiful little boy..nice focus. the only thing i would change is to take it with a different background. the horizontal lines have a slight distraction. being that it might not have been possible, you did a great job with the DOF to blur the background to a maximum.', '2002-12-09 20:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(168344, 9550, 2634, '<td valign="top">first thing i thought of is my gerbils would have a field day! I hope you didn''t glue those all on!<br/>Very interesting pic.</td>', 'first thing i thought of is my gerbils would have a field day! I hope you didn''t glue those all on!Very interesting pic.', '2002-12-09 20:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
