(168347, 9552, 554, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful, high quality photo which I like a lot.  The only change I would make is to crop slightly lower on top. I find the brownish spot on the top slightly distracting.</td>', 'This is a beautiful, high quality photo which I like a lot.  The only change I would make is to crop slightly lower on top. I find the brownish spot on the top slightly distracting.', '2002-12-09 20:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
