(168354, 9585, 4388, '<td valign="top">nice background to compliment the facial tones. good lighting. would like to see a little more of her chin, might be cropped a little too much but overall a very nice picture.</td>', 'nice background to compliment the facial tones. good lighting. would like to see a little more of her chin, might be cropped a little too much but overall a very nice picture.', '2002-12-09 20:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
