(168483, 9494, 4162, '<td valign="top">Just wondering why you chose to use B/W, would have thought that there would be some interesting colours here. Overall the picture is a bright bright, could do with darkening a bit.  Good Luck</td>', 'Just wondering why you chose to use B/W, would have thought that there would be some interesting colours here. Overall the picture is a bright bright, could do with darkening a bit.  Good Luck', '2002-12-09 21:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
