(168486, 9482, 2302, '<td valign="top">Very cool! Is this different color oils on the water to create the effect? Or something under the water? Either way this shot = 10</td>', 'Very cool! Is this different color oils on the water to create the effect? Or something under the water? Either way this shot = 10', '2002-12-09 21:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(168487, 9436, 4625, '<td valign="top">The color might have been upped a little too much, it seems to have blotches of really bright colors where they shouldn''t be. also a bit grainy, but overall not bad.</td>', 'The color might have been upped a little too much, it seems to have blotches of really bright colors where they shouldn''t be. also a bit grainy, but overall not bad.', '2002-12-09 21:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(168488, 9521, 4162, '<td valign="top">Excellent candid! The picture behind him really is great, perfect positioning! Good Luck!</td>', 'Excellent candid! The picture behind him really is great, perfect positioning! Good Luck!', '2002-12-09 21:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(168490, 9546, 4625, '<td valign="top">Great silhouette shot. I like how you can see the buildings behind the tree. The Antennas on those buildings add to the shot a lot. Overall great picture.</td>', 'Great silhouette shot. I like how you can see the buildings behind the tree. The Antennas on those buildings add to the shot a lot. Overall great picture.', '2002-12-09 21:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(168493, 9506, 4625, '<td valign="top">Overall a little on the dark side. It seems to suit the picture well, but make it a bit hard to see some of the detail.</td>', 'Overall a little on the dark side. It seems to suit the picture well, but make it a bit hard to see some of the detail.', '2002-12-09 21:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(168498, 9402, 2302, '<td valign="top">I love the red light around the back that can be seen under the arm. The only drawback for me is that the skintone and background are too similar in tone and almost blend - although you may have intended that so I won''t take away for it. The shadow on the shoulder is a bit distracting. Interesting shot = 7</td>', 'I love the red light around the back that can be seen under the arm. The only drawback for me is that the skintone and background are too similar in tone and almost blend - although you may have intended that so I won''t take away for it. The shadow on the shoulder is a bit distracting. Interesting shot = 7', '2002-12-09 21:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(168499, 9521, 4625, '<td valign="top">Great candid. Posed perfectly against the background image. How do you go about getting candids like this? Do you ask permission to use their picture afterward? What if they notice you taking their picture? I never seem to have the guts to take this sort of picture. Overall great picture, well done.</td>', 'Great candid. Posed perfectly against the background image. How do you go about getting candids like this? Do you ask permission to use their picture afterward? What if they notice you taking their picture? I never seem to have the guts to take this sort of picture. Overall great picture, well done.', '2002-12-09 21:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(168501, 9436, 4162, '<td valign="top">Adorable! What a great capture and lovely colours.  Not sure about the tree, but it does show him in his environment.  Good Luck</td>', 'Adorable! What a great capture and lovely colours.  Not sure about the tree, but it does show him in his environment.  Good Luck', '2002-12-09 21:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(168503, 9388, 4625, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit, looks great. The dark shadows make for a great picture. Well done.</td>', 'Nicely lit, looks great. The dark shadows make for a great picture. Well done.', '2002-12-09 21:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(168505, 9586, 2302, '<td valign="top">I would have prefered this moved up in the frame just a bit. I like the idea but the colors don''t do much for me. =6</td>', 'I would have prefered this moved up in the frame just a bit. I like the idea but the colors don''t do much for me. =6', '2002-12-09 21:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
