(168521, 9497, 4625, '<td valign="top">Really grainy. I''m guessing digital zoom? It''d be a really nice picture if not for the grain.</td>', 'Really grainy. I''m guessing digital zoom? It''d be a really nice picture if not for the grain.', '2002-12-09 21:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
