(168534, 9501, 4625, '<td valign="top">I love the DOF in this shot. The only things in focus are the leaves and a bit of the twig and it looks great. The background is blurred nicely, not so blurry that we can''t tell what it is, but not clear so to take away from the main interest in the picture. Well done. Also the shadow the back leaf makes on the front one adds a lot to this shot.</td>', 'I love the DOF in this shot. The only things in focus are the leaves and a bit of the twig and it looks great. The background is blurred nicely, not so blurry that we can''t tell what it is, but not clear so to take away from the main interest in the picture. Well done. Also the shadow the back leaf makes on the front one adds a lot to this shot.', '2002-12-09 21:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(168538, 9336, 4162, '<td valign="top">Great colours here, this would make a good xmas card</td>', 'Great colours here, this would make a good xmas card', '2002-12-09 21:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(168540, 9402, 4625, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. I like the lighting a great deal. the green and red are done wonderfully. those two yellow bulbs take away from the christmas green and red theme though. I think I would have liked it more if those yellows weren''t yellow.</td>', 'Interesting shot. I like the lighting a great deal. the green and red are done wonderfully. those two yellow bulbs take away from the christmas green and red theme though. I think I would have liked it more if those yellows weren''t yellow.', '2002-12-09 21:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
