(168546, 9482, 2123, '<td valign="top">GREAT shot.  All of the colors captured in the drop are wonderful, it was a great idea and was executed very, very well.  The bottom of the shot is maybe a tad dark, but it doesn''t detract from the overall effect. 10!</td>', 'GREAT shot.  All of the colors captured in the drop are wonderful, it was a great idea and was executed very, very well.  The bottom of the shot is maybe a tad dark, but it doesn''t detract from the overall effect. 10!', '2002-12-09 21:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(168548, 9485, 4625, '<td valign="top">Great picture. Slight bit of grainyness picked up in the white at the top of the arch. Other than that, which is far from terrible, the picture is wonderful. Great composition, and I like what you did with the given lighting.</td>', 'Great picture. Slight bit of grainyness picked up in the white at the top of the arch. Other than that, which is far from terrible, the picture is wonderful. Great composition, and I like what you did with the given lighting.', '2002-12-09 21:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(168555, 9379, 4625, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I care for the angle. The tree on the bottom right is distracting, it might have looked better if the tree were on the right side, with less showing on the left, but I''m not sure. If the tree wasn''t in this picture at all it''d be wonderful. I do like the reflection of the tree on the stone though.</td>', 'I''m not sure I care for the angle. The tree on the bottom right is distracting, it might have looked better if the tree were on the right side, with less showing on the left, but I''m not sure. If the tree wasn''t in this picture at all it''d be wonderful. I do like the reflection of the tree on the stone though.', '2002-12-09 22:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(168557, 9501, 2123, '<td valign="top">I love the light coming through the leaves, the composition is excellent and the DOF works very well.  I had you at an eight but I believe I''m bumping you to a 9. :-)</td>', 'I love the light coming through the leaves, the composition is excellent and the DOF works very well.  I had you at an eight but I believe I''m bumping you to a 9. :-)', '2002-12-09 22:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(168561, 9568, 4625, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit out of focus overall. Neither the trees, nor the angle are clearly in focus. A higher crop, with less, or even none of the building showing would have looked a bit better in my opinion.</td>', 'Seems a bit out of focus overall. Neither the trees, nor the angle are clearly in focus. A higher crop, with less, or even none of the building showing would have looked a bit better in my opinion.', '2002-12-09 22:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(168563, 9575, 2123, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...why so small?  I have no idea how you managed to get the snail to do that (it is real isn''t it??) but it''s a very clever and well executed shot.  The focus on the fork seems a bit soft, but doesn''t detract overall.</td>', 'Hmmm...why so small?  I have no idea how you managed to get the snail to do that (it is real isn''t it??) but it''s a very clever and well executed shot.  The focus on the fork seems a bit soft, but doesn''t detract overall.', '2002-12-09 22:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(168567, 9582, 4625, '<td valign="top">Outsanding. The only thing I could complain about is that one piece of that one branch that isn''t in focus. The bulb looks amazing against the white though, and the white is really white, I like that a lot. The branch on the top right side looks cut (which I''m sure it is) but it would have looked better if it was more natural looking. Overall amazing excellent shot.</td>', 'Outsanding. The only thing I could complain about is that one piece of that one branch that isn''t in focus. The bulb looks amazing against the white though, and the white is really white, I like that a lot. The branch on the top right side looks cut (which I''m sure it is) but it would have looked better if it was more natural looking. Overall amazing excellent shot.', '2002-12-09 22:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(168573, 9336, 4625, '<td valign="top">Nice abstraction. I''m not sure about the cropping and positioning though. I think I would have liked to see at least one point on teh outter star completely.</td>', 'Nice abstraction. I''m not sure about the cropping and positioning though. I think I would have liked to see at least one point on teh outter star completely.', '2002-12-09 22:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(168586, 9578, 4625, '<td valign="top">I don''t think a border was needed for this picture, but it doesn''t take away from it either. Incredible photo. The color is amazing and I just love it. in looking for a flaw the only thing I could possibly complain about is the focus on the drop of water about to fall from the icicle. None the less this picture certainly makes me say wow. Well done.</td>', 'I don''t think a border was needed for this picture, but it doesn''t take away from it either. Incredible photo. The color is amazing and I just love it. in looking for a flaw the only thing I could possibly complain about is the focus on the drop of water about to fall from the icicle. None the less this picture certainly makes me say wow. Well done.', '2002-12-09 22:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(168587, 9568, 4388, '<td valign="top">nice composition, i would like it better if there were more color saturation and maybe some more clarity.</td>', 'nice composition, i would like it better if there were more color saturation and maybe some more clarity.', '2002-12-09 22:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
