(168597, 9538, 4625, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. The angle of the pipes is well done. Did you try this shot with a sepia tone instead of black and white? I think that could have looked good as well. Overall well done.</td>', 'Nice composition. The angle of the pipes is well done. Did you try this shot with a sepia tone instead of black and white? I think that could have looked good as well. Overall well done.', '2002-12-09 22:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
