(168605, 9447, 4625, '<td valign="top">Looks great, but seems a little too soft around the necklace. I like the light reflection in the beeds of the necklace. She''s a pretty girl and makes for a pretty picture. Nicely posed, and cropped to look great. Well done.</td>', 'Looks great, but seems a little too soft around the necklace. I like the light reflection in the beeds of the necklace. She''s a pretty girl and makes for a pretty picture. Nicely posed, and cropped to look great. Well done.', '2002-12-09 22:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
