(168615, 9450, 4625, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I like the composition, and the cropping is nice. The only flaws (which might be in the guitar itself) is that mark to the left of the strings on the wood, and a spec of dust in the back section on the right. none the less excellent picture.</td>', 'Great shot. I like the composition, and the cropping is nice. The only flaws (which might be in the guitar itself) is that mark to the left of the strings on the wood, and a spec of dust in the back section on the right. none the less excellent picture.', '2002-12-09 22:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(168622, 9552, 4625, '<td valign="top">The focus seems a bit blurred on teh left side of the leaf. I like the picture''s set up, but the contrast between light and dark seems a bit harsh, probably because of what parts of the leaf were wet, and what parts weren''t. overall not bad.</td>', 'The focus seems a bit blurred on teh left side of the leaf. I like the picture''s set up, but the contrast between light and dark seems a bit harsh, probably because of what parts of the leaf were wet, and what parts weren''t. overall not bad.', '2002-12-09 22:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(168625, 9543, 2302, '<td valign="top">I like how the swirl in the wood frames this shot. The colors or lack of color emphasize the age and helps bring out the detail. I am left wondering what is in the middle part though and that area is what draws my attention most. I wish there was a bit more depth because of that. = 7</td>', 'I like how the swirl in the wood frames this shot. The colors or lack of color emphasize the age and helps bring out the detail. I am left wondering what is in the middle part though and that area is what draws my attention most. I wish there was a bit more depth because of that. = 7', '2002-12-09 22:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(168627, 9495, 4625, '<td valign="top">I can''t say I''ve really seen a christmas light picture I''ve liked... Until now. The only flaw in this one is the lights in the far distance that aren''t christmas lights. I absolutely love how you can''t see anything but the lights themselves, and how those lights define the objects they''re on. Great shot.</td>', 'I can''t say I''ve really seen a christmas light picture I''ve liked... Until now. The only flaw in this one is the lights in the far distance that aren''t christmas lights. I absolutely love how you can''t see anything but the lights themselves, and how those lights define the objects they''re on. Great shot.', '2002-12-09 22:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(168629, 9558, 4625, '<td valign="top">Blury, and grainy. If it was in clear focus and not grainy I think I would have liked the picture. Probably limitation of the camera, but the shot just isn''t clear.</td>', 'Blury, and grainy. If it was in clear focus and not grainy I think I would have liked the picture. Probably limitation of the camera, but the shot just isn''t clear.', '2002-12-09 22:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
