(168722, 9582, 714, '<td valign="top">I love this because of the white background, but you probably know I do because of my blue submission.  I love your choice of the red bulb and the green pine tree.  This is a big fat 10 in my eyes. I would love to have this as a christmas card.  The lighting is great.  I like how the lighting turned the bulb yellowy orange. Perfect framing.  Lovely shot!</td>', 'I love this because of the white background, but you probably know I do because of my blue submission.  I love your choice of the red bulb and the green pine tree.  This is a big fat 10 in my eyes. I would love to have this as a christmas card.  The lighting is great.  I like how the lighting turned the bulb yellowy orange. Perfect framing.  Lovely shot!', '2002-12-09 23:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(168725, 9315, 2302, '<td valign="top">What kind of flower is this? Very pretty. I really like this in b/w as the contrasts are very striking. My only suggestion might be to remove one of the flowers - somehow odd numbers seem to make better groupings than evens. =9</td>', 'What kind of flower is this? Very pretty. I really like this in b/w as the contrasts are very striking. My only suggestion might be to remove one of the flowers - somehow odd numbers seem to make better groupings than evens. =9', '2002-12-09 23:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
