(168984, 9450, 51167, '<td valign="top">very great angle on this shot.  Nice composition.</td>', 'very great angle on this shot.  Nice composition.', '2002-12-10 02:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(168985, 9390, 3080, '<td valign="top">Love this photo!  I really like the darkness portrayed in the shot.  The angle and framing/cropping are great too...oh...HAHA.  It''s my shot! (just being silly and seeing if this "comment on your own photo" thing works.</td>', 'Love this photo!  I really like the darkness portrayed in the shot.  The angle and framing/cropping are great too...oh...HAHA.  It''s my shot! (just being silly and seeing if this "comment on your own photo" thing works.', '2002-12-10 02:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(168998, 9388, 1031, '<td valign="top">The way the image is lost in the corners bothers me  little (maybe an almost-square crop would help), but I like the overall idea and execution -- good use of mundane subject.</td>', 'The way the image is lost in the corners bothers me  little (maybe an almost-square crop would help), but I like the overall idea and execution -- good use of mundane subject.', '2002-12-10 02:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(169057, 9450, 3540, '<td valign="top">I don''t like that there is background here.  I think I would''ve cropped it out completely, or if it was interesting enough, like backstage or something, shown it a little more.  Good crisp clear photo though.  The quality is definitely there. - Inspzil</td>', 'I don''t like that there is background here.  I think I would''ve cropped it out completely, or if it was interesting enough, like backstage or something, shown it a little more.  Good crisp clear photo though.  The quality is definitely there. - Inspzil', '2002-12-10 07:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(169058, 9521, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is a great candid shot.  I love the profile in the background surrounding the subject''s profile. - Inspzil</td>', 'This is a great candid shot.  I love the profile in the background surrounding the subject''s profile. - Inspzil', '2002-12-10 07:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(169059, 9386, 3540, '<td valign="top">I''m not fond of the graininess of this pic.  The contrast looks like it could be turned up some to make the black part of the photo more black.  - Inspzil</td>', 'I''m not fond of the graininess of this pic.  The contrast looks like it could be turned up some to make the black part of the photo more black.  - Inspzil', '2002-12-10 07:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(169060, 9473, 3540, '<td valign="top">Those are some interesting xmas colors.  We usually have red and green :)  Good luck - Inspzil</td>', 'Those are some interesting xmas colors.  We usually have red and green :)  Good luck - Inspzil', '2002-12-10 07:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(169061, 9345, 3540, '<td valign="top">Nice Macro.  I like the texture on the links.  The colors look great too. - Inspzil</td>', 'Nice Macro.  I like the texture on the links.  The colors look great too. - Inspzil', '2002-12-10 07:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(169070, 9578, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photo.. the detail in the ice is phenomenal.  This is a good strong 10... - setzler</td>', 'This is a beautiful photo.. the detail in the ice is phenomenal.  This is a good strong 10... - setzler', '2002-12-10 08:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(169076, 9566, 4615, '<td valign="top">Her red cheeks and the circle of white around the eyes give the face almost a mask like quality.  The stark white of the shirt takes attention away from the face,  which should  be primary.  the lightly clenched fist is interesting too.</td>', 'Her red cheeks and the circle of white around the eyes give the face almost a mask like quality.  The stark white of the shirt takes attention away from the face,  which should  be primary.  the lightly clenched fist is interesting too.', '2002-12-10 08:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(169079, 9575, 4615, '<td valign="top">I''d like this bigger!</td>', 'I''d like this bigger!', '2002-12-10 08:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(169088, 9566, 2302, '<td valign="top">This is a nice candid. = 6  Good capture of expression. The lighting makes the features very soft and the shot has a dark feel to it that is brightened by the stark contrast of the white shirt. The head in the lower right is a bit distracting but cropping that out would cause you to lose the womans hands.</td>', 'This is a nice candid. = 6  Good capture of expression. The lighting makes the features very soft and the shot has a dark feel to it that is brightened by the stark contrast of the white shirt. The head in the lower right is a bit distracting but cropping that out would cause you to lose the womans hands.', '2002-12-10 08:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(169089, 9497, 2302, '<td valign="top">I love the blured background here. The details on the finch don''t seem to be very strong though. It seems like the focus could be adjusted slightly to bring out more definition in the feathers. I like the framing of the branch and how the bird almost remains in the lower left half of the photo. Very nice = 7</td>', 'I love the blured background here. The details on the finch don''t seem to be very strong though. It seems like the focus could be adjusted slightly to bring out more definition in the feathers. I like the framing of the branch and how the bird almost remains in the lower left half of the photo. Very nice = 7', '2002-12-10 08:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(169092, 9551, 2302, '<td valign="top">I like the way the wires towards the top almost seem to warp or ripple in this shot. The upper left corner is a bit distracting because there is wire mesh doesn''t go all the way to the edge - moving in just a tad might have helped, or cropping the shot a bit more on the left. I like the detail captured in the chipped paint and the feeling of perspecive this gives. = 6</td>', 'I like the way the wires towards the top almost seem to warp or ripple in this shot. The upper left corner is a bit distracting because there is wire mesh doesn''t go all the way to the edge - moving in just a tad might have helped, or cropping the shot a bit more on the left. I like the detail captured in the chipped paint and the feeling of perspecive this gives. = 6', '2002-12-10 08:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(169093, 9491, 4615, '<td valign="top">It''s not a comment on your skills as a photographer, this is a well taken photo.  Tto me the pose is highly inappropriate for a child.  This is very clearly imitative of adult fashion, even soft porn, shoots.  A 20 year old posed in the same way, wearing suspenders with no shirt, with the same expression, would be considered a sexy shot.  The expression is just not natural for a child, the effect is quite disconcerting.</td>', 'It''s not a comment on your skills as a photographer, this is a well taken photo.  Tto me the pose is highly inappropriate for a child.  This is very clearly imitative of adult fashion, even soft porn, shoots.  A 20 year old posed in the same way, wearing suspenders with no shirt, with the same expression, would be considered a sexy shot.  The expression is just not natural for a child, the effect is quite disconcerting.', '2002-12-10 08:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(169095, 9463, 2302, '<td valign="top">I think the sliced lemon would have made a more interesting object to have in the front. I like the seeds that have come out, but they almost get lost in the shadows. There is nice detail here and good focus - I like that the back lemon is slightly blured. Good composition. = 7</td>', 'I think the sliced lemon would have made a more interesting object to have in the front. I like the seeds that have come out, but they almost get lost in the shadows. There is nice detail here and good focus - I like that the back lemon is slightly blured. Good composition. = 7', '2002-12-10 08:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(169097, 9336, 2302, '<td valign="top">Nice vibrant colors - good compostion. I can''t think of anything to recommend about this shot, but overall it doesn''t do much for me. I am curious to read the description on this one.  = 6</td>', 'Nice vibrant colors - good compostion. I can''t think of anything to recommend about this shot, but overall it doesn''t do much for me. I am curious to read the description on this one.  = 6', '2002-12-10 08:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(169101, 9369, 4615, '<td valign="top">cute.  Would make a great xmas card.</td>', 'cute.  Would make a great xmas card.', '2002-12-10 09:03:18.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(169102, 9561, 4615, '<td valign="top">Ironically, they look like xmas decorations, and the whole thing would not look out of place on a Xmas card, or even blown up and turned into wrapping paper.  Hmmmm, now thats an interesting idea....</td>', 'Ironically, they look like xmas decorations, and the whole thing would not look out of place on a Xmas card, or even blown up and turned into wrapping paper.  Hmmmm, now thats an interesting idea....', '2002-12-10 09:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(169103, 9447, 4615, '<td valign="top">Not Chastity?</td>', 'Not Chastity?', '2002-12-10 09:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(169104, 9491, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is a marvelous portrait.  I love the fact that she is entering the photograph from the side, instead of the standard "head-on" shot.  Your model is adorable to boot :-)</td>', 'This is a marvelous portrait.  I love the fact that she is entering the photograph from the side, instead of the standard "head-on" shot.  Your model is adorable to boot :-)', '2002-12-10 09:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(169107, 9503, 4615, '<td valign="top">How true...</td>', 'How true...', '2002-12-10 09:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(169109, 9543, 1024, '<td valign="top">This photograph shows a wonderful sense of "place" (if that makes any sense).  I think the one small improvement that could be made is to have "something" showing through the hole in the middle, maybe a persons sillhouette. That would make it into a doorway or window.... Nice use of Black and White.</td>', 'This photograph shows a wonderful sense of "place" (if that makes any sense).  I think the one small improvement that could be made is to have "something" showing through the hole in the middle, maybe a persons sillhouette. That would make it into a doorway or window.... Nice use of Black and White.', '2002-12-10 09:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(169153, 9482, 5475, '<td valign="top">The colors are great in this and makes it a really ineresting stop-motion.  Without the colors, this would be a fairly typical, been-there, done-that stop motion.  Your lighting is perfect, not hot spots to speak of.  Great job!</td>', 'The colors are great in this and makes it a really ineresting stop-motion.  Without the colors, this would be a fairly typical, been-there, done-that stop motion.  Your lighting is perfect, not hot spots to speak of.  Great job!', '2002-12-10 10:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(169154, 9367, 5475, '<td valign="top">I really like the patterns here, with the Christmas decorations repeating the architectural pattern.  I like the circle off center in the upper right, but I think I would have liked a little more space to the right and above the green circle.  Nice job with the lighting!</td>', 'I really like the patterns here, with the Christmas decorations repeating the architectural pattern.  I like the circle off center in the upper right, but I think I would have liked a little more space to the right and above the green circle.  Nice job with the lighting!', '2002-12-10 10:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(169155, 9345, 5475, '<td valign="top">Great details, and an interesting composition.  Well done!  Smellyfish1002</td>', 'Great details, and an interesting composition.  Well done!  Smellyfish1002', '2002-12-10 10:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(169156, 9482, 4482, '<td valign="top">OOOOOOOOOOooooooo... and I though by blue drop was goooood.  ;o)</td>', 'OOOOOOOOOOooooooo... and I though by blue drop was goooood.  ;o)', '2002-12-10 10:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(169157, 9583, 5475, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors and composition.  The only thing I would try to improve on are the white reflections at thte top of the stem.  These are a little distracting.  A very nice shot overall.  Good job!</td>', 'Very nice colors and composition.  The only thing I would try to improve on are the white reflections at thte top of the stem.  These are a little distracting.  A very nice shot overall.  Good job!', '2002-12-10 10:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(169159, 9465, 5475, '<td valign="top">This is very simple, but I like it.  I think it''s the position of your eyes.  If you had been looking straight forward, I don''t believe this shot would have had the same appeal.  Good job with the lighting.  No hotspots!</td>', 'This is very simple, but I like it.  I think it''s the position of your eyes.  If you had been looking straight forward, I don''t believe this shot would have had the same appeal.  Good job with the lighting.  No hotspots!', '2002-12-10 10:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(169161, 9582, 5475, '<td valign="top">The tones of red and orange in the ornament are amazing.  Overall, I feel all of the white area is a little stark.  A little more greenery may help (IMO).  The loss of DOF in the greenery overlapping the ball is a little distracting.  I think you have a great concept here, and your lighting of the ornament is perfect.  I''d try a few more shots with different greenery.</td>', 'The tones of red and orange in the ornament are amazing.  Overall, I feel all of the white area is a little stark.  A little more greenery may help (IMO).  The loss of DOF in the greenery overlapping the ball is a little distracting.  I think you have a great concept here, and your lighting of the ornament is perfect.  I''d try a few more shots with different greenery.', '2002-12-10 10:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(169163, 9546, 5475, '<td valign="top">I like your concept of the tree sillohetted against the cloudy sky, but the buildings don''t fit with the title of Harsh lands.  Can you shoot this from an angle to exclude the buildings?  I also like that you did this in BW!</td>', 'I like your concept of the tree sillohetted against the cloudy sky, but the buildings don''t fit with the title of Harsh lands.  Can you shoot this from an angle to exclude the buildings?  I also like that you did this in BW!', '2002-12-10 10:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(169180, 9369, 772, '<td valign="top">beautiful photo and excellent lighting as well... very nice job with the background.. I love the soft gradient... = 10 - setzler</td>', 'beautiful photo and excellent lighting as well... very nice job with the background.. I love the soft gradient... = 10 - setzler', '2002-12-10 11:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(169181, 9582, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent shot :)  I love the composition here... the only minor issue that catches my eye here is the pine twig that is out of focus in near the ball.. maybe a little more depth of field would fix that up.  Since the marjority of this image is in focus, I believe it would work better with all of it nice and sharp... good work :) - setzler</td>', 'This is an excellent shot :)  I love the composition here... the only minor issue that catches my eye here is the pine twig that is out of focus in near the ball.. maybe a little more depth of field would fix that up.  Since the marjority of this image is in focus, I believe it would work better with all of it nice and sharp... good work :) - setzler', '2002-12-10 11:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(169183, 9345, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent shot... love the diagonal... the detail is excellent as well :) - setzler</td>', 'excellent shot... love the diagonal... the detail is excellent as well :) - setzler', '2002-12-10 11:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(169184, 9546, 3459, '<td valign="top">The use of silouets makes the mood match the title exactly.  Positioning of the elements and the tonal gradation of the sky are great.  A perfect choice of subject for B&amp;W photography.  A very good job, congratulations!</td>', 'The use of silouets makes the mood match the title exactly.  Positioning of the elements and the tonal gradation of the sky are great.  A perfect choice of subject for B&W photography.  A very good job, congratulations!', '2002-12-10 11:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(169189, 9566, 3459, '<td valign="top">This is a true photojournalistic image!   The expression, mood, and involvement are pricessless.  Thechnically, I am very impressed with the use of available light, as well as the detail of the main subject, and the just right DOF.  Congratulations!</td>', 'This is a true photojournalistic image!   The expression, mood, and involvement are pricessless.  Thechnically, I am very impressed with the use of available light, as well as the detail of the main subject, and the just right DOF.  Congratulations!', '2002-12-10 11:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(169193, 9543, 4055, '<td valign="top">I like this very much. Very interesting. You can look over and over again and find new things. Perhaps a little too hard for my taste (really don´t know if you say so in English - it means that the contrast is too high). It isn´t that much, just a little. Overall a very good photo with great composition. (9)</td>', 'I like this very much. Very interesting. You can look over and over again and find new things. Perhaps a little too hard for my taste (really don´t know if you say so in English - it means that the contrast is too high). It isn´t that much, just a little. Overall a very good photo with great composition. (9)', '2002-12-10 11:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(169194, 9561, 326, '<td valign="top">Cool shot!</td>', 'Cool shot!', '2002-12-10 11:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(169197, 9452, 4055, '<td valign="top">Great Still life photo. Nice colours and good composition. The lighting is perfect. (8)</td>', 'Great Still life photo. Nice colours and good composition. The lighting is perfect. (8)', '2002-12-10 11:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(169198, 9546, 714, '<td valign="top">Very nice b/w shot.  I love the tree.</td>', 'Very nice b/w shot.  I love the tree.', '2002-12-10 11:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(169199, 9578, 714, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome shot.  I love the red leaf frozen.  Very nice colours and textures. Great focus.</td>', 'This is an awesome shot.  I love the red leaf frozen.  Very nice colours and textures. Great focus.', '2002-12-10 11:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(169200, 9402, 326, '<td valign="top">Different....I like it! Good job</td>', 'Different....I like it! Good job', '2002-12-10 11:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(169201, 9567, 3459, '<td valign="top">What a great image, the detail is amazing, the reds of the sunset are astounding.  Persoanally, I am not a big fan of sunsets, however this one is very beautiful.  Good job!</td>', 'What a great image, the detail is amazing, the reds of the sunset are astounding.  Persoanally, I am not a big fan of sunsets, however this one is very beautiful.  Good job!', '2002-12-10 11:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(169202, 9495, 714, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors.  The framing is good, Nice Dof.</td>', 'Very nice colors.  The framing is good, Nice Dof.', '2002-12-10 11:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(169203, 9485, 714, '<td valign="top">Nice, beautiful, soft picture.  It tells a story.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice, beautiful, soft picture.  It tells a story.  Good job.', '2002-12-10 11:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(169204, 9396, 3459, '<td valign="top">Great composition, and wonderful use of silouets.  I especially like the detail of the thread.  While, for me persoanally, this photograph doesn''t say anything, it is a very well executed job nevertheless.</td>', 'Great composition, and wonderful use of silouets.  I especially like the detail of the thread.  While, for me persoanally, this photograph doesn''t say anything, it is a very well executed job nevertheless.', '2002-12-10 11:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(169205, 9521, 714, '<td valign="top">I love the exspression on his face.  Very nice b/w.</td>', 'I love the exspression on his face.  Very nice b/w.', '2002-12-10 11:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(169206, 9506, 326, '<td valign="top">Just a bit to dark...</td>', 'Just a bit to dark...', '2002-12-10 11:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(169207, 9312, 714, '<td valign="top">I like the still life here, but that door really bugs me.  I do like everything else about it,  The color is good and the subject is good.</td>', 'I like the still life here, but that door really bugs me.  I do like everything else about it,  The color is good and the subject is good.', '2002-12-10 11:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(169208, 9521, 3459, '<td valign="top">I love the composition, the two contrasting faces overlaping each other; briliant!  I especially like the expressions, one of concentrated observasion, and one of calm exhosibition.  Well done with the choice of B&amp;W.  The use of available light is also very impressive.</td>', 'I love the composition, the two contrasting faces overlaping each other; briliant!  I especially like the expressions, one of concentrated observasion, and one of calm exhosibition.  Well done with the choice of B&W.  The use of available light is also very impressive.', '2002-12-10 11:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(169209, 9550, 714, '<td valign="top">Not sure what to think of this.  It really isn''t that interesting to me, but is well taken to an extent. Lighting is harsh, but I kind of like it.</td>', 'Not sure what to think of this.  It really isn''t that interesting to me, but is well taken to an extent. Lighting is harsh, but I kind of like it.', '2002-12-10 11:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(169210, 9568, 326, '<td valign="top">Pretty shot....</td>', 'Pretty shot....', '2002-12-10 11:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(169211, 9436, 3459, '<td valign="top">The choice of prespective is excellent; this image makes you relate to the subject and the environment.  The detail and colour are perfectly preserved, and do give out the wibe of a playful winter day.  Great job!</td>', 'The choice of prespective is excellent; this image makes you relate to the subject and the environment.  The detail and colour are perfectly preserved, and do give out the wibe of a playful winter day.  Great job!', '2002-12-10 11:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(169212, 9506, 3459, '<td valign="top">I think the darkness of this image, adds to (or rather creats) the mood.  Very well seen, and executed.  The one detail I would have changed, is the cut-off of the part of the lighter region of water (on the left, in the middle); to me it breaks the very pleasantly flowing shape.  A great job, nevertheless.</td>', 'I think the darkness of this image, adds to (or rather creats) the mood.  Very well seen, and executed.  The one detail I would have changed, is the cut-off of the part of the lighter region of water (on the left, in the middle); to me it breaks the very pleasantly flowing shape.  A great job, nevertheless.', '2002-12-10 11:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(169213, 9538, 326, '<td valign="top">Great job!</td>', 'Great job!', '2002-12-10 11:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(169231, 9521, 4055, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait. Perfect in b&amp;w. Good focus. Great composition. The background is OK. Overall a very good shot. (8)</td>', 'Lovely portrait. Perfect in b&w. Good focus. Great composition. The background is OK. Overall a very good shot. (8)', '2002-12-10 12:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(169233, 9388, 3459, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition, I like the colours and the black making the depth of the image visually incrediible.  I do think, this could have worked better if cropped to a squar image.</td>', 'Interesting composition, I like the colours and the black making the depth of the image visually incrediible.  I do think, this could have worked better if cropped to a squar image.', '2002-12-10 12:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(169237, 9469, 3459, '<td valign="top">Great composition, I love the red enterence into the image, and the prespeciive formed by the docks leading into the horizon.  Have you tried shooting from just before the red line?   Great job, nevertheless.</td>', 'Great composition, I love the red enterence into the image, and the prespeciive formed by the docks leading into the horizon.  Have you tried shooting from just before the red line?   Great job, nevertheless.', '2002-12-10 12:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(169240, 9485, 3459, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition, with just perfectly overexposed window.  The man in the lower right conner, is not noticable at first and then queitly appears; this is what makes this picture great, to me.  Great job!</td>', 'Wonderful composition, with just perfectly overexposed window.  The man in the lower right conner, is not noticable at first and then queitly appears; this is what makes this picture great, to me.  Great job!', '2002-12-10 12:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(169241, 9552, 3459, '<td valign="top">While personally to me composition-wise, this is an everage image; the textures, colours and clarity make it stand out.  I especially enjoyed the way the light is reflected of the water on the leaf.  Good job!</td>', 'While personally to me composition-wise, this is an everage image; the textures, colours and clarity make it stand out.  I especially enjoyed the way the light is reflected of the water on the leaf.  Good job!', '2002-12-10 12:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(169242, 9433, 3459, '<td valign="top">Very well technically executed, while composition-wise is uneventful.  Just an opinion.</td>', 'Very well technically executed, while composition-wise is uneventful.  Just an opinion.', '2002-12-10 12:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(169244, 9436, 4610, '<td valign="top">Wonderful picture, too bad I cannot vote</td>', 'Wonderful picture, too bad I cannot vote', '2002-12-10 12:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(169246, 9583, 4055, '<td valign="top">Perfect and interesting cropping. Lovely colours and background. Like the blur too. (8)</td>', 'Perfect and interesting cropping. Lovely colours and background. Like the blur too. (8)', '2002-12-10 13:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(169247, 9367, 3459, '<td valign="top">A very nice composition, especially the arangement of the pinicale of the structure in the upper right conner.  Great colours and detail as well.  I personally don''t find anything outside of the technically well done composition and execution; it is not emotional for me.  A great job, nevertheless.</td>', 'A very nice composition, especially the arangement of the pinicale of the structure in the upper right conner.  Great colours and detail as well.  I personally don''t find anything outside of the technically well done composition and execution; it is not emotional for me.  A great job, nevertheless.', '2002-12-10 13:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(169249, 9510, 3459, '<td valign="top">A beautifully captured expression of an inquering intellegent face of a child.  Excellent use of DOF.  Great job, congratulations!</td>', 'A beautifully captured expression of an inquering intellegent face of a child.  Excellent use of DOF.  Great job, congratulations!', '2002-12-10 13:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(169250, 9315, 3459, '<td valign="top">A good choice fo contrasty B&amp;W for this composition, I like the definition and the tonal range on the white flours.  Good job.</td>', 'A good choice fo contrasty B&W for this composition, I like the definition and the tonal range on the white flours.  Good job.', '2002-12-10 13:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(169253, 9485, 4055, '<td valign="top">Great composition and perfect in b&amp;w with this sepia tone.Perfect focus. Perhaps I had made it a little bit darker to see more of the window. But I´m not sure, maybe the man than would be too dark. Overall a great job. (8)</td>', 'Great composition and perfect in b&w with this sepia tone.Perfect focus. Perhaps I had made it a little bit darker to see more of the window. But I´m not sure, maybe the man than would be too dark. Overall a great job. (8)', '2002-12-10 13:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(169254, 9522, 3459, '<td valign="top">Beautfilly seen and well photographed.  Often times, one does not need to add anything to what the nature creates, but sometimes it''s that addition that really makes the picture.<br/>There is only one thing I would have changed, it''s the cut-off on the left side of the image; I would have just taken a step back (if possible) and included the whole structure.  Nevertheless, a wonderful job!</td>', 'Beautfilly seen and well photographed.  Often times, one does not need to add anything to what the nature creates, but sometimes it''s that addition that really makes the picture.There is only one thing I would have changed, it''s the cut-off on the left side of the image; I would have just taken a step back (if possible) and included the whole structure.  Nevertheless, a wonderful job!', '2002-12-10 13:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(169255, 9538, 3459, '<td valign="top">You have chosen a great B&amp;W subject and background.  The tonal gradations are great, and you''ve done a great job controling reflections.  Outside of being technically great, this image for me personally does litle emotionally.  A great image, nevertheless, congratulations!</td>', 'You have chosen a great B&W subject and background.  The tonal gradations are great, and you''ve done a great job controling reflections.  Outside of being technically great, this image for me personally does litle emotionally.  A great image, nevertheless, congratulations!', '2002-12-10 13:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(169262, 9550, 3459, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done, although I would have probably cropped the image squar.</td>', 'Very nicely done, although I would have probably cropped the image squar.', '2002-12-10 13:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(169264, 9340, 1826, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, I like the various colors in the "eye".</td>', 'Cool shot, I like the various colors in the "eye".', '2002-12-10 13:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(169265, 9586, 3459, '<td valign="top">Great job, I love the colours, and the black backround.  I personally would have named the image "Tigger" or "Panther", but that''s just me.</td>', 'Great job, I love the colours, and the black backround.  I personally would have named the image "Tigger" or "Panther", but that''s just me.', '2002-12-10 13:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
