(169272, 9463, 51167, '<td valign="top">good shot.  I like the DOF used in this.  Great background.</td>', 'good shot.  I like the DOF used in this.  Great background.', '2002-12-10 13:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(169273, 9585, 3459, '<td valign="top">Good lighting, and focus; I commend you with not going crazy with a shot DOF.  The colour of the background is a bit distracting to me.  Overall, a good job, congrats!</td>', 'Good lighting, and focus; I commend you with not going crazy with a shot DOF.  The colour of the background is a bit distracting to me.  Overall, a good job, congrats!', '2002-12-10 13:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(169274, 9501, 1826, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. :)</td>', 'Nice composition. :)', '2002-12-10 13:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(169275, 9551, 3459, '<td valign="top">Great compostion, and well executed.  There is nothing particular I like or dislike about this image.  I think the title makes me rate it a bit higher than I would otherwise.</td>', 'Great compostion, and well executed.  There is nothing particular I like or dislike about this image.  I think the title makes me rate it a bit higher than I would otherwise.', '2002-12-10 13:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(169276, 9378, 51167, '<td valign="top">great shot and detail.  Interesting idea, It has a couple bright spots. 6</td>', 'great shot and detail.  Interesting idea, It has a couple bright spots. 6', '2002-12-10 13:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(169277, 9315, 51167, '<td valign="top">Nice B&amp;W.  Good detail.  I would have liked to see it in color too,  I''ve never seen those flowers before.</td>', 'Nice B&W.  Good detail.  I would have liked to see it in color too,  I''ve never seen those flowers before.', '2002-12-10 13:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(169278, 9506, 51167, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting in this shot.  Great composition.</td>', 'Very nice lighting in this shot.  Great composition.', '2002-12-10 13:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(169279, 9433, 1826, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp with great color.</td>', 'Nice and sharp with great color.', '2002-12-10 13:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(169281, 9450, 3459, '<td valign="top">Nice clarity, and colour.  The intended compostion would have been great if you  blacked out the background (upper left conner) and reduced reflections (upper right conner).  Otherwise great.</td>', 'Nice clarity, and colour.  The intended compostion would have been great if you  blacked out the background (upper left conner) and reduced reflections (upper right conner).  Otherwise great.', '2002-12-10 13:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(169282, 9561, 3459, '<td valign="top">A very simple, but very nice composition.  I especially like how you kept the reflections on all the BB(s), straight in the center.  Good job.</td>', 'A very simple, but very nice composition.  I especially like how you kept the reflections on all the BB(s), straight in the center.  Good job.', '2002-12-10 13:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(169283, 9402, 3459, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, although I think it would have worked better in B&amp;W.  Great job, nevertheless.</td>', 'Nice composition, although I think it would have worked better in B&W.  Great job, nevertheless.', '2002-12-10 14:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(169284, 9578, 1826, '<td valign="top">This is GREAT, with perfect DOF. Nice work!</td>', 'This is GREAT, with perfect DOF. Nice work!', '2002-12-10 14:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(169286, 9521, 1826, '<td valign="top">Really like this, great capture.</td>', 'Really like this, great capture.', '2002-12-10 14:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(169287, 9345, 3459, '<td valign="top">Great compostion, what spoils it a bit for me is the lower right conner being a bit out of focus.  A great image, nevertheless.</td>', 'Great compostion, what spoils it a bit for me is the lower right conner being a bit out of focus.  A great image, nevertheless.', '2002-12-10 14:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(169288, 9575, 1826, '<td valign="top">Too funny. :)</td>', 'Too funny. :)', '2002-12-10 14:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(169289, 9485, 1024, '<td valign="top">Tis is a very powerful photograph.  First from a composition point of view, you were off center when you took it and the praying man is also off center.  That makes for a very interesting "triangle" between the man and the center of the arch.  I think the best part of this photograph is the way the light is pouring through the windows over the alter, almost as if the presence of a spirit is filling the church.  I am guessing that is the meaning of the title. Very well done.</td>', 'Tis is a very powerful photograph.  First from a composition point of view, you were off center when you took it and the praying man is also off center.  That makes for a very interesting "triangle" between the man and the center of the arch.  I think the best part of this photograph is the way the light is pouring through the windows over the alter, almost as if the presence of a spirit is filling the church.  I am guessing that is the meaning of the title. Very well done.', '2002-12-10 14:04:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(169290, 9378, 3459, '<td valign="top">Great composition, the background is a bit distracting though.  Very well seen, good job.</td>', 'Great composition, the background is a bit distracting though.  Very well seen, good job.', '2002-12-10 14:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(169346, 9482, 4517, '<td valign="top">This photo will win! (probably).</td>', 'This photo will win! (probably).', '2002-12-10 14:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(169373, 9367, 327, '<td valign="top">Cool perspective and cool abstract shot. Very nicely cropped, framed. Good color, light, focus.</td>', 'Cool perspective and cool abstract shot. Very nicely cropped, framed. Good color, light, focus.', '2002-12-10 15:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(169379, 9546, 327, '<td valign="top">I looked at this a long time. I like it very much. The tree and sky are very.....spooky or eerie looking. Neat shot, good job.</td>', 'I looked at this a long time. I like it very much. The tree and sky are very.....spooky or eerie looking. Neat shot, good job.', '2002-12-10 15:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(169390, 9386, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty good shot. I haven''t tried to shoot the fireplace yet. LOL I will. I like this, good action, color.</td>', 'Pretty good shot. I haven''t tried to shoot the fireplace yet. LOL I will. I like this, good action, color.', '2002-12-10 15:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(169393, 9450, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty shot......great perspective view. Nice work.</td>', 'Pretty shot......great perspective view. Nice work.', '2002-12-10 15:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(169397, 9340, 327, '<td valign="top">Fish eye? Eerie looking but you did a wonderful creative shot. Nice work.</td>', 'Fish eye? Eerie looking but you did a wonderful creative shot. Nice work.', '2002-12-10 15:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(169404, 9459, 327, '<td valign="top">Neat shot of a fun day.  The color is good, the compositon is okay and the action is good. The trouble to my eye is the light...they are lost against the fence and we can''t see their faces. Still it''s a good job.</td>', 'Neat shot of a fun day.  The color is good, the compositon is okay and the action is good. The trouble to my eye is the light...they are lost against the fence and we can''t see their faces. Still it''s a good job.', '2002-12-10 15:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(169428, 9417, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m normally not a big fan of "pet photos," but this is certainly a wonderful exception.  I love the composition, the clarity is spectacular, and the dog even looks as though it is thinking some sort of deep doggy thoughts!  Very well done.</td>', 'I''m normally not a big fan of "pet photos," but this is certainly a wonderful exception.  I love the composition, the clarity is spectacular, and the dog even looks as though it is thinking some sort of deep doggy thoughts!  Very well done.', '2002-12-10 15:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(169440, 9546, 2553, '<td valign="top">I love the starkness, and the moody feel of this shot, and feel that b&amp;w is perfect for the photo.  I like the composition focusing on the tree and sky with just the suggestion of buildings at the bottom.  This shot has a lot of impact for me.  10.  lhall</td>', 'I love the starkness, and the moody feel of this shot, and feel that b&w is perfect for the photo.  I like the composition focusing on the tree and sky with just the suggestion of buildings at the bottom.  This shot has a lot of impact for me.  10.  lhall', '2002-12-10 16:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(169442, 9543, 2553, '<td valign="top">I love the shot, especially that it is b&amp;w, and your composition is terrific.  I feel as thought I want to see *more*  through the opening of the driftwood, but that doesn''t bother me a whole lot.  10. lhall</td>', 'I love the shot, especially that it is b&w, and your composition is terrific.  I feel as thought I want to see *more*  through the opening of the driftwood, but that doesn''t bother me a whole lot.  10. lhall', '2002-12-10 16:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(169449, 9482, 2553, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot, would love to know how you accomplished it.  The colors are wonderful, and I love the clarity of the droplets.   10.  lhall  (PS - not crazy about the white border.JMO.)</td>', 'Very cool shot, would love to know how you accomplished it.  The colors are wonderful, and I love the clarity of the droplets.   10.  lhall  (PS - not crazy about the white border.JMO.)', '2002-12-10 16:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(169456, 9521, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like this shot very much.  I was trying to figure out if that was a poster or advertisement of some kind in the background, but whatever it is, it adds an interesting element to the shot.  You''ve captured the individual beautifully.  9. lhall</td>', 'I like this shot very much.  I was trying to figure out if that was a poster or advertisement of some kind in the background, but whatever it is, it adds an interesting element to the shot.  You''ve captured the individual beautifully.  9. lhall', '2002-12-10 16:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(169461, 9552, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of the leaf, and like that the bright colors are placed against a cold, dark background.  The circular rim, or edge or whatever it is, adds interest, as does the water on the leaf.  It''s a nice shot, and I like it, but it does not have a lot of emotional impact for me.  8.  lhall</td>', 'I like the composition of the leaf, and like that the bright colors are placed against a cold, dark background.  The circular rim, or edge or whatever it is, adds interest, as does the water on the leaf.  It''s a nice shot, and I like it, but it does not have a lot of emotional impact for me.  8.  lhall', '2002-12-10 16:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(169466, 9568, 2553, '<td valign="top">An interesting shot, especially since you were able to capture the bird in flight - I think it adds to the appeal of the shot.  I like the look of the angel against the gray sky and the stark, bare trees.  It definitely has a sort of "other-worldly" feel to it.  Composition works well for me.  I think my favorite thing about it is that everything is backlit, and in silhouette.  8.  lhall</td>', 'An interesting shot, especially since you were able to capture the bird in flight - I think it adds to the appeal of the shot.  I like the look of the angel against the gray sky and the stark, bare trees.  It definitely has a sort of "other-worldly" feel to it.  Composition works well for me.  I think my favorite thing about it is that everything is backlit, and in silhouette.  8.  lhall', '2002-12-10 16:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(169474, 9510, 2553, '<td valign="top">What a very beautiful child.  This shot is great.  I like the lighting and the composition of your shot, as well as the expression on his face.  9. lhall</td>', 'What a very beautiful child.  This shot is great.  I like the lighting and the composition of your shot, as well as the expression on his face.  9. lhall', '2002-12-10 16:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(169475, 9497, 2553, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful!  Either you have a great zoom or you got pretty darn close!  Either way, a very nice shot.  9. lhall</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful!  Either you have a great zoom or you got pretty darn close!  Either way, a very nice shot.  9. lhall', '2002-12-10 16:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(169479, 9485, 2553, '<td valign="top">This shot is pretty high impact for me.  I love the coloring that you chose, and love the repetition of the arches, and the lines of the ceiling beams and the pews.  I did not notice until I looked at it for the third time, that there was a person in the shot!!  I would have loved to have seen this in color.  9. lhall</td>', 'This shot is pretty high impact for me.  I love the coloring that you chose, and love the repetition of the arches, and the lines of the ceiling beams and the pews.  I did not notice until I looked at it for the third time, that there was a person in the shot!!  I would have loved to have seen this in color.  9. lhall', '2002-12-10 16:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(169491, 9396, 4493, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this shot. The eye follows the thread from left to right. I think having the thread''s end visible is a good idea.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this shot. The eye follows the thread from left to right. I think having the thread''s end visible is a good idea.', '2002-12-10 17:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(169492, 9388, 4493, '<td valign="top">I like artsy shots. I wouldn''t have thought that spaghetti could be an interesting subject. Good use of light so as to no oversaturate or have to dark in between the noodles.</td>', 'I like artsy shots. I wouldn''t have thought that spaghetti could be an interesting subject. Good use of light so as to no oversaturate or have to dark in between the noodles.', '2002-12-10 17:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(169493, 9510, 4493, '<td valign="top">Great expression. This is a nice candid shot. Colors balance and lighting are perfect.</td>', 'Great expression. This is a nice candid shot. Colors balance and lighting are perfect.', '2002-12-10 17:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(169494, 9578, 4493, '<td valign="top">Live in North Carolina :-) ?<br/> <br/>This is a nice composition. I like the clarity of the lines in the ice on the stalk. DOF may work opened up a little, not to much, the blur of the background is needed, but with as much as you have, it almost looks, i dunno, like it has jpeg artifacts, but I know it doesn''t. Again, nice shot!</td>', 'Live in North Carolina :-) ? This is a nice composition. I like the clarity of the lines in the ice on the stalk. DOF may work opened up a little, not to much, the blur of the background is needed, but with as much as you have, it almost looks, i dunno, like it has jpeg artifacts, but I know it doesn''t. Again, nice shot!', '2002-12-10 17:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(169495, 9312, 4493, '<td valign="top">Nice clean shot. I like the trickery you have here. The only thing that bothers me is the right most hanger being cropped off. Other than that, nice job.</td>', 'Nice clean shot. I like the trickery you have here. The only thing that bothers me is the right most hanger being cropped off. Other than that, nice job.', '2002-12-10 17:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(169496, 9469, 4493, '<td valign="top">I''m actually bumping my score. The more I look at it the better I think this is. I like the DOF and coloring. The touch of red at the bottom is a nice touch. Only thing that may make this a stronger picture is if you were standing center of the railings on either side. Good work!</td>', 'I''m actually bumping my score. The more I look at it the better I think this is. I like the DOF and coloring. The touch of red at the bottom is a nice touch. Only thing that may make this a stronger picture is if you were standing center of the railings on either side. Good work!', '2002-12-10 17:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(169497, 9546, 4493, '<td valign="top">Good use of long exposure setting. The stark tree really is a nice foreground for the industrial background. Only bother for me is the branches leading right into the building on the left. If you could have somehow positioned yourself to have the tree seperate from the shadow of the building you''d have a near perfect photo.</td>', 'Good use of long exposure setting. The stark tree really is a nice foreground for the industrial background. Only bother for me is the branches leading right into the building on the left. If you could have somehow positioned yourself to have the tree seperate from the shadow of the building you''d have a near perfect photo.', '2002-12-10 17:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(169498, 9402, 4493, '<td valign="top">Great clarity in this shot. The texture of the skin as well as the lights not being to blown out is excellent. I''m actually bumping up this score. The more I look at it the better I like it. Your cropping is good and interesting, only trouble is the strand of hair up in the upper right hand corner of the screen. Nice photo.</td>', 'Great clarity in this shot. The texture of the skin as well as the lights not being to blown out is excellent. I''m actually bumping up this score. The more I look at it the better I like it. Your cropping is good and interesting, only trouble is the strand of hair up in the upper right hand corner of the screen. Nice photo.', '2002-12-10 17:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(169499, 9313, 4493, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract. Good ability to get the white balance correct. Nice lines and shades.</td>', 'Nice abstract. Good ability to get the white balance correct. Nice lines and shades.', '2002-12-10 17:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(169515, 9388, 326, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!</td>', 'Nice shot!', '2002-12-10 18:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(169519, 9575, 326, '<td valign="top">This is a picture I would LOVE to see this bigger, but then again it looks life size.....  Good job.</td>', 'This is a picture I would LOVE to see this bigger, but then again it looks life size.....  Good job.', '2002-12-10 18:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(169520, 9531, 326, '<td valign="top">The more I look at this the more I like it!  Good job.</td>', 'The more I look at this the more I like it!  Good job.', '2002-12-10 18:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(169522, 9552, 326, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful. I like the colors! Nice job!</td>', 'This is wonderful. I like the colors! Nice job!', '2002-12-10 18:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(169523, 9582, 1826, '<td valign="top">Perfect card material, nice work.</td>', 'Perfect card material, nice work.', '2002-12-10 18:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(169524, 9538, 2553, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  All of the repeating forms, the black and white, good composition, and the clarity of the shot all make for a terrific photo.  It doesn''t have a lot of emotional impact for me, but I still think it is a great photo.  9. lhall</td>', 'Great shot.  All of the repeating forms, the black and white, good composition, and the clarity of the shot all make for a terrific photo.  It doesn''t have a lot of emotional impact for me, but I still think it is a great photo.  9. lhall', '2002-12-10 18:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(169528, 9578, 326, '<td valign="top">Hey this is neat... I really like the red leaf it adds a nice touch.</td>', 'Hey this is neat... I really like the red leaf it adds a nice touch.', '2002-12-10 18:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(169530, 9510, 1826, '<td valign="top">Great capture. The blue line near the top of his head is a little distracting, but could be easily cloned out after the challenge. Nice work.</td>', 'Great capture. The blue line near the top of his head is a little distracting, but could be easily cloned out after the challenge. Nice work.', '2002-12-10 18:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(169532, 9553, 326, '<td valign="top">I love it! Nice job!</td>', 'I love it! Nice job!', '2002-12-10 18:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(169533, 9506, 1826, '<td valign="top">Very cool light.</td>', 'Very cool light.', '2002-12-10 18:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(169534, 9495, 2553, '<td valign="top">I love Christmas lights, and this photo made me smile.  I can''t make out if this is a park, or a home, or what, exactly.  I like the colors, and you did a good job of exposure getting the lights, but still leaving all that negative space.  Something about the composition is a little "off" for me, though I am not sure why.  Moderate to high impact for me.  8.  lhall</td>', 'I love Christmas lights, and this photo made me smile.  I can''t make out if this is a park, or a home, or what, exactly.  I like the colors, and you did a good job of exposure getting the lights, but still leaving all that negative space.  Something about the composition is a little "off" for me, though I am not sure why.  Moderate to high impact for me.  8.  lhall', '2002-12-10 18:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(169537, 9531, 2553, '<td valign="top">This shot is quite interesting to me.  I love the reflections, and the repeating lines and angles.  The limited color palette is also very effective for the shot.  The wide border bothers me a little, I think I would prefer that it be smaller so as to have less impact on the shot itself.  Moderate to high impact for me.  8. lhall</td>', 'This shot is quite interesting to me.  I love the reflections, and the repeating lines and angles.  The limited color palette is also very effective for the shot.  The wide border bothers me a little, I think I would prefer that it be smaller so as to have less impact on the shot itself.  Moderate to high impact for me.  8. lhall', '2002-12-10 18:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(169538, 9521, 326, '<td valign="top">I just wanted to say I really like this image.....Great job!</td>', 'I just wanted to say I really like this image.....Great job!', '2002-12-10 18:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(169539, 9585, 1826, '<td valign="top">I like the way you''ve composed this portrait.</td>', 'I like the way you''ve composed this portrait.', '2002-12-10 18:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
