(169541, 9396, 326, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot! I like everything about it.</td>', 'Wonderful shot! I like everything about it.', '2002-12-10 18:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(169542, 9550, 1826, '<td valign="top">Nice detail, and the black backround is perfect for this.</td>', 'Nice detail, and the black backround is perfect for this.', '2002-12-10 18:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(169544, 9551, 1826, '<td valign="top">Such a cool perspective- good eye.</td>', 'Such a cool perspective- good eye.', '2002-12-10 18:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(169549, 9494, 2553, '<td valign="top">Though I do like this shot, especially the black and white,  I find that it has little emotional impact for me.  I cannot decide what the subject is - whether it is the gentleman walking by, or the Christmas items, or the entire "market" itself.  There seems to be so much to look at that my eyes are constantly wandering around the photo with nowhere to rest except on the man, though I do not feel that he is the "subject" of the photo.  8. lhall</td>', 'Though I do like this shot, especially the black and white,  I find that it has little emotional impact for me.  I cannot decide what the subject is - whether it is the gentleman walking by, or the Christmas items, or the entire "market" itself.  There seems to be so much to look at that my eyes are constantly wandering around the photo with nowhere to rest except on the man, though I do not feel that he is the "subject" of the photo.  8. lhall', '2002-12-10 18:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(169551, 9583, 2553, '<td valign="top">Incredible colors and an interesting concept.  I do like the composition, and your lighting for the shot.  Not a high degree of impact for me though.  8. lhall</td>', 'Incredible colors and an interesting concept.  I do like the composition, and your lighting for the shot.  Not a high degree of impact for me though.  8. lhall', '2002-12-10 18:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(169554, 9336, 2553, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors!  An interesting concept, the composition is pleasing to me, and I would very much like to know how this shot was done.  What the heck is "Sabbatier"??  I''ve looked on the internet, but have not yet found a description of the word.  Saw some references to "sabbatier photography", but it did not say what it was!  Anyway, nice shot.  9. lhall</td>', 'Wonderful colors!  An interesting concept, the composition is pleasing to me, and I would very much like to know how this shot was done.  What the heck is "Sabbatier"??  I''ve looked on the internet, but have not yet found a description of the word.  Saw some references to "sabbatier photography", but it did not say what it was!  Anyway, nice shot.  9. lhall', '2002-12-10 18:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(169555, 9452, 2553, '<td valign="top">Lovely, and very "old world" looking.  Lighting and composition work for me.  Moderate to high impact for me.  8. lhall</td>', 'Lovely, and very "old world" looking.  Lighting and composition work for me.  Moderate to high impact for me.  8. lhall', '2002-12-10 18:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(169558, 9450, 2553, '<td valign="top">What an interesting angle!  Good lighting, interesting composition, and I love the repetition of the different forms, as well as the light and dark tones.  I also like your border.  It sets the photo off well without overwhelming it.  Moderate emotional impact for me, but nevertheless a terrific shot.  8. lhall</td>', 'What an interesting angle!  Good lighting, interesting composition, and I love the repetition of the different forms, as well as the light and dark tones.  I also like your border.  It sets the photo off well without overwhelming it.  Moderate emotional impact for me, but nevertheless a terrific shot.  8. lhall', '2002-12-10 18:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(169562, 9396, 2553, '<td valign="top">On the one hand, I like the look of this shot because it looks like a pen and ink drawing.  On the other hand, it is so very stark, and I feel like I want to see more, especially more of the texture in the thread.  Your border is very effective, and I think it accents the photo well.  Overall - very nice.  8. lhall</td>', 'On the one hand, I like the look of this shot because it looks like a pen and ink drawing.  On the other hand, it is so very stark, and I feel like I want to see more, especially more of the texture in the thread.  Your border is very effective, and I think it accents the photo well.  Overall - very nice.  8. lhall', '2002-12-10 19:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(169573, 9531, 1826, '<td valign="top">Nice work. I think the border is a nice addition too.</td>', 'Nice work. I think the border is a nice addition too.', '2002-12-10 19:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(169574, 9383, 1826, '<td valign="top">I like the DOF, it really draws your eye to that one area. :)</td>', 'I like the DOF, it really draws your eye to that one area. :)', '2002-12-10 19:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(169575, 9450, 1826, '<td valign="top">The angle you chose works well.</td>', 'The angle you chose works well.', '2002-12-10 19:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(169577, 9367, 1826, '<td valign="top">Wouldn''t want to have to be the one who puts the angel on top! lol Great perspective.</td>', 'Wouldn''t want to have to be the one who puts the angel on top! lol Great perspective.', '2002-12-10 19:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(169578, 9519, 1826, '<td valign="top">Great catch, love that foot hanging over the edge. Wasn''t there ANYONE listening to him?</td>', 'Great catch, love that foot hanging over the edge. Wasn''t there ANYONE listening to him?', '2002-12-10 19:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(169579, 9369, 1826, '<td valign="top">Very creative. :)</td>', 'Very creative. :)', '2002-12-10 19:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(169583, 9491, 3575, '<td valign="top">Amazing color! At first I thought it was colorized but this beautiful child is just blessed with these amazing green eyes. You get a 10 from me - joanns</td>', 'Amazing color! At first I thought it was colorized but this beautiful child is just blessed with these amazing green eyes. You get a 10 from me - joanns', '2002-12-10 19:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(169586, 9452, 3575, '<td valign="top">Great objects and I love the backdrop. The only think I would change is the angle of the bottle, only because it makes the photo look like it needs to be rotated when, in fact, it''s perfectly straight. Is there a connection between the feather and the bottle? There doesn''t have to be but I just want to know if I''m missing something.</td>', 'Great objects and I love the backdrop. The only think I would change is the angle of the bottle, only because it makes the photo look like it needs to be rotated when, in fact, it''s perfectly straight. Is there a connection between the feather and the bottle? There doesn''t have to be but I just want to know if I''m missing something.', '2002-12-10 19:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(169597, 9531, 3459, '<td valign="top">An excellent composition, however technically the image seems a bit noisy and the framing a bit distracting.  Also, the alignment of the conners is a bit tilted, which puts a bit of a strain into the image.  On the bright side, I love the colours; and again can''t stress enough how great the idea is.  Hope this is helpful, congrats and good luck.</td>', 'An excellent composition, however technically the image seems a bit noisy and the framing a bit distracting.  Also, the alignment of the conners is a bit tilted, which puts a bit of a strain into the image.  On the bright side, I love the colours; and again can''t stress enough how great the idea is.  Hope this is helpful, congrats and good luck.', '2002-12-10 20:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(169598, 9495, 3459, '<td valign="top">Great colours and choice of subjects, however that''s all this image invokes in me.  Usually, personally I look for more than just technical excellence; this however could be just a cultural difference where Christmas is not as meaningful to me as it might be to other people.  Great execution, and a good job overall, congrats!</td>', 'Great colours and choice of subjects, however that''s all this image invokes in me.  Usually, personally I look for more than just technical excellence; this however could be just a cultural difference where Christmas is not as meaningful to me as it might be to other people.  Great execution, and a good job overall, congrats!', '2002-12-10 20:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(169601, 9463, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of DOF.  I like the crisp focus foreground, and the soft focus background.  The angle and framing/cropping are good, and the setup is very nice.  Add some salt, and my good friend Jose and we''ve got a masterpiece. lol  This is a very nice still life. The water adds just that small bit of extra touch that makes this special.  Great shot, good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very nice use of DOF.  I like the crisp focus foreground, and the soft focus background.  The angle and framing/cropping are good, and the setup is very nice.  Add some salt, and my good friend Jose and we''ve got a masterpiece. lol  This is a very nice still life. The water adds just that small bit of extra touch that makes this special.  Great shot, good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-10 20:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(169603, 9495, 3080, '<td valign="top">A very nice night shot.  Very clear lights, great color, and the blacks are great as well.  A very nice "shade" of black.  The angle and framing/cropping are good, and the focus is very nice as well.  Tripod, I assume.  I especially like the tree to the right that has all the little ''twinkles''.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'A very nice night shot.  Very clear lights, great color, and the blacks are great as well.  A very nice "shade" of black.  The angle and framing/cropping are good, and the focus is very nice as well.  Tripod, I assume.  I especially like the tree to the right that has all the little ''twinkles''.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-10 20:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(169605, 9543, 3080, '<td valign="top">Fascinating.  I really love how you have us looking through the driftwood. Black and white is an excelent choice here.  you have taken away an element (color) that could be distracting to the texture here, and have in turn brought out supurb textures.  Angle and framing/cropping are great, and the subject is very interesting to look at.  Great find. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Fascinating.  I really love how you have us looking through the driftwood. Black and white is an excelent choice here.  you have taken away an element (color) that could be distracting to the texture here, and have in turn brought out supurb textures.  Angle and framing/cropping are great, and the subject is very interesting to look at.  Great find. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-10 20:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(169607, 9485, 1847, '<td valign="top">Moving photo.  I wonder if some people will ding you for the overexposed window.  I won''t, cause I love it!  Great decisions on the composition.</td>', 'Moving photo.  I wonder if some people will ding you for the overexposed window.  I won''t, cause I love it!  Great decisions on the composition.', '2002-12-10 20:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(169608, 9538, 1847, '<td valign="top">Makes me want to explore.  Can''t tell if this is B&amp;W, or just a silver horn.  Good decision to put the lines at an angle.  Adds a lot of interest.</td>', 'Makes me want to explore.  Can''t tell if this is B&W, or just a silver horn.  Good decision to put the lines at an angle.  Adds a lot of interest.', '2002-12-10 20:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(169609, 9575, 1847, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo.  I like the graduated lighting in the background.</td>', 'Interesting photo.  I like the graduated lighting in the background.', '2002-12-10 20:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(169610, 9543, 1847, '<td valign="top">Makes me want to go get my surfboard and drop in!  Really an interesting photo.  I don''t know if you tweaked the contrast at all, but I would have liked to have seen a bit more detail.</td>', 'Makes me want to go get my surfboard and drop in!  Really an interesting photo.  I don''t know if you tweaked the contrast at all, but I would have liked to have seen a bit more detail.', '2002-12-10 20:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(169611, 9522, 1847, '<td valign="top">Maybe a wider crop would help to put this in some kind of context.  It''s an interesting shot, but I feel a bit overwhelmed by the subject,</td>', 'Maybe a wider crop would help to put this in some kind of context.  It''s an interesting shot, but I feel a bit overwhelmed by the subject,', '2002-12-10 20:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(169612, 9501, 1847, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of lighting conditions.  The back leaf casting a shadow on the front is interesting.  Good composition, too, what with the rule of 3rds and all.</td>', 'Nice choice of lighting conditions.  The back leaf casting a shadow on the front is interesting.  Good composition, too, what with the rule of 3rds and all.', '2002-12-10 20:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(169613, 9495, 1847, '<td valign="top">Good light shot.  I would image it''s hard to properly expose all those lights at the various distances.</td>', 'Good light shot.  I would image it''s hard to properly expose all those lights at the various distances.', '2002-12-10 20:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(169615, 9402, 1847, '<td valign="top">Very interesting.  I like the setup and concept, and particularly like the composition.</td>', 'Very interesting.  I like the setup and concept, and particularly like the composition.', '2002-12-10 20:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(169616, 9367, 1847, '<td valign="top">I love geometric photos!</td>', 'I love geometric photos!', '2002-12-10 20:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(169617, 9582, 1847, '<td valign="top">Almost looks like a drawing.  Really a fantastic photo.  Best I''ve seen so far.</td>', 'Almost looks like a drawing.  Really a fantastic photo.  Best I''ve seen so far.', '2002-12-10 20:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(169618, 9345, 1847, '<td valign="top">A ton of texture!  Good eye.</td>', 'A ton of texture!  Good eye.', '2002-12-10 20:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(169619, 9482, 1847, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  It''ll be interesting to see how you created the background.</td>', 'Very cool.  It''ll be interesting to see how you created the background.', '2002-12-10 20:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(169621, 9550, 4811, '<td valign="top">Really nice, love the arrangement of the seeds and black bacground. One of my favorites in this group. Would have been a 9 if I were able to vote.</td>', 'Really nice, love the arrangement of the seeds and black bacground. One of my favorites in this group. Would have been a 9 if I were able to vote.', '2002-12-10 20:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(169622, 9561, 1847, '<td valign="top">I like the effect of the lighting on all the balls.</td>', 'I like the effect of the lighting on all the balls.', '2002-12-10 20:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(169623, 9465, 1847, '<td valign="top">Very technically well done.  Interesting photo.</td>', 'Very technically well done.  Interesting photo.', '2002-12-10 20:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(169624, 9510, 3080, '<td valign="top">The focus and clarity of this shot is amazing.  The textures in his shirt, hair and skin are wonderful.  The lighting was quite cooperative for you for this shot.  angle and framing/cropping are great, and I only have one nit pick.  There are a few horizontal lines cutting through his head and body.  they are a tad distracting but this is still a very wonderful shot of the subject.  good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The focus and clarity of this shot is amazing.  The textures in his shirt, hair and skin are wonderful.  The lighting was quite cooperative for you for this shot.  angle and framing/cropping are great, and I only have one nit pick.  There are a few horizontal lines cutting through his head and body.  they are a tad distracting but this is still a very wonderful shot of the subject.  good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-10 20:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(169626, 9313, 1847, '<td valign="top">Neat photo.  It''ll be very interesting to see how you did it.</td>', 'Neat photo.  It''ll be very interesting to see how you did it.', '2002-12-10 20:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(169627, 9417, 1847, '<td valign="top">One of the better pet photos I''ve seen on here.  Something about it makes me come back again and again.  A very well done "portrait"!</td>', 'One of the better pet photos I''ve seen on here.  Something about it makes me come back again and again.  A very well done "portrait"!', '2002-12-10 20:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(169628, 9506, 1847, '<td valign="top">I like the effort to show a dusk scene, but it''s a bit too dark.  I had the exact same problem with one of my entries, and will be interested to see other comment you get.</td>', 'I like the effort to show a dusk scene, but it''s a bit too dark.  I had the exact same problem with one of my entries, and will be interested to see other comment you get.', '2002-12-10 20:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(169629, 9450, 1847, '<td valign="top">Very neat perspective.  Lighting is a bit harsh in the lower left.</td>', 'Very neat perspective.  Lighting is a bit harsh in the lower left.', '2002-12-10 20:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(169630, 9469, 1847, '<td valign="top">Love this photo.  The vignetting is perfect.  I''ve seen this done with filters, and can''t wait to see how you did it without them.  A very "old-timey" feel, and without resorting to sepia!  Nicely done.</td>', 'Love this photo.  The vignetting is perfect.  I''ve seen this done with filters, and can''t wait to see how you did it without them.  A very "old-timey" feel, and without resorting to sepia!  Nicely done.', '2002-12-10 20:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(169631, 9501, 4811, '<td valign="top">This picture reminds me sooo much of O''Henry''s short story "The Last Leaf", its incredible. From the subject, the painted-like background, to the title! You should find the story and read it! (unless you have a strong aversion to litterature) :) As a standalone picture, its strongly composed, no distracting elements, and the blurred blue-grey background sets a nice backdrop for the fall leaf. Cool!</td>', 'This picture reminds me sooo much of O''Henry''s short story "The Last Leaf", its incredible. From the subject, the painted-like background, to the title! You should find the story and read it! (unless you have a strong aversion to litterature) :) As a standalone picture, its strongly composed, no distracting elements, and the blurred blue-grey background sets a nice backdrop for the fall leaf. Cool!', '2002-12-10 20:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(169632, 9538, 4811, '<td valign="top">Beatiful black and white, great composition, my eyes just glide along all the curves. Excellent abstract, would have been a 9 if I could vote. Kudos!</td>', 'Beatiful black and white, great composition, my eyes just glide along all the curves. Excellent abstract, would have been a 9 if I could vote. Kudos!', '2002-12-10 20:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(169643, 9482, 1, '<td valign="top">Wow, amazing stuff.  The colors are great, the only problem I have is the lighting -- it should''ve been more uniform so less shadows appeared.</td>', 'Wow, amazing stuff.  The colors are great, the only problem I have is the lighting -- it should''ve been more uniform so less shadows appeared.', '2002-12-10 21:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(169644, 9553, 1379, '<td valign="top">I like it!  Your choice of placement is reall appealing, and the snowy white background is a great contrast for the vivid green.  Cool!</td>', 'I like it!  Your choice of placement is reall appealing, and the snowy white background is a great contrast for the vivid green.  Cool!', '2002-12-10 21:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(169645, 9367, 1379, '<td valign="top">Interesting.....  very feminine, somehow.  I like the way you chose to place the vertex off center.  The colors are nice, too.</td>', 'Interesting.....  very feminine, somehow.  I like the way you chose to place the vertex off center.  The colors are nice, too.', '2002-12-10 21:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(169646, 9447, 1379, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  I love the way you captured her eyes.  I just wish there was less shine on her nose and brow.</td>', 'Beautiful.  I love the way you captured her eyes.  I just wish there was less shine on her nose and brow.', '2002-12-10 21:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(169647, 9436, 1379, '<td valign="top">Love that cute little pink nose!  It''s like he''s saying "Please, sir, may I have more?"  Awesome!</td>', 'Love that cute little pink nose!  It''s like he''s saying "Please, sir, may I have more?"  Awesome!', '2002-12-10 21:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(169649, 9449, 1379, '<td valign="top">I like how the car in the background lends some context to this.  I hope he got it fixed, with the weather looking so gray!</td>', 'I like how the car in the background lends some context to this.  I hope he got it fixed, with the weather looking so gray!', '2002-12-10 21:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(169652, 9388, 1379, '<td valign="top">Wow!  I love this photo!  My eye is searching for patterns in this randomness, just like when looking at clouds!  This could almost be a sea anemone or microscopic villi or something.  So cool!</td>', 'Wow!  I love this photo!  My eye is searching for patterns in this randomness, just like when looking at clouds!  This could almost be a sea anemone or microscopic villi or something.  So cool!', '2002-12-10 21:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(169653, 9390, 1379, '<td valign="top">I really like the detail on the weapons, but the art in the background makes it less appealing to me.</td>', 'I really like the detail on the weapons, but the art in the background makes it less appealing to me.', '2002-12-10 21:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(169655, 9510, 1379, '<td valign="top">Wow........  You captured the texture of this child''s skin so well!  The lighting and sharpness, along with his kind of surprised expression, make this an AWESOME photo!</td>', 'Wow........  You captured the texture of this child''s skin so well!  The lighting and sharpness, along with his kind of surprised expression, make this an AWESOME photo!', '2002-12-10 21:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(169656, 9485, 1379, '<td valign="top">The picture is so enriched with your model!  I really like the vastness of the space, with your subject seeming so small in contrast.</td>', 'The picture is so enriched with your model!  I really like the vastness of the space, with your subject seeming so small in contrast.', '2002-12-10 21:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(169657, 9447, 3084, '<td valign="top">Oh La La, beautiful woman.  Nice image, I like the close crop and the isolation of the face.  The angle plays well too.  But, I bet others made comments on how it is too tight of a crop, not me, just perfect.  Good luck. 8</td>', 'Oh La La, beautiful woman.  Nice image, I like the close crop and the isolation of the face.  The angle plays well too.  But, I bet others made comments on how it is too tight of a crop, not me, just perfect.  Good luck. 8', '2002-12-10 21:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(169659, 9543, 1379, '<td valign="top">Wow..... your choice of black and white makes this look like a Georgia O''Keefe painting!  What beauty!</td>', 'Wow..... your choice of black and white makes this look like a Georgia O''Keefe painting!  What beauty!', '2002-12-10 21:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(169660, 9433, 1379, '<td valign="top">Such boldness!  This is a mathemetician''s dream come true!</td>', 'Such boldness!  This is a mathemetician''s dream come true!', '2002-12-10 21:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(169661, 9585, 3084, '<td valign="top">Nice face.  Reminds me of my high school girlfriend who was just as beautiful as your model.  I appreciate the smile and the eyes.  Good image, good luck.  8</td>', 'Nice face.  Reminds me of my high school girlfriend who was just as beautiful as your model.  I appreciate the smile and the eyes.  Good image, good luck.  8', '2002-12-10 21:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(169662, 9383, 4493, '<td valign="top">This is a cool shot. I wish the DOF was deeper to get a bit more detail in the triggers. I like having some shallow DOF, but this may be a tad much. The colored lights reflecting off of the bell is a nice touch.</td>', 'This is a cool shot. I wish the DOF was deeper to get a bit more detail in the triggers. I like having some shallow DOF, but this may be a tad much. The colored lights reflecting off of the bell is a nice touch.', '2002-12-10 21:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(169663, 9436, 3084, '<td valign="top">A very difficult shot to get, I have tried too, but never with such great results as you have achieved here. 8, no, le''s make it a 9 because it makes me laugh.</td>', 'A very difficult shot to get, I have tried too, but never with such great results as you have achieved here. 8, no, le''s make it a 9 because it makes me laugh.', '2002-12-10 21:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
