(169665, 9550, 1379, '<td valign="top">What the....?  Is this a birdfeeder?  It''s insane!  It looks as if you''ve made it float in the air!</td>', 'What the....?  Is this a birdfeeder?  It''s insane!  It looks as if you''ve made it float in the air!', '2002-12-10 21:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(169666, 9551, 4493, '<td valign="top">Other than changing the crop just a bit to have the ladder off the bottom of the frame, I wouldn''t change anything. You have good color and composition. Good shot Richard.</td>', 'Other than changing the crop just a bit to have the ladder off the bottom of the frame, I wouldn''t change anything. You have good color and composition. Good shot Richard.', '2002-12-10 21:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(169667, 9538, 1379, '<td valign="top">Beautifully complex.  Nice idea to use black and white.</td>', 'Beautifully complex.  Nice idea to use black and white.', '2002-12-10 21:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(169668, 9340, 1379, '<td valign="top">Ewwww.... so realistic!</td>', 'Ewwww.... so realistic!', '2002-12-10 21:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(169669, 9452, 4493, '<td valign="top">You know, other than some noise, there isn''t much needing work on this shot. Your lighting is beautiful. I like the texture of the cloth behind the vase. To bad the bottle is a screw top. No points off for that though. Nice photo.</td>', 'You know, other than some noise, there isn''t much needing work on this shot. Your lighting is beautiful. I like the texture of the cloth behind the vase. To bad the bottle is a screw top. No points off for that though. Nice photo.', '2002-12-10 21:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(169671, 9558, 1379, '<td valign="top">It''s the Cheshire cat!</td>', 'It''s the Cheshire cat!', '2002-12-10 21:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(169672, 9494, 1379, '<td valign="top">I really want to see this in color!  I like how you captured a pedestrian so candidly, but it makes me wonder where everyone else is!</td>', 'I really want to see this in color!  I like how you captured a pedestrian so candidly, but it makes me wonder where everyone else is!', '2002-12-10 21:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(169673, 9503, 4493, '<td valign="top">This could be a more interesting photo if you had leveled the camera and removed the item in the corner. Your lighting and contrast are good, but the cropping needs to have a little more wall on the right and a level camera. I like the idea though.</td>', 'This could be a more interesting photo if you had leveled the camera and removed the item in the corner. Your lighting and contrast are good, but the cropping needs to have a little more wall on the right and a level camera. I like the idea though.', '2002-12-10 21:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(169674, 9553, 3459, '<td valign="top">I think this is a very well composed image, although a bit over exposed for my taste.</td>', 'I think this is a very well composed image, although a bit over exposed for my taste.', '2002-12-10 21:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(169676, 9463, 3459, '<td valign="top">A nice, simple composition, good use of DOF, a bit too much light on the front lemon though.  The whole image, while technically good, is not very interesting to me personally, nevertheless a very good job. Congrats!</td>', 'A nice, simple composition, good use of DOF, a bit too much light on the front lemon though.  The whole image, while technically good, is not very interesting to me personally, nevertheless a very good job. Congrats!', '2002-12-10 21:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(169677, 9459, 1379, '<td valign="top">Memories in the making!  I hope these two sledders had an awesome journey down their hill!</td>', 'Memories in the making!  I hope these two sledders had an awesome journey down their hill!', '2002-12-10 21:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(169678, 9340, 4493, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I think that you may have too much light on the eyeball. The reflection might need to be softer. The position of the eye on the page works, as well as the ripple around it. Sharpness is good.</td>', 'Interesting. I think that you may have too much light on the eyeball. The reflection might need to be softer. The position of the eye on the page works, as well as the ripple around it. Sharpness is good.', '2002-12-10 21:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(169679, 9496, 3459, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, and to me very humorous.  The leafs are a bit distracting for me.  Good job nevertheless.</td>', 'Nice composition, and to me very humorous.  The leafs are a bit distracting for me.  Good job nevertheless.', '2002-12-10 21:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(169680, 9450, 1379, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  I love the color of the guitar body, and I''m amazed at the lack of DUST on this!  It''s so clean!</td>', 'Very nice!  I love the color of the guitar body, and I''m amazed at the lack of DUST on this!  It''s so clean!', '2002-12-10 21:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(169681, 9495, 4493, '<td valign="top">Relooking at this photo, it''s more interesting than my first vote, so you''ll need a bump. The colors are very vivid, and the lack of tree branches gives a magical look to the surroundings. You have great sharpness on the trees in the back. Nice photo.</td>', 'Relooking at this photo, it''s more interesting than my first vote, so you''ll need a bump. The colors are very vivid, and the lack of tree branches gives a magical look to the surroundings. You have great sharpness on the trees in the back. Nice photo.', '2002-12-10 21:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(169682, 9340, 3459, '<td valign="top">What a great composition!  However the image seems a bit streched to me, also I think it would have worked better in horizontal composition.</td>', 'What a great composition!  However the image seems a bit streched to me, also I think it would have worked better in horizontal composition.', '2002-12-10 21:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(169683, 9526, 3459, '<td valign="top">A very sharp beautiful image.  The thing that bothers me is how the red boat is cropped at the top, I think it would have worked better if it was more inside the frame.  Just an opinion.</td>', 'A very sharp beautiful image.  The thing that bothers me is how the red boat is cropped at the top, I think it would have worked better if it was more inside the frame.  Just an opinion.', '2002-12-10 21:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(169684, 9439, 4493, '<td valign="top">I''m not able to really understand this shot. The subject matter out the window is kind of uninteresting and the dark object in the foreground is distracting to the shadow. Perhaps moving the chair and moving the camera so as to no see out the window, or dropping the blinds so the light shines through them, but obstructs the view may make for a more interesting shot.</td>', 'I''m not able to really understand this shot. The subject matter out the window is kind of uninteresting and the dark object in the foreground is distracting to the shadow. Perhaps moving the chair and moving the camera so as to no see out the window, or dropping the blinds so the light shines through them, but obstructs the view may make for a more interesting shot.', '2002-12-10 21:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(169685, 9402, 472, '<td valign="top">i really like the bondage overtones in this image.  the colors, and naked skin all compel me to look at the picture :)</td>', 'i really like the bondage overtones in this image.  the colors, and naked skin all compel me to look at the picture :)', '2002-12-10 21:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(169686, 9503, 1379, '<td valign="top">Too funny!</td>', 'Too funny!', '2002-12-10 21:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(169687, 9465, 3459, '<td valign="top">A very cute image (which is good), nice use of light, and a great expression on the model''s face.</td>', 'A very cute image (which is good), nice use of light, and a great expression on the model''s face.', '2002-12-10 21:44:11.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(169688, 9583, 1379, '<td valign="top">It''s like a video game drink!  What an interesting effect!</td>', 'It''s like a video game drink!  What an interesting effect!', '2002-12-10 21:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(169689, 9379, 3459, '<td valign="top">Very sharp and well exposed image, making the gist of it standout.  However, the cropping is a bit off for my taste; I would have kept the whole flower rangement in.</td>', 'Very sharp and well exposed image, making the gist of it standout.  However, the cropping is a bit off for my taste; I would have kept the whole flower rangement in.', '2002-12-10 21:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(169691, 9367, 4493, '<td valign="top">Great clarity in this shot. The composition is good as well as your white balance. Nice abstract.</td>', 'Great clarity in this shot. The composition is good as well as your white balance. Nice abstract.', '2002-12-10 21:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(169692, 9452, 3459, '<td valign="top">A very nicely composed image, although a bit soft for my taste.  Generally product images should be sharp with very saturated colours.</td>', 'A very nicely composed image, although a bit soft for my taste.  Generally product images should be sharp with very saturated colours.', '2002-12-10 21:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(169693, 9575, 1379, '<td valign="top">Great color choices for this clever composition!  I hope you compensated your model well, and set him free somewhere nice...</td>', 'Great color choices for this clever composition!  I hope you compensated your model well, and set him free somewhere nice...', '2002-12-10 21:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(169694, 9417, 4493, '<td valign="top">I must say, this is the first dog shot I''ve seen on DPC that I''ve given more than a 5. This is an excellent shot. Only thing missing is a red color and a Santa hat. Well done.</td>', 'I must say, this is the first dog shot I''ve seen on DPC that I''ve given more than a 5. This is an excellent shot. Only thing missing is a red color and a Santa hat. Well done.', '2002-12-10 21:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(169695, 9491, 3459, '<td valign="top">Nice subject.  However the image looks flat, with very little tone gradation.</td>', 'Nice subject.  However the image looks flat, with very little tone gradation.', '2002-12-10 21:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(169698, 9494, 3459, '<td valign="top">A interesting choice of B&amp;W, although I would have gone with colour.</td>', 'A interesting choice of B&W, although I would have gone with colour.', '2002-12-10 21:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(169699, 9561, 4493, '<td valign="top">Nice macro. The lighting is good and you have done well with the sharpening. What would really make this shot jump is some center of focus. Something in the bb''s to contrast them.</td>', 'Nice macro. The lighting is good and you have done well with the sharpening. What would really make this shot jump is some center of focus. Something in the bb''s to contrast them.', '2002-12-10 21:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(169700, 9538, 4967, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites of the week!  This is a beautiful piece of work.  Your lighting is superb, as is the composition, and I love it on the black background.  Good choice!  - 10</td>', 'One of my favorites of the week!  This is a beautiful piece of work.  Your lighting is superb, as is the composition, and I love it on the black background.  Good choice!  - 10', '2002-12-10 21:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(169701, 9447, 4967, '<td valign="top">One of my highest for the week.  I love the soft lighting and look on this girls face.  The white clothing adds to the picture.  I think this is a beautiful portrait!  NICE JOB! - 10</td>', 'One of my highest for the week.  I love the soft lighting and look on this girls face.  The white clothing adds to the picture.  I think this is a beautiful portrait!  NICE JOB! - 10', '2002-12-10 21:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(169702, 9571, 3459, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, well cropped.  I find the braek in the lealfs, on the upper left side of the image, a bit distracting.  Also, personally, I would saturate the colours a bit more.</td>', 'Nice picture, well cropped.  I find the braek in the lealfs, on the upper left side of the image, a bit distracting.  Also, personally, I would saturate the colours a bit more.', '2002-12-10 21:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(169703, 9369, 3459, '<td valign="top">Unfortunatelly, accept for background lighting I don''t find anything very interesting in this image.  Sorry.  However it is just one opinion, good luck.</td>', 'Unfortunatelly, accept for background lighting I don''t find anything very interesting in this image.  Sorry.  However it is just one opinion, good luck.', '2002-12-10 21:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(169704, 9482, 4967, '<td valign="top">Great stop action, I absolutely LOVE the colors in this.  This picture is really neat.  The only thing I think would have improved it, was if you had not had the photo centereed... maybe to the right corner would have been nice?  Just personal preference.  Solid 9!</td>', 'Great stop action, I absolutely LOVE the colors in this.  This picture is really neat.  The only thing I think would have improved it, was if you had not had the photo centereed... maybe to the right corner would have been nice?  Just personal preference.  Solid 9!', '2002-12-10 21:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(169705, 9310, 3459, '<td valign="top">Cute, clear picture; I think cropped either a bit too close, or not enough on the top and bottom.</td>', 'Cute, clear picture; I think cropped either a bit too close, or not enough on the top and bottom.', '2002-12-10 21:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(169707, 9485, 4967, '<td valign="top">This picture is very nice.  I love your composition, and while I don''t care for the blown out window, I understand why you decided to do it.  Great use of natural lighting in doors!  Very calming and nice photo.  - 9</td>', 'This picture is very nice.  I love your composition, and while I don''t care for the blown out window, I understand why you decided to do it.  Great use of natural lighting in doors!  Very calming and nice photo.  - 9', '2002-12-10 21:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(169708, 9550, 4493, '<td valign="top">Perfect lighting, contrast and sharpening. The subject matter doesn''t hold my interest though. Perhaps if the ball wasn''t so centered. Who knows? Eye of the beholder right?</td>', 'Perfect lighting, contrast and sharpening. The subject matter doesn''t hold my interest though. Perhaps if the ball wasn''t so centered. Who knows? Eye of the beholder right?', '2002-12-10 21:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(169709, 9538, 4493, '<td valign="top">I originally gave this a lower score than what I''m bumping it to. You have a technically flawless photo. Interesting shapes and great balance of light and dark. You''re sharpening is perfect and there is no noise. Great job.</td>', 'I originally gave this a lower score than what I''m bumping it to. You have a technically flawless photo. Interesting shapes and great balance of light and dark. You''re sharpening is perfect and there is no noise. Great job.', '2002-12-10 21:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(169710, 9521, 4967, '<td valign="top">Very nice Candid, and very interesting with the (photo?) behind this guy.  You really did a nice job here, and choosing to put it in black and white was a great idea!  Personally I think it may have been more effective if you would have cropped off more of the top, possibly to right above his head, but thats just me.  Good luck!  - 8</td>', 'Very nice Candid, and very interesting with the (photo?) behind this guy.  You really did a nice job here, and choosing to put it in black and white was a great idea!  Personally I think it may have been more effective if you would have cropped off more of the top, possibly to right above his head, but thats just me.  Good luck!  - 8', '2002-12-10 21:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(169711, 9561, 4967, '<td valign="top">This was a great catch!  The pattern is excellent, not something you would think of for the subject!  I love the light, and the little white dot on each of them!  Very nice photo... also great focus!  Good luck! - 8</td>', 'This was a great catch!  The pattern is excellent, not something you would think of for the subject!  I love the light, and the little white dot on each of them!  Very nice photo... also great focus!  Good luck! - 8', '2002-12-10 21:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(169712, 9531, 4967, '<td valign="top">Interesting, looks like a painting!  Good choice of using a border, I think it is very effective.  Looks like something I might hang on my wall!  Incredible oranges, love the patterns, just an all around nice photo!</td>', 'Interesting, looks like a painting!  Good choice of using a border, I think it is very effective.  Looks like something I might hang on my wall!  Incredible oranges, love the patterns, just an all around nice photo!', '2002-12-10 21:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(169713, 9436, 4493, '<td valign="top">Good photo. The white of the snow isn''t over saturated. Great expression. I don''t know who was colder, you or the squirrel. Nice shot.</td>', 'Good photo. The white of the snow isn''t over saturated. Great expression. I don''t know who was colder, you or the squirrel. Nice shot.', '2002-12-10 22:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(169715, 9582, 4967, '<td valign="top">Great use of freespace, and color.  Good choice with the all white plain background.  Great composition.  The only thing that bothers me is having only one branch out of focus but all the others in focus.  I maybe would have cut off that piece for a cleaner looking photo.  Nice job though!</td>', 'Great use of freespace, and color.  Good choice with the all white plain background.  Great composition.  The only thing that bothers me is having only one branch out of focus but all the others in focus.  I maybe would have cut off that piece for a cleaner looking photo.  Nice job though!', '2002-12-10 22:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(169716, 9313, 4967, '<td valign="top">Neat looking.  Seems to take after a photo from the past week, but it''s very nice.  Too bad about the shadow, it kind of detracts for the clean, modern look, but good use of black and white!  Nice placing, and interesting photo.  Good luck!</td>', 'Neat looking.  Seems to take after a photo from the past week, but it''s very nice.  Too bad about the shadow, it kind of detracts for the clean, modern look, but good use of black and white!  Nice placing, and interesting photo.  Good luck!', '2002-12-10 22:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(169719, 9561, 3080, '<td valign="top">Looks like bath beads. or paintballs.  Look bigger than BB''s, but that could just mean you got really really close.  The focus and clarity are great.  I love the color and the angle and framing/cropping are great. I like how you have filled the entire frame with the subject.  That is really nice.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Looks like bath beads. or paintballs.  Look bigger than BB''s, but that could just mean you got really really close.  The focus and clarity are great.  I love the color and the angle and framing/cropping are great. I like how you have filled the entire frame with the subject.  That is really nice.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-10 22:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(169720, 9433, 4493, '<td valign="top">Great shading on the light house. Great color of sky. Good shot.</td>', 'Great shading on the light house. Great color of sky. Good shot.', '2002-12-10 22:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(169722, 9417, 4967, '<td valign="top">There are multiple things about this photo, that don''t make it as pleasing as it could be.  I am saying these things, as advice for next time, and I hope that they are helpful.  Please keep in mind, these are just what I think.<br/>1)  There is too much blank space especially above the dogs head, but also on the sides.  This would have been more effective as a verticle instead of a horizontal.<br/>2)   The border is much too bright, I think it takes away from the subject and is distracting to the eye.<br/>3)  The white background is good because it is plain, but it is a little too bright for the subject, I think a more effective background might have been black?  Just a thought though<br/>4)  Since the dog tags are in, I would have not cropped out just quite so much, so you could have the whole dog tags in<br/> <br/>Plusses<br/>1)  Excellent focus, with a cute subject, and great detail!<br/>2)  Good lighting, I didn''t know dogs had that big of whiskers!  I thought that was a cat thing.<br/> <br/>Good luck!</td>', 'There are multiple things about this photo, that don''t make it as pleasing as it could be.  I am saying these things, as advice for next time, and I hope that they are helpful.  Please keep in mind, these are just what I think.1)  There is too much blank space especially above the dogs head, but also on the sides.  This would have been more effective as a verticle instead of a horizontal.2)   The border is much too bright, I think it takes away from the subject and is distracting to the eye.3)  The white background is good because it is plain, but it is a little too bright for the subject, I think a more effective background might have been black?  Just a thought though4)  Since the dog tags are in, I would have not cropped out just quite so much, so you could have the whole dog tags in Plusses1)  Excellent focus, with a cute subject, and great detail!2)  Good lighting, I didn''t know dogs had that big of whiskers!  I thought that was a cat thing. Good luck!', '2002-12-10 22:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(169723, 9538, 4388, '<td valign="top">great picture! great lighting, tone, contrast, and composition. i like the way you kept the reflections down. 10 goodtempo</td>', 'great picture! great lighting, tone, contrast, and composition. i like the way you kept the reflections down. 10 goodtempo', '2002-12-10 22:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(169725, 9485, 4493, '<td valign="top">Nice subject matter. My only negatives would be that the window is a little washed out which makes it a bit distracting to the rest of the photo. It took me a second to find focus on the man praying. Beautiful church.</td>', 'Nice subject matter. My only negatives would be that the window is a little washed out which makes it a bit distracting to the rest of the photo. It took me a second to find focus on the man praying. Beautiful church.', '2002-12-10 22:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(169726, 9526, 4493, '<td valign="top">Great execution for the title of this picture. Great crop, lighting and composition. Good job.</td>', 'Great execution for the title of this picture. Great crop, lighting and composition. Good job.', '2002-12-10 22:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(169729, 9450, 4493, '<td valign="top">Great closeup. I would however had found a less busy background for the upper left corner. That is the only thing holding this photo back. Well done otherwise.</td>', 'Great closeup. I would however had found a less busy background for the upper left corner. That is the only thing holding this photo back. Well done otherwise.', '2002-12-10 22:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(169732, 9558, 4388, '<td valign="top">looks like it may have been difficult to zoom in on the subject.  nice try if it''s the moon. i would like to see something else in the picture since the subject is small and it''s the only thing in the picture.</td>', 'looks like it may have been difficult to zoom in on the subject.  nice try if it''s the moon. i would like to see something else in the picture since the subject is small and it''s the only thing in the picture.', '2002-12-10 22:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(169733, 9379, 4493, '<td valign="top">Not knowing what is on the left side of this image, I wonder if you were to crop so the whole right and upper right is the monument and have the trees in the lower left, if that would make a stronger composition. Good clarity and colors.</td>', 'Not knowing what is on the left side of this image, I wonder if you were to crop so the whole right and upper right is the monument and have the trees in the lower left, if that would make a stronger composition. Good clarity and colors.', '2002-12-10 22:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(169734, 9571, 4493, '<td valign="top">I like the composition. I think that with a little sharpening and color adjustments this would make a real nice photo. I like the green leaf being the center of attention.</td>', 'I like the composition. I think that with a little sharpening and color adjustments this would make a real nice photo. I like the green leaf being the center of attention.', '2002-12-10 22:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(169737, 9496, 4388, '<td valign="top">i would like to have seen the sign with light on it.  it would have accented  the point of focus better.  as it is, my eyes travel to the leaves with light on them.</td>', 'i would like to have seen the sign with light on it.  it would have accented  the point of focus better.  as it is, my eyes travel to the leaves with light on them.', '2002-12-10 22:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(169738, 9449, 4493, '<td valign="top">Very clear shot. Subject matter is not so interesting. If you moved behind him so we could see what he was doing to the motorcycle, that my make for more interest. Your sky is a bit washed out, but your black and gray''s are noise free.</td>', 'Very clear shot. Subject matter is not so interesting. If you moved behind him so we could see what he was doing to the motorcycle, that my make for more interest. Your sky is a bit washed out, but your black and gray''s are noise free.', '2002-12-10 22:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(169739, 9473, 4388, '<td valign="top">i see red, navy blue, purple and a slight tint of green in the background. i dont see Christmas colors. it appears that there are two stockings with white tops on them. a more neutral background, other than purple, would make this photo look better.</td>', 'i see red, navy blue, purple and a slight tint of green in the background. i dont see Christmas colors. it appears that there are two stockings with white tops on them. a more neutral background, other than purple, would make this photo look better.', '2002-12-10 22:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(169741, 9552, 4493, '<td valign="top">Good composition. I really like the blue of the bowl. I wonder if you''ve over sharpened a bit. The parts of the leaf out of the water look unatural somehow. Good shot.</td>', 'Good composition. I really like the blue of the bowl. I wonder if you''ve over sharpened a bit. The parts of the leaf out of the water look unatural somehow. Good shot.', '2002-12-10 22:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(169742, 9566, 3080, '<td valign="top">The focus on her blouse and arm are pretty good.  The focus on her face and hair is not so good.  A little soft for my tastes.  The face emerging from her rear is a tad strange, and the strong horizontal line cutting right through her head is a distracting.  Having said all that, I DO like the shot.  It''s a documentary kind of shot, and captures a moment very nicely.  Some background adjustments, and had it been a bit sharpers around her eyes, this would be close to perfect.  I like the angle and framing/cropping of the subject.  And I think that lighting on the subject is very nice as well. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The focus on her blouse and arm are pretty good.  The focus on her face and hair is not so good.  A little soft for my tastes.  The face emerging from her rear is a tad strange, and the strong horizontal line cutting right through her head is a distracting.  Having said all that, I DO like the shot.  It''s a documentary kind of shot, and captures a moment very nicely.  Some background adjustments, and had it been a bit sharpers around her eyes, this would be close to perfect.  I like the angle and framing/cropping of the subject.  And I think that lighting on the subject is very nice as well. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-10 22:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(169743, 9503, 4388, '<td valign="top">the photo and title make sense, but moving the white stick thing out of the corner would improve this photo. it looks good in grayscale, good choice.</td>', 'the photo and title make sense, but moving the white stick thing out of the corner would improve this photo. it looks good in grayscale, good choice.', '2002-12-10 22:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(169746, 9521, 3080, '<td valign="top">I love how the 2 faces are similar.  Different, yet similar.  The angle of the face in the background is nice.  Nothing distracting.  Very clear, well focused shot.  Angle and framing/cropping are great.  I like the darkness (lighting) of the man.  I think that it adds a lot with the background lighting being lighter and the lighting on him being being darker.  a nice contrast that way.  Great portrait. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I love how the 2 faces are similar.  Different, yet similar.  The angle of the face in the background is nice.  Nothing distracting.  Very clear, well focused shot.  Angle and framing/cropping are great.  I like the darkness (lighting) of the man.  I think that it adds a lot with the background lighting being lighter and the lighting on him being being darker.  a nice contrast that way.  Great portrait. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-10 22:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(169747, 9506, 4388, '<td valign="top">i like the composition and curves in the photo. the title suggests that light is either beginning or ending, but a little more light would make the details more distinguishable.</td>', 'i like the composition and curves in the photo. the title suggests that light is either beginning or ending, but a little more light would make the details more distinguishable.', '2002-12-10 22:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(169750, 9583, 1584, '<td valign="top">I''d like to hang this one in my house. Love these colors.</td>', 'I''d like to hang this one in my house. Love these colors.', '2002-12-10 22:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(169751, 9386, 4388, '<td valign="top">the flames have an interesting stop-action to them. i would like to see more flames or brighter embers to give the photo a little more kick.</td>', 'the flames have an interesting stop-action to them. i would like to see more flames or brighter embers to give the photo a little more kick.', '2002-12-10 22:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(169754, 9298, 4388, '<td valign="top">nice composition.  i like the drilliing rig ''up in the clouds''. a little more contrast and color correction would improve this photo. very nice creativity.</td>', 'nice composition.  i like the drilliing rig ''up in the clouds''. a little more contrast and color correction would improve this photo. very nice creativity.', '2002-12-10 22:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
