(169839, 9519, 4648, '<td valign="top">He appears to be blowing a whistle also.  Can I ask what he thinks he is doing?  This is what I call being in the right place at the right time.  Great picture, well done, and human interest.  This one grabs your attention and makes you want to know more about that man.  Great photojournalism picture.</td>', 'He appears to be blowing a whistle also.  Can I ask what he thinks he is doing?  This is what I call being in the right place at the right time.  Great picture, well done, and human interest.  This one grabs your attention and makes you want to know more about that man.  Great photojournalism picture.', '2002-12-10 23:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(169840, 9551, 4648, '<td valign="top">Great photo with a title that puts the finishing touch to it.  Great job and great focus - all the way.  Well done.</td>', 'Great photo with a title that puts the finishing touch to it.  Great job and great focus - all the way.  Well done.', '2002-12-10 23:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(169845, 9526, 4648, '<td valign="top">I see old, new, blue which is borrowed?  This is a great photo.  Would have done well in the "blue" challenge.  The snow make you blue that you can''t use the canoes for a while.  Georgeous photo.  Well done.</td>', 'I see old, new, blue which is borrowed?  This is a great photo.  Would have done well in the "blue" challenge.  The snow make you blue that you can''t use the canoes for a while.  Georgeous photo.  Well done.', '2002-12-10 23:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(169846, 9575, 4648, '<td valign="top">Oh no is right.  Sickening thought but beautiful photo.  In this case less is more.  The simplicity is part of the beauty of this shot.  Good clear focus.  Great composition with really good execution.  One of my favorites.</td>', 'Oh no is right.  Sickening thought but beautiful photo.  In this case less is more.  The simplicity is part of the beauty of this shot.  Good clear focus.  Great composition with really good execution.  One of my favorites.', '2002-12-10 23:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(169855, 9522, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photo.  I would have liked it not cropped so closely, making this appear to be a doorway into the scenery.  Just a thought.  But it is great the way it is.  I really like it.</td>', 'This is a beautiful photo.  I would have liked it not cropped so closely, making this appear to be a doorway into the scenery.  Just a thought.  But it is great the way it is.  I really like it.', '2002-12-11 00:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
