(169859, 9379, 4648, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for patriotism.  This grabs your attention and speaks tons of emotion.  Great photo and well done.  This will be in my favorites for sure.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for patriotism.  This grabs your attention and speaks tons of emotion.  Great photo and well done.  This will be in my favorites for sure.', '2002-12-11 00:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
