(169861, 9345, 4648, '<td valign="top">Great texture, great focus, great crop job, great photo.  This is awesome.  You can almost feel and smell the rust.  You feel like you are right there.  Fantastic job.</td>', 'Great texture, great focus, great crop job, great photo.  This is awesome.  You can almost feel and smell the rust.  You feel like you are right there.  Fantastic job.', '2002-12-11 00:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
