(169904, 9510, 3280, '<td valign="top">Unbelievable clarity and focus. I like the composition a lot. The only nit I have is that the way the sun is hitting the right side it really makes the hairs on the neck and ear stand out in an unwanted way. Really nice shot.  DPz</td>', 'Unbelievable clarity and focus. I like the composition a lot. The only nit I have is that the way the sun is hitting the right side it really makes the hairs on the neck and ear stand out in an unwanted way. Really nice shot.  DPz', '2002-12-11 01:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(169905, 9531, 3280, '<td valign="top">Looks almost like a painting.  DPz</td>', 'Looks almost like a painting.  DPz', '2002-12-11 01:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(169906, 9531, 3080, '<td valign="top">wow...interesting.  maybe it''s just the way I"m looking at the shot, but it seems a bit speckled.  I think the frame goes very nicely with the photo, the additional color (orange) is a great touch.  Not quite sure what the orange is, but it adds enough variation to the shot to give it some extra interest.  Your focus and clarity seem good to me, and lighting also appears to have been cooperative for you.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'wow...interesting.  maybe it''s just the way I"m looking at the shot, but it seems a bit speckled.  I think the frame goes very nicely with the photo, the additional color (orange) is a great touch.  Not quite sure what the orange is, but it adds enough variation to the shot to give it some extra interest.  Your focus and clarity seem good to me, and lighting also appears to have been cooperative for you.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-11 01:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(169908, 9566, 3280, '<td valign="top">Great facial expression and pretty model.  DPz</td>', 'Great facial expression and pretty model.  DPz', '2002-12-11 01:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(169909, 9459, 3080, '<td valign="top">I love it...2 inches of snow, and they are out there already!!  We wait till there''s like 3 FEET before we bother with the sled. LOL.  I like the angle and framing/cropping you have chosen here.  We are definately going downhill, definately a sled, definately snow.  the picture if very clear here.  focus is a tad soft on the people, however, that could be due to the fact that they might be moving, or that the camera is trying to focus on the snowflakes that are falling between the camera and the people.  a very nice winter shot.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I love it...2 inches of snow, and they are out there already!!  We wait till there''s like 3 FEET before we bother with the sled. LOL.  I like the angle and framing/cropping you have chosen here.  We are definately going downhill, definately a sled, definately snow.  the picture if very clear here.  focus is a tad soft on the people, however, that could be due to the fact that they might be moving, or that the camera is trying to focus on the snowflakes that are falling between the camera and the people.  a very nice winter shot.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-11 01:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(169910, 9390, 3280, '<td valign="top">A bit too busy for my tastes. Good focus on the knives and certainly an interesting concept.  DPz</td>', 'A bit too busy for my tastes. Good focus on the knives and certainly an interesting concept.  DPz', '2002-12-11 01:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(169912, 9546, 3280, '<td valign="top">I really like your sky and the black and white is excellent.  I wonder if you could have taken it or cropped out the building on the left though. DPz</td>', 'I really like your sky and the black and white is excellent.  I wonder if you could have taken it or cropped out the building on the left though. DPz', '2002-12-11 01:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(169913, 9482, 2923, '<td valign="top">very nice.</td>', 'very nice.', '2002-12-11 01:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(169914, 9506, 3280, '<td valign="top">According to my new calibration strips under the photo, this still may be just a bit under-exposed.  DPz</td>', 'According to my new calibration strips under the photo, this still may be just a bit under-exposed.  DPz', '2002-12-11 01:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(169915, 9497, 3080, '<td valign="top">I might be getting picky here, but I with that the focus was just a TAD sharper on the bird.  You have done a great job with the blurred background.  It creates an atmosphere where the bird stands out nicely, and is not disturbed by anything in the background.  I like how you have positioned the bird within the photo, and the stick is also positioned nicely.  I wonder what kind of effect it would have on the photo if there were a bit more space in front of the bird, to make it look less like he was staring directly into a wall (edge of the photo).  Somthing to try anyway.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I might be getting picky here, but I with that the focus was just a TAD sharper on the bird.  You have done a great job with the blurred background.  It creates an atmosphere where the bird stands out nicely, and is not disturbed by anything in the background.  I like how you have positioned the bird within the photo, and the stick is also positioned nicely.  I wonder what kind of effect it would have on the photo if there were a bit more space in front of the bird, to make it look less like he was staring directly into a wall (edge of the photo).  Somthing to try anyway.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-11 01:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(169916, 9313, 3280, '<td valign="top">I''ve been looking at this one in the thumbnails and waiting to get to it.  Very nice compostion. It seems a bit grainey though. DPz</td>', 'I''ve been looking at this one in the thumbnails and waiting to get to it.  Very nice compostion. It seems a bit grainey though. DPz', '2002-12-11 01:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(169917, 9553, 3080, '<td valign="top">A great idea, excelent use of negative space.  Color is good.  My only nitpick is that the lighting seems to be washing out the white tag.  The edges aren''t very distinct at all.  I think that the lighting on the foil is good though, but just too bright for the white tag.  Love the placement within the photo.  bottom left is a great choice for this, with the tag leading toward the center of the shot.  Your focus and clarity are really nice as well.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'A great idea, excelent use of negative space.  Color is good.  My only nitpick is that the lighting seems to be washing out the white tag.  The edges aren''t very distinct at all.  I think that the lighting on the foil is good though, but just too bright for the white tag.  Love the placement within the photo.  bottom left is a great choice for this, with the tag leading toward the center of the shot.  Your focus and clarity are really nice as well.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-11 01:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(169918, 9526, 3280, '<td valign="top">Neat shot, colors are great and I love the title.  Which one is borrowed?  Good job.  DPz</td>', 'Neat shot, colors are great and I love the title.  Which one is borrowed?  Good job.  DPz', '2002-12-11 01:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
