(169922, 9379, 3080, '<td valign="top">very nice subject.  You have nicely executed the subject its self, however the background is aweful.  The sky is white out, and the tree is muted by lighting conditions as well.  I find that a bit distracting.  Otherwise, focus and clarity on the subject are good, and your angle and framing/cropping are also nice.  I kind of wish we could see the rest of the names, but the photo wouldn''t be the same without the wreath.  good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'very nice subject.  You have nicely executed the subject its self, however the background is aweful.  The sky is white out, and the tree is muted by lighting conditions as well.  I find that a bit distracting.  Otherwise, focus and clarity on the subject are good, and your angle and framing/cropping are also nice.  I kind of wish we could see the rest of the names, but the photo wouldn''t be the same without the wreath.  good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-11 01:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(169923, 9315, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I really like your title too.  It seems as if the center of the focus is just a bit behind the flowers. More on the dead blossoms.  I like the contrast though. DPz</td>', 'Nice shot.  I really like your title too.  It seems as if the center of the focus is just a bit behind the flowers. More on the dead blossoms.  I like the contrast though. DPz', '2002-12-11 01:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
