(169937, 9550, 3080, '<td valign="top">wow wow wow.  I''d like to know how this was made.  those look like sunflower seeds.  are they strung on a string, or glued together, or what?  really cool.  I wish that the lighting wasn''t quite so dark on the bottom right, but that''s minor.  The focus and clarity are great, and the angle and framing/cropping you have chosen is nice as well.  I like this dead center. good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'wow wow wow.  I''d like to know how this was made.  those look like sunflower seeds.  are they strung on a string, or glued together, or what?  really cool.  I wish that the lighting wasn''t quite so dark on the bottom right, but that''s minor.  The focus and clarity are great, and the angle and framing/cropping you have chosen is nice as well.  I like this dead center. good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-11 02:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(169938, 9298, 3080, '<td valign="top">Colors are a bit muted, but still a very pretty shot.  I really like the clouds.  gives me a sense of calmness.  the building/structure thing to the left is a good touch.  give just enough of "something" to make this interesting.  I wonder how this would look if you upped the saturation just a tad.  just something to try.  good luck in the chalelnge.</td>', 'Colors are a bit muted, but still a very pretty shot.  I really like the clouds.  gives me a sense of calmness.  the building/structure thing to the left is a good touch.  give just enough of "something" to make this interesting.  I wonder how this would look if you upped the saturation just a tad.  just something to try.  good luck in the chalelnge.', '2002-12-11 02:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(169939, 9369, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is a really great idea.  This is a christmas card for sure.  I love it.  The angle and framing/cropping is great.  I like the added space at the top, and the border really sets this off.   colors are great, as is the focus and clarity.  I am not sure if I might like to see the bottom of the apple in focus or not.  I think it''s ok as is, but maybe I''d like to see it with the bottom in focus for comparrison.  what a wonderful, pleasing to look at shot.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is a really great idea.  This is a christmas card for sure.  I love it.  The angle and framing/cropping is great.  I like the added space at the top, and the border really sets this off.   colors are great, as is the focus and clarity.  I am not sure if I might like to see the bottom of the apple in focus or not.  I think it''s ok as is, but maybe I''d like to see it with the bottom in focus for comparrison.  what a wonderful, pleasing to look at shot.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-11 02:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
