(169989, 9553, 749, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, and good use of negative space. The white background, presumably brightened using levels, unfortunately makes the label merge into it (intentional?),  making the label seem separate from the main subject, which in my opinion detracts from the overall image.</td>', 'Interesting idea, and good use of negative space. The white background, presumably brightened using levels, unfortunately makes the label merge into it (intentional?),  making the label seem separate from the main subject, which in my opinion detracts from the overall image.', '2002-12-11 07:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(169994, 9506, 749, '<td valign="top">This is definitely an image that needs the greyscale below it :o) The blues and oranges work well together, and the mix of ripples and reflections helps add interest to the image. However, I personally would have cropped off the lower quarter (maybe lower third), since I feel that that area doesn''t add anything.</td>', 'This is definitely an image that needs the greyscale below it :o) The blues and oranges work well together, and the mix of ripples and reflections helps add interest to the image. However, I personally would have cropped off the lower quarter (maybe lower third), since I feel that that area doesn''t add anything.', '2002-12-11 07:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(169995, 9336, 749, '<td valign="top">I have to admit that I have no idea what object this is really a photo of, nor how you got the colours like they are, so I''ll be very curious to see how it was done :o)</td>', 'I have to admit that I have no idea what object this is really a photo of, nor how you got the colours like they are, so I''ll be very curious to see how it was done :o)', '2002-12-11 07:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(169997, 9538, 749, '<td valign="top">Nice use of B&amp;W. However, the angle &amp; crop of the shot doesn''t seem to help lead the eye along the pipes (especially in the upper left), making it feel a little confused. That said, the eye is drawn to three circular features (valves?). I''ll be curious to see if you have any alternate versions of this shot, as I do like the subject matter that you chose.</td>', 'Nice use of B&W. However, the angle & crop of the shot doesn''t seem to help lead the eye along the pipes (especially in the upper left), making it feel a little confused. That said, the eye is drawn to three circular features (valves?). I''ll be curious to see if you have any alternate versions of this shot, as I do like the subject matter that you chose.', '2002-12-11 07:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(170000, 9586, 749, '<td valign="top">An interesting shot, but unfortunately the highlights seem blown-out, which makes it very hard to work out that there''s a twig inside the ice. Perhaps a softer light would have helped here.</td>', 'An interesting shot, but unfortunately the highlights seem blown-out, which makes it very hard to work out that there''s a twig inside the ice. Perhaps a softer light would have helped here.', '2002-12-11 07:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(170006, 9345, 1024, '<td valign="top">Such wonderful texture!  This is one of the best macro shots I have seen in a long time.</td>', 'Such wonderful texture!  This is one of the best macro shots I have seen in a long time.', '2002-12-11 07:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(170007, 9450, 749, '<td valign="top">Firstly, the colours feel very orange/red, which may have been due to your lighting or the WB of the camera. Secondly, there doesn''t seem to be a focal point - this would have been a good opportunity to use a shallower DoF to highlight one part of the guitar. Also, if the shot was rotated anti-clockwise (or counter-clockwise if you''re american), the strings could have led the eye from the top left corner down into the image. <br/> <br/>That all said, I do like this shot :o)</td>', 'Firstly, the colours feel very orange/red, which may have been due to your lighting or the WB of the camera. Secondly, there doesn''t seem to be a focal point - this would have been a good opportunity to use a shallower DoF to highlight one part of the guitar. Also, if the shot was rotated anti-clockwise (or counter-clockwise if you''re american), the strings could have led the eye from the top left corner down into the image.  That all said, I do like this shot :o)', '2002-12-11 07:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(170008, 9494, 1024, '<td valign="top">I wonder why you choose to do this in B&amp;W.  I think that the colors must be marvolous here and my eye longs to see that.  The composition is very strong and I like that you have given the man room to move across the photo.</td>', 'I wonder why you choose to do this in B&W.  I think that the colors must be marvolous here and my eye longs to see that.  The composition is very strong and I like that you have given the man room to move across the photo.', '2002-12-11 07:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(170010, 9582, 749, '<td valign="top">The softness of the ball, combined with the mix of focus on the middle branch, makes my eyes water trying to focus properly -  there doesn''t appear to be a clear focal point to the image either. However, the colours and background contrast really make the ball jump out.</td>', 'The softness of the ball, combined with the mix of focus on the middle branch, makes my eyes water trying to focus properly -  there doesn''t appear to be a clear focal point to the image either. However, the colours and background contrast really make the ball jump out.', '2002-12-11 07:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(170012, 9417, 1024, '<td valign="top">What a cute dog!  I very much like the negative space you have left around the dog.  Blue was a nice color for the frame as well.  This could be used for your Christmas card this year :-)</td>', 'What a cute dog!  I very much like the negative space you have left around the dog.  Blue was a nice color for the frame as well.  This could be used for your Christmas card this year :-)', '2002-12-11 07:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(170013, 9582, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice photograph. The one small thing that disturbs me is the tiny bit of pine that is not in focus.  Everything else is so crisp and clear, that bit seems out of place.  Wonderful colors.</td>', 'This is a very nice photograph. The one small thing that disturbs me is the tiny bit of pine that is not in focus.  Everything else is so crisp and clear, that bit seems out of place.  Wonderful colors.', '2002-12-11 07:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(170015, 9553, 1024, '<td valign="top">Very good use of negative space.</td>', 'Very good use of negative space.', '2002-12-11 07:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(170016, 9538, 1024, '<td valign="top">Such strong lines!  I love this photograph.  I think that the use of B&amp;W just adds another element of clarity.  Great job!</td>', 'Such strong lines!  I love this photograph.  I think that the use of B&W just adds another element of clarity.  Great job!', '2002-12-11 07:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(170018, 9495, 749, '<td valign="top">How long did it take you to light this scene? :o) There''s a nice range of colours in this shot, but the dead space in the lower left makes it shot feel like the focal point(s) are on the very edges of the photo.</td>', 'How long did it take you to light this scene? :o) There''s a nice range of colours in this shot, but the dead space in the lower left makes it shot feel like the focal point(s) are on the very edges of the photo.', '2002-12-11 07:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(170019, 9450, 1024, '<td valign="top">Very fine use of lines and diagonals. I like how the strings are diagonal in one direction and the bridge (?) is diagonal in another, and they meet at the focus point. This is a very strong photograph.  Good luck!</td>', 'Very fine use of lines and diagonals. I like how the strings are diagonal in one direction and the bridge (?) is diagonal in another, and they meet at the focus point. This is a very strong photograph.  Good luck!', '2002-12-11 08:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(170020, 9503, 1024, '<td valign="top">Very good use of Black and White.  The composition is very good as well.</td>', 'Very good use of Black and White.  The composition is very good as well.', '2002-12-11 08:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(170024, 9578, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful macro shot.  Your DOF is perfect and the clarity is very good.  I especially like the way the second small twig is "pointing" to the larger one that is the main subject.  Good luck!</td>', 'This is a wonderful macro shot.  Your DOF is perfect and the clarity is very good.  I especially like the way the second small twig is "pointing" to the larger one that is the main subject.  Good luck!', '2002-12-11 08:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(170025, 9546, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is a great Black and White photograph.  The silouette of the bare tree gives this photograph a strength that would not be seen in a color version of the same scene.  Very nice!!!</td>', 'This is a great Black and White photograph.  The silouette of the bare tree gives this photograph a strength that would not be seen in a color version of the same scene.  Very nice!!!', '2002-12-11 08:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(170033, 9417, 4615, '<td valign="top">Dixie is gorgeous, and full of character.</td>', 'Dixie is gorgeous, and full of character.', '2002-12-11 08:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(170034, 9546, 5455, '<td valign="top">Very disturbing and moody. Love the sky; I''m a sucker for silhouettes.</td>', 'Very disturbing and moody. Love the sky; I''m a sucker for silhouettes.', '2002-12-11 08:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(170035, 9482, 772, '<td valign="top">very nice!  The detail here is excellent.  My personal preference on this would have been less centered, but this is a great shot... good work :) - 10 - setzler</td>', 'very nice!  The detail here is excellent.  My personal preference on this would have been less centered, but this is a great shot... good work :) - 10 - setzler', '2002-12-11 08:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(170036, 9582, 5455, '<td valign="top">Love that color, great lighting. Pine needles in foreground out of focus is distracting</td>', 'Love that color, great lighting. Pine needles in foreground out of focus is distracting', '2002-12-11 08:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(170037, 9583, 5455, '<td valign="top">What can I say - great color! Very sinuous curves, very relaxing. I''d hang this one on my wall!</td>', 'What can I say - great color! Very sinuous curves, very relaxing. I''d hang this one on my wall!', '2002-12-11 08:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(170038, 9378, 5455, '<td valign="top">This photo could be improved with clean surfaces; dust and dirt in macro shots, to me, is very distracting.</td>', 'This photo could be improved with clean surfaces; dust and dirt in macro shots, to me, is very distracting.', '2002-12-11 08:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(170039, 9417, 5455, '<td valign="top">That doggie looks as if he''d just been told they stopped making MilkBones. Great portrait, great lighting and background.</td>', 'That doggie looks as if he''d just been told they stopped making MilkBones. Great portrait, great lighting and background.', '2002-12-11 08:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(170040, 9313, 4905, '<td valign="top">Good lighting.  Is the background photoshopped?</td>', 'Good lighting.  Is the background photoshopped?', '2002-12-11 08:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(170042, 9582, 4615, '<td valign="top">perfect xmas card</td>', 'perfect xmas card', '2002-12-11 08:38:16.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(170043, 9465, 4615, '<td valign="top">green eyes, Joilette lips.</td>', 'green eyes, Joilette lips.', '2002-12-11 08:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(170044, 9310, 749, '<td valign="top">A fun portrait and good use of magic-hour lighting. The only thing detracting from this image is the background, but since the subject fills most of the frame, it isn''t too much of an issue.</td>', 'A fun portrait and good use of magic-hour lighting. The only thing detracting from this image is the background, but since the subject fills most of the frame, it isn''t too much of an issue.', '2002-12-11 08:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(170045, 9551, 4615, '<td valign="top">really confuses the eye about up and down, horizontal or vertical.</td>', 'really confuses the eye about up and down, horizontal or vertical.', '2002-12-11 08:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(170046, 9506, 4615, '<td valign="top">very dark</td>', 'very dark', '2002-12-11 08:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(170049, 9559, 749, '<td valign="top">I suspect that the camera is the limiting factor for this shot, but it might have been worth running a image cleanup like NeatImage over this shot to remove some of the grainyness. Also, if possible, a closer crop on the bird would help make it the main focus of the image, rather than being hidden by the metalwork.</td>', 'I suspect that the camera is the limiting factor for this shot, but it might have been worth running a image cleanup like NeatImage over this shot to remove some of the grainyness. Also, if possible, a closer crop on the bird would help make it the main focus of the image, rather than being hidden by the metalwork.', '2002-12-11 08:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(170050, 9575, 749, '<td valign="top">Great shot, good colours, and an interesting subject. However, the size of the image hides much of the detail, which is a shame. It also may have been worth flipping left to right, so that the curve of the fork leads the eye from the left side of the image to the snail.</td>', 'Great shot, good colours, and an interesting subject. However, the size of the image hides much of the detail, which is a shame. It also may have been worth flipping left to right, so that the curve of the fork leads the eye from the left side of the image to the snail.', '2002-12-11 08:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(170051, 9436, 4615, '<td valign="top">best squirrel shot, but wats going on with his tail?</td>', 'best squirrel shot, but wats going on with his tail?', '2002-12-11 08:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(170052, 9585, 4615, '<td valign="top">title is accurate.</td>', 'title is accurate.', '2002-12-11 08:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(170053, 9463, 749, '<td valign="top">The composition of this photo is good, but the lighting doesn''t help highlight the water droplets on the lemon skins, and the crop &amp; angle means that a potentially interesting reflection off the surfacetop has been lost. I''d also suggest using a second light from the righthand side, to help bring some warmth to the colours.</td>', 'The composition of this photo is good, but the lighting doesn''t help highlight the water droplets on the lemon skins, and the crop & angle means that a potentially interesting reflection off the surfacetop has been lost. I''d also suggest using a second light from the righthand side, to help bring some warmth to the colours.', '2002-12-11 08:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(170054, 9312, 2000, '<td valign="top">I like the mirror - wouldn''t have seen it if not for a tiny difference in lighting.</td>', 'I like the mirror - wouldn''t have seen it if not for a tiny difference in lighting.', '2002-12-11 08:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(170055, 9510, 749, '<td valign="top">Nice use of DoF, and the lighting is well balanced. However, the expression on the kid''s face doesn''t create any interest in the photo for me.</td>', 'Nice use of DoF, and the lighting is well balanced. However, the expression on the kid''s face doesn''t create any interest in the photo for me.', '2002-12-11 08:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(170057, 9485, 749, '<td valign="top">Great shot! The angle is perfect, the use of b&amp;w is spot on, and the overexposure of the window works well.</td>', 'Great shot! The angle is perfect, the use of b&w is spot on, and the overexposure of the window works well.', '2002-12-11 08:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(170058, 9522, 749, '<td valign="top">Unusually, I feel that this photo is a touch too bright, and needs a little more contrast to help add more texture to the (well focused) details of the wood.</td>', 'Unusually, I feel that this photo is a touch too bright, and needs a little more contrast to help add more texture to the (well focused) details of the wood.', '2002-12-11 09:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(170061, 9552, 749, '<td valign="top">The colours in this shot are great, giving a good contrast between the leaf and the background. The diagonal of the leaf is also good for leading the eye into the shot, but the waterline along the top of the frame is a bit distracting. A slightly deeper DoF would get all of the leaf in focus, including the nearside, which I think would help this image.</td>', 'The colours in this shot are great, giving a good contrast between the leaf and the background. The diagonal of the leaf is also good for leading the eye into the shot, but the waterline along the top of the frame is a bit distracting. A slightly deeper DoF would get all of the leaf in focus, including the nearside, which I think would help this image.', '2002-12-11 09:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(170062, 9585, 749, '<td valign="top">Composition of this shot is very good, detracted only by the lighting, which is a bit too bright, especially on the nose and the hair in the upper-right corner. Other than that, it''s a great portrait shot.</td>', 'Composition of this shot is very good, detracted only by the lighting, which is a bit too bright, especially on the nose and the hair in the upper-right corner. Other than that, it''s a great portrait shot.', '2002-12-11 09:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(170063, 9340, 749, '<td valign="top">The circular markings / highlights on the paper are a good continuation of the circles of the central object, but it really needs a bit more contrast to make them stand out. A squarer crop might also help here.</td>', 'The circular markings / highlights on the paper are a good continuation of the circles of the central object, but it really needs a bit more contrast to make them stand out. A squarer crop might also help here.', '2002-12-11 09:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(170067, 9433, 749, '<td valign="top">Hmm.... what can I say about this one... :o) Hmm.... the tower could do with being rotated about 1 degree clockwise, since the main grey/white boundary line is very slightly angled. Other than that, the composition is good, the colours contrast well against the background sky, and the RoT is observed to reasonably good effect.</td>', 'Hmm.... what can I say about this one... :o) Hmm.... the tower could do with being rotated about 1 degree clockwise, since the main grey/white boundary line is very slightly angled. Other than that, the composition is good, the colours contrast well against the background sky, and the RoT is observed to reasonably good effect.', '2002-12-11 09:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(170069, 9315, 749, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about the use of b&amp;w in this shot - it helps make the flowers stand out, yet it doesn''t help emphasise any textures, making it feel a bit flat. The lack of a flower in the centre of the cluster makes the shot feel like its in two halves, but the stalk/dead flower that is there just about binds the two parts together.</td>', 'I''m not sure about the use of b&w in this shot - it helps make the flowers stand out, yet it doesn''t help emphasise any textures, making it feel a bit flat. The lack of a flower in the centre of the cluster makes the shot feel like its in two halves, but the stalk/dead flower that is there just about binds the two parts together.', '2002-12-11 09:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(170070, 9386, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful and would have worked for motion as well.  I especially like the composition here.</td>', 'This is beautiful and would have worked for motion as well.  I especially like the composition here.', '2002-12-11 09:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(170071, 9561, 749, '<td valign="top">The lighting and colours in this shot are great. However, there isn''t a main focal point in the image, so it lacks any interest after the initial glance.</td>', 'The lighting and colours in this shot are great. However, there isn''t a main focal point in the image, so it lacks any interest after the initial glance.', '2002-12-11 09:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(170072, 9378, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is a great composition and the colors are dynamic!  Good Luck!!</td>', 'This is a great composition and the colors are dynamic!  Good Luck!!', '2002-12-11 09:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(170075, 9388, 1024, '<td valign="top">As much as I do like this photo, there does not seem to be a specific focus point.  My eye tends to wanderback and forth looking for the place to stop.  This would do well in one of those "what is it" quizzes.</td>', 'As much as I do like this photo, there does not seem to be a specific focus point.  My eye tends to wanderback and forth looking for the place to stop.  This would do well in one of those "what is it" quizzes.', '2002-12-11 09:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(170077, 9553, 772, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot... I love the effective use of negative space here... this wold make a great christmas card photo :) great shot... - setzler</td>', 'Excellent shot... I love the effective use of negative space here... this wold make a great christmas card photo :) great shot... - setzler', '2002-12-11 09:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(170081, 9496, 749, '<td valign="top">This shot makes me want to know what on earth this sign is for :o) The positioning of the sign within the shot is good, yet the background seems to be too bright - the sign is in shadow, but most of the background is in direct sunlight. Perhaps a different angle could have got more of the shadowed background behind the sign, or a levels adjustment maybe. In addition, a shallower DoF, focused on the sign and blurring the background, might have helped make the sign jump out more as the main subject of the image.</td>', 'This shot makes me want to know what on earth this sign is for :o) The positioning of the sign within the shot is good, yet the background seems to be too bright - the sign is in shadow, but most of the background is in direct sunlight. Perhaps a different angle could have got more of the shadowed background behind the sign, or a levels adjustment maybe. In addition, a shallower DoF, focused on the sign and blurring the background, might have helped make the sign jump out more as the main subject of the image.', '2002-12-11 09:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(170082, 9417, 749, '<td valign="top">Great focus and lighting, but its overpowered by the very bold border, negating the negative space affect of the spaces to the left and right of the dog.</td>', 'Great focus and lighting, but its overpowered by the very bold border, negating the negative space affect of the spaces to the left and right of the dog.', '2002-12-11 09:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(170084, 9298, 749, '<td valign="top">The colours and textures of the sky &amp; clouds in this shot are great, but its let down by the (slightly out of focus) building on the left, since it distracts rather than providing context. A different crop might also have avoided the greenish patch in the top-centre of the shot (lens-flare?).</td>', 'The colours and textures of the sky & clouds in this shot are great, but its let down by the (slightly out of focus) building on the left, since it distracts rather than providing context. A different crop might also have avoided the greenish patch in the top-centre of the shot (lens-flare?).', '2002-12-11 09:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(170086, 9491, 749, '<td valign="top">A good portrait shot, and the lighting is nicely even. I personally would have cropped the righthand side of this shot more, so that the child''s head isn''t as central, and perhaps brightened the shot a little more, but doing so without losing the textures would be tricky.</td>', 'A good portrait shot, and the lighting is nicely even. I personally would have cropped the righthand side of this shot more, so that the child''s head isn''t as central, and perhaps brightened the shot a little more, but doing so without losing the textures would be tricky.', '2002-12-11 09:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(170087, 9550, 749, '<td valign="top">Did you make this yourself?? It''s a very ususual subject, thats for sure :o) Considering that the seed casings are quite dark, perhaps a brighter background would have made the ball stand out more. As it is, the lighting is maybe a bit too yellowy, and puts much of the shot in shadow - another light from the righthand side might help balance this up a bit more. In addition, a squarer crop may help in this case.</td>', 'Did you make this yourself?? It''s a very ususual subject, thats for sure :o) Considering that the seed casings are quite dark, perhaps a brighter background would have made the ball stand out more. As it is, the lighting is maybe a bit too yellowy, and puts much of the shot in shadow - another light from the righthand side might help balance this up a bit more. In addition, a squarer crop may help in this case.', '2002-12-11 10:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(170090, 9465, 749, '<td valign="top">Great use of dramatic lighting, combined with the upward gaze, really adds interest to this shot, as does the use of negative space. However, I personally wouldn''t have centred the shot so much, and would crop so that there isn''t so much darkness below the face, emphasising the darkness above. The focus on the subject is good, and the lighting hasn''t blown out anywhere, which is impressive.</td>', 'Great use of dramatic lighting, combined with the upward gaze, really adds interest to this shot, as does the use of negative space. However, I personally wouldn''t have centred the shot so much, and would crop so that there isn''t so much darkness below the face, emphasising the darkness above. The focus on the subject is good, and the lighting hasn''t blown out anywhere, which is impressive.', '2002-12-11 10:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(170093, 9510, 3018, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  Excellent focus on the child.  I like the blurry background and the space in front of the child.  Good luck!</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  Excellent focus on the child.  I like the blurry background and the space in front of the child.  Good luck!', '2002-12-11 10:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(170094, 9378, 3018, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and focus on this picture.  Reminds me of my childhood.  I don''t quite like the dark area on the background and the hot spot on one of the marbles, as I feel distract a little.  Good luck!</td>', 'I like the composition and focus on this picture.  Reminds me of my childhood.  I don''t quite like the dark area on the background and the hot spot on one of the marbles, as I feel distract a little.  Good luck!', '2002-12-11 10:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(170095, 9497, 3540, '<td valign="top">This picture is a little grainy.  Its not really clear either as I think it could be, which would make this a much better picture. - Inspzil</td>', 'This picture is a little grainy.  Its not really clear either as I think it could be, which would make this a much better picture. - Inspzil', '2002-12-11 10:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(170097, 9526, 749, '<td valign="top">So which canoe/kayak is the borrowed one? :o) The clean red really stands out in this shot, and it contrasts well against the older-looking hulls. Composition wise, I''d have liked to see a little more of the blue hull, or perhaps a slightly wider or closer crop (depending on what you wanted to make the main subject), but I do like this crop.</td>', 'So which canoe/kayak is the borrowed one? :o) The clean red really stands out in this shot, and it contrasts well against the older-looking hulls. Composition wise, I''d have liked to see a little more of the blue hull, or perhaps a slightly wider or closer crop (depending on what you wanted to make the main subject), but I do like this crop.', '2002-12-11 10:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(170099, 9561, 3540, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  The only thing I think it needs is a point of focus of some sort. - Inspzil</td>', 'Interesting shot.  The only thing I think it needs is a point of focus of some sort. - Inspzil', '2002-12-11 10:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(170100, 9378, 749, '<td valign="top">Good choice of subject matter in this shot, but I feel that it has let down in several areas - the lighting is very bright and has blown out some of the highlights, the main surface and background are a bit distracting, and the marble with some interesting surface texture (the cracked-looking one in the middle) could have made a good central focal point, if placed closer to the front of the shot.</td>', 'Good choice of subject matter in this shot, but I feel that it has let down in several areas - the lighting is very bright and has blown out some of the highlights, the main surface and background are a bit distracting, and the marble with some interesting surface texture (the cracked-looking one in the middle) could have made a good central focal point, if placed closer to the front of the shot.', '2002-12-11 10:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(170103, 9531, 749, '<td valign="top">I really like the lines of this shot, with the repetition of the frontage leading the eye from the upper left corner down across the shot. The colours in this shot contrast well, but the refleactions make it very unclear as to what exactly the orange &amp; reds are caused by - fire? I''ll have to wait until the results I guess :o)<br/> <br/>One thing about the border - it feels like its overpowering the main body of the photo - I''d recommend a border only about half as wide as this one, at most.</td>', 'I really like the lines of this shot, with the repetition of the frontage leading the eye from the upper left corner down across the shot. The colours in this shot contrast well, but the refleactions make it very unclear as to what exactly the orange & reds are caused by - fire? I''ll have to wait until the results I guess :o) One thing about the border - it feels like its overpowering the main body of the photo - I''d recommend a border only about half as wide as this one, at most.', '2002-12-11 10:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(170104, 9575, 3540, '<td valign="top">Bigger is better.  I''d like to be able to see the photo a little better.  Nice concept for a shot.  Lighting looks pretty good as well as the angle.  From what I can see, nice shot. - Inspzil</td>', 'Bigger is better.  I''d like to be able to see the photo a little better.  Nice concept for a shot.  Lighting looks pretty good as well as the angle.  From what I can see, nice shot. - Inspzil', '2002-12-11 10:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(170106, 9396, 749, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of silhouettes, but the lack of texture or depth makes the shot feel overly flat, which then seems to clash with the way the thread is trying to give depth. Sorry for not being able to explain it better than that...</td>', 'Interesting use of silhouettes, but the lack of texture or depth makes the shot feel overly flat, which then seems to clash with the way the thread is trying to give depth. Sorry for not being able to explain it better than that...', '2002-12-11 10:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(170110, 9447, 3459, '<td valign="top">Pertty model, and a nice composition, but a the colours are a bit soft for my taste.</td>', 'Pertty model, and a nice composition, but a the colours are a bit soft for my taste.', '2002-12-11 10:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(170111, 9369, 749, '<td valign="top">Cleverly done :o)  Perhaps a second light on the righthand side would help balance the image, and a slight adjustment on the crop so that the rightmost holly leaf isnt as close to the border might help too.</td>', 'Cleverly done :o)  Perhaps a second light on the righthand side would help balance the image, and a slight adjustment on the crop so that the rightmost holly leaf isnt as close to the border might help too.', '2002-12-11 10:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(170112, 9568, 3459, '<td valign="top">Nice silouet image, I think it would''ve worked even better have you taken this shot from a lower angel.</td>', 'Nice silouet image, I think it would''ve worked even better have you taken this shot from a lower angel.', '2002-12-11 10:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(170113, 9497, 3459, '<td valign="top">Nice use of DOF, though the image seems a bit pixelated.</td>', 'Nice use of DOF, though the image seems a bit pixelated.', '2002-12-11 10:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(170114, 9417, 3459, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, though the border is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Nice shot, though the border is a bit distracting.', '2002-12-11 10:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(170115, 9519, 3459, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, a bit of sharpening or more contrast would have worked even better; I think.</td>', 'Interesting shot, a bit of sharpening or more contrast would have worked even better; I think.', '2002-12-11 11:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(170118, 9459, 3459, '<td valign="top">Cute shot, unfortunatly I, personally, don\''t see anything more than that.  This picture has a feel of snapshot to me.  The upper right conner,  might have been cropped.  Just an opinon.</td>', 'Cute shot, unfortunatly I, personally, don\''t see anything more than that.  This picture has a feel of snapshot to me.  The upper right conner,  might have been cropped.  Just an opinon.', '2002-12-11 11:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(170119, 9503, 3459, '<td valign="top">While the title make''s one understand the image, a lot more shadows would have made it more interesting.  Just an opinion.</td>', 'While the title make''s one understand the image, a lot more shadows would have made it more interesting.  Just an opinion.', '2002-12-11 11:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(170121, 9298, 3459, '<td valign="top">Good idea, however the image seems flat, the colour looks a bit soft, and the structure''s alignment is a bit off.  Just an opinion.</td>', 'Good idea, however the image seems flat, the colour looks a bit soft, and the structure''s alignment is a bit off.  Just an opinion.', '2002-12-11 11:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(170122, 9439, 3459, '<td valign="top">While the concept is nice, the execution seems to be a bit off.  The image seems too soft, as well as, the subject in the lower left portion of the image seems out of place, the image in the window has too much detail.  B&amp;W might''ve been a better choice, also.  Just an opinion.</td>', 'While the concept is nice, the execution seems to be a bit off.  The image seems too soft, as well as, the subject in the lower left portion of the image seems out of place, the image in the window has too much detail.  B&W might''ve been a better choice, also.  Just an opinion.', '2002-12-11 11:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(170123, 9473, 3459, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept, however the background is a bit distracting, and the colour could be more saturated.  Just and opinion.</td>', 'Interesting concept, however the background is a bit distracting, and the colour could be more saturated.  Just and opinion.', '2002-12-11 11:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(170129, 9521, 749, '<td valign="top">This is an amazingly good candid shot, and the use of b&amp;w is the perfect choice for this. The framing so that the background face echoes the main subject is either very well spotted, or incredibly good luck :o) Perhaps a touch more light on the jacket would have helped, but given that its a candid I know that you would have had little control over that. I am curious however as to what the background is, since the edges of it are very clean, and there appears to be a foldline down part of it...</td>', 'This is an amazingly good candid shot, and the use of b&w is the perfect choice for this. The framing so that the background face echoes the main subject is either very well spotted, or incredibly good luck :o) Perhaps a touch more light on the jacket would have helped, but given that its a candid I know that you would have had little control over that. I am curious however as to what the background is, since the edges of it are very clean, and there appears to be a foldline down part of it...', '2002-12-11 11:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(170138, 9390, 2, '<td valign="top">It is really amazing how all of these things are interacting with each other.  It''s tough to tell when the real world begins and ends, and I think that''s largely because of the great lighting you''ve used.  Very nice job.</td>', 'It is really amazing how all of these things are interacting with each other.  It''s tough to tell when the real world begins and ends, and I think that''s largely because of the great lighting you''ve used.  Very nice job.', '2002-12-11 11:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(170139, 9383, 2, '<td valign="top">This picture works really well as an abstract shot.  I''d be interested to see the same shot with your light source moved to different angles around the trumpet.</td>', 'This picture works really well as an abstract shot.  I''d be interested to see the same shot with your light source moved to different angles around the trumpet.', '2002-12-11 11:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(170140, 9417, 2123, '<td valign="top">This dog has the best expression EVER. :-)  The clarity and focus are wonderful and she really does look like she has something important to tell you. 10!</td>', 'This dog has the best expression EVER. :-)  The clarity and focus are wonderful and she really does look like she has something important to tell you. 10!', '2002-12-11 11:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(170143, 9510, 2123, '<td valign="top">What beautiful eyes!  The lighting is wonderful and I like the depth of field here - the focus is on him and his wonderful expression. 8</td>', 'What beautiful eyes!  The lighting is wonderful and I like the depth of field here - the focus is on him and his wonderful expression. 8', '2002-12-11 11:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(170144, 9463, 2, '<td valign="top">Really great composition and bright, vivid colors.  This is one of those shots I''d consider for my new ''kitchen'' collection.</td>', 'Really great composition and bright, vivid colors.  This is one of those shots I''d consider for my new ''kitchen'' collection.', '2002-12-11 11:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(170145, 9553, 2, '<td valign="top">So simple.  So good.  I love that even the kiss itself is slightly blown out.  10.</td>', 'So simple.  So good.  I love that even the kiss itself is slightly blown out.  10.', '2002-12-11 11:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(170147, 9315, 2123, '<td valign="top">These are beautiful.  Composition is good, would have been nice if there was one more or one less flower, but ah well. :-)  I would like to see the lighting a bit brighter perhaps. 8</td>', 'These are beautiful.  Composition is good, would have been nice if there was one more or one less flower, but ah well. :-)  I would like to see the lighting a bit brighter perhaps. 8', '2002-12-11 11:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(170148, 9491, 2, '<td valign="top">Very cool choice to use a square framing on this shot -- I think it really balances the composition well.  The background is a little close to the skintone of the girl for me, but still an overall great shot.</td>', 'Very cool choice to use a square framing on this shot -- I think it really balances the composition well.  The background is a little close to the skintone of the girl for me, but still an overall great shot.', '2002-12-11 11:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(170149, 9396, 2, '<td valign="top">This shot is really cool, though it definitely hurts my eyes after just a few seconds of looking at it.  Great play on silhouettes.</td>', 'This shot is really cool, though it definitely hurts my eyes after just a few seconds of looking at it.  Great play on silhouettes.', '2002-12-11 11:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(170150, 9491, 2123, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful portrait. Framing and composition are great - she''s really got a death grip on those flowers though. The lighting is very nice as well.  8</td>', 'What a beautiful portrait. Framing and composition are great - she''s really got a death grip on those flowers though. The lighting is very nice as well.  8', '2002-12-11 11:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(170151, 9449, 2, '<td valign="top">Much of the space at the bottom of this shot seems wasted to me.  I''d almost like to be just a little closer to the action.</td>', 'Much of the space at the bottom of this shot seems wasted to me.  I''d almost like to be just a little closer to the action.', '2002-12-11 11:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(170152, 9503, 2, '<td valign="top">This shot is hilarious, and it''s also technically outstanding.  I love the dark, mistreated feel of the whole photograph.  Great job.  9.</td>', 'This shot is hilarious, and it''s also technically outstanding.  I love the dark, mistreated feel of the whole photograph.  Great job.  9.', '2002-12-11 11:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(170154, 9583, 2, '<td valign="top">Definitely my favorite shot from the week.  I do have two criticisms -- 1) I wish the stem of the glass were straight... the whole thing is tilted to the left and is off-balance in the shot.  2) I''m not crazy about the border, especially where the blue bleeds into the image.  I know 2-color borders aren''t currently allowed by the rules, but slap a 1 pixel white or black border on the inside of your blue border, straighten up the glass a little, and I promise to buy a print of this one when we offer the service.  I love the colors and shapes and light and mood of the shot too much to let my criticisms lower the score -- 10!</td>', 'Definitely my favorite shot from the week.  I do have two criticisms -- 1) I wish the stem of the glass were straight... the whole thing is tilted to the left and is off-balance in the shot.  2) I''m not crazy about the border, especially where the blue bleeds into the image.  I know 2-color borders aren''t currently allowed by the rules, but slap a 1 pixel white or black border on the inside of your blue border, straighten up the glass a little, and I promise to buy a print of this one when we offer the service.  I love the colors and shapes and light and mood of the shot too much to let my criticisms lower the score -- 10!', '2002-12-11 11:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(170155, 9310, 2, '<td valign="top">Hilarious and a really outstanding shot.  I''m very interested to know what type of camera you took this with, as the focus and color just seem so vivid.  Great job.  9</td>', 'Hilarious and a really outstanding shot.  I''m very interested to know what type of camera you took this with, as the focus and color just seem so vivid.  Great job.  9', '2002-12-11 11:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(170156, 9369, 2123, '<td valign="top">This is very nitpicky, but I''d like to see either burgandy (the peels) or red (the berries).  A very clever idea, though. 7</td>', 'This is very nitpicky, but I''d like to see either burgandy (the peels) or red (the berries).  A very clever idea, though. 7', '2002-12-11 11:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(170157, 9340, 2, '<td valign="top">A shot like this begs you to stare at the center object -- and when I do, I see the reflection of the photographer.  Without much experience on things like these, I''m not sure how to tell you to fix it.  The composition is a very good idea, though -- with the yellow on yellow.  I''d prefer to have the object perfectly centered in the background (right now, it''s low and maybe slightly to the left).</td>', 'A shot like this begs you to stare at the center object -- and when I do, I see the reflection of the photographer.  Without much experience on things like these, I''m not sure how to tell you to fix it.  The composition is a very good idea, though -- with the yellow on yellow.  I''d prefer to have the object perfectly centered in the background (right now, it''s low and maybe slightly to the left).', '2002-12-11 11:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(170158, 9582, 2, '<td valign="top">WOW.  If this were in a magazine, absolutely no question would I think the ball was airbrushed.  The effect you''ve acheived here is really amazing -- two (maybe even three) completely different and yet all incredible textures that would work well on their own... but work even better together.  I love the white space.</td>', 'WOW.  If this were in a magazine, absolutely no question would I think the ball was airbrushed.  The effect you''ve acheived here is really amazing -- two (maybe even three) completely different and yet all incredible textures that would work well on their own... but work even better together.  I love the white space.', '2002-12-11 11:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(170160, 9543, 2123, '<td valign="top">I love driftwood and this is a great piece.  It seems a little too bright and contrasty and loses some of that soft weathered feel, but still a 7. :-)</td>', 'I love driftwood and this is a great piece.  It seems a little too bright and contrasty and loses some of that soft weathered feel, but still a 7. :-)', '2002-12-11 11:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(170166, 9495, 2123, '<td valign="top">Wow, hot pink Christmas lights! lol<br/>This is a good shot and the colors are great, but it''s missing that certain something for me.  A solid 6, though. :-)</td>', 'Wow, hot pink Christmas lights! lolThis is a good shot and the colors are great, but it''s missing that certain something for me.  A solid 6, though. :-)', '2002-12-11 11:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(170176, 9575, 3080, '<td valign="top">It''s a bit small, but the detail looks good. I really like the concept and idea behind this shot.  Your angle and framing/cropping are good, with the exception of the size.  color looks nice as well.  The snail and fork stand off from the backgrounf cery nicely, and the lighting looks alright too.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'It''s a bit small, but the detail looks good. I really like the concept and idea behind this shot.  Your angle and framing/cropping are good, with the exception of the size.  color looks nice as well.  The snail and fork stand off from the backgrounf cery nicely, and the lighting looks alright too.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-11 11:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(170178, 9388, 3080, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract.  I think the pattern is ok, and the angle and framign/cropping is good too.  I like how you have filled the entire photo with the subject.  THe lighting kind of freaks out in all 4 corners, but nothing serious.  I''m not generally too fond of abstracts (even my own), so while it''s not really my thing, it is very nicely technically done. Maybe some added color some how?  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting abstract.  I think the pattern is ok, and the angle and framign/cropping is good too.  I like how you have filled the entire photo with the subject.  THe lighting kind of freaks out in all 4 corners, but nothing serious.  I''m not generally too fond of abstracts (even my own), so while it''s not really my thing, it is very nicely technically done. Maybe some added color some how?  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-11 11:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(170184, 9585, 3080, '<td valign="top">The shadows around her eyes, in combination with the hot lighting on her nose is kind of distracting.  The background is good, and the angle and framing/cropping are ok as well.  The focus around her mouth and chin seems to be a bit off, but that also could just be a product of the bright lighting.  It''s a nice portrait, and well thought out, but needs a bit of a lighting adjustment.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The shadows around her eyes, in combination with the hot lighting on her nose is kind of distracting.  The background is good, and the angle and framing/cropping are ok as well.  The focus around her mouth and chin seems to be a bit off, but that also could just be a product of the bright lighting.  It''s a nice portrait, and well thought out, but needs a bit of a lighting adjustment.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-11 11:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(170185, 9336, 3540, '<td valign="top">Awesome color on this pic.  I don''t like that some of the star got cut off though.  The blemish on the background L side 1/2way up is a bit distracting.  Overall, I like it. - Inspzil</td>', 'Awesome color on this pic.  I don''t like that some of the star got cut off though.  The blemish on the background L side 1/2way up is a bit distracting.  Overall, I like it. - Inspzil', '2002-12-11 11:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(170186, 9312, 3080, '<td valign="top">Almost looks like 2 clothes hanger racks with a wall between the 2.  I can see though, that it looks like 2 clothes hanger rack, and a mirror on the wall?  It is an interesting abstract.  The pattern is good, color is good, and focus and clarity are good.  Also, the angle and framing/cropping are well chosen.  The lighting look a bit strange, maybe cause of the shadows, but it''s not really a bad thing at all, as it inhances the patterns.  Overall nicely done. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Almost looks like 2 clothes hanger racks with a wall between the 2.  I can see though, that it looks like 2 clothes hanger rack, and a mirror on the wall?  It is an interesting abstract.  The pattern is good, color is good, and focus and clarity are good.  Also, the angle and framing/cropping are well chosen.  The lighting look a bit strange, maybe cause of the shadows, but it''s not really a bad thing at all, as it inhances the patterns.  Overall nicely done. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-11 11:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(170187, 9417, 2, '<td valign="top">This really seems like an old navy ad to me... or maybe a christmas card!  It''s probably because of the border.  You probably don''t want to hear this, but without the blue border, I''d think this shot was incredible... and I''d probably give it a 9 or a 10.  Without the border, it''s a really artistically original idea.  I love that the dog is just sitting there, head-on, like he''s having his portrait done.  Ooh... another analogy.  Without the border, this looks like a mac ''switch'' ad.  I''ve lost my mind, and it appears your comment section is taking the hit for that -- sorry!  :D</td>', 'This really seems like an old navy ad to me... or maybe a christmas card!  It''s probably because of the border.  You probably don''t want to hear this, but without the blue border, I''d think this shot was incredible... and I''d probably give it a 9 or a 10.  Without the border, it''s a really artistically original idea.  I love that the dog is just sitting there, head-on, like he''s having his portrait done.  Ooh... another analogy.  Without the border, this looks like a mac ''switch'' ad.  I''ve lost my mind, and it appears your comment section is taking the hit for that -- sorry!  :D', '2002-12-11 11:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(170188, 9396, 2302, '<td valign="top">I like this idea a lot but the processing seems a bit off. I would have liked to see more detail, or at least a little bit of color. Perhaps if you used a bright color thread and left that as the only color showing? Just an idea. =6</td>', 'I like this idea a lot but the processing seems a bit off. I would have liked to see more detail, or at least a little bit of color. Perhaps if you used a bright color thread and left that as the only color showing? Just an idea. =6', '2002-12-11 11:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(170189, 9465, 3080, '<td valign="top">Didn''t we see this in Blair Witch Project?  Just kidding, anwway, I think it is well done.  Low light like this, my camera would have freaked out and produced crap.  The angle and framing/cropping is ok.  I wonder what it would look like if she were at a different angle.  The title goes well with the shot, and I think that the lighting on the subject is good.  Definately different.  If we didn''t have experimentation though, it would be a truely boring world indeed.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Didn''t we see this in Blair Witch Project?  Just kidding, anwway, I think it is well done.  Low light like this, my camera would have freaked out and produced crap.  The angle and framing/cropping is ok.  I wonder what it would look like if she were at a different angle.  The title goes well with the shot, and I think that the lighting on the subject is good.  Definately different.  If we didn''t have experimentation though, it would be a truely boring world indeed.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-11 11:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(170190, 9521, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful black and white... I love the composition and they mystery of this particular background... great shot :) - setzler</td>', 'This is a beautiful black and white... I love the composition and they mystery of this particular background... great shot :) - setzler', '2002-12-11 11:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(170192, 9571, 2302, '<td valign="top">Nice detail here but some of the lighting seems a bit too harsh - especially on the leaf on the right and on the bottom. You might not have had much control over that though. I like the mix of colors. = 6</td>', 'Nice detail here but some of the lighting seems a bit too harsh - especially on the leaf on the right and on the bottom. You might not have had much control over that though. I like the mix of colors. = 6', '2002-12-11 11:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(170193, 9450, 3080, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Being a guitar player myself, I really like the shots like this.  I have 2 very small, minor complaints.  There is a reflection of something in the upper right corner, and the background in the upper left is a tad out of place here.  Otherwise, focus and clarity are great, lighting is great, and the angle and framing/cropping really make this shot. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful.  Being a guitar player myself, I really like the shots like this.  I have 2 very small, minor complaints.  There is a reflection of something in the upper right corner, and the background in the upper left is a tad out of place here.  Otherwise, focus and clarity are great, lighting is great, and the angle and framing/cropping really make this shot. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-11 11:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(170194, 9485, 3540, '<td valign="top">The light of the Lord.  Looks like a place of solace for this guy in his time of need.  I''d have left a little more of the color in to make it a little warmer, but this is really a nice image.  Very peaceful. - Inspzil</td>', 'The light of the Lord.  Looks like a place of solace for this guy in his time of need.  I''d have left a little more of the color in to make it a little warmer, but this is really a nice image.  Very peaceful. - Inspzil', '2002-12-11 11:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(170196, 9436, 3080, '<td valign="top">Something just does not seem right here.  Speckles, or something.  Like little purple spots on his back, around his eye, and on the tree bark.  The photo its self is adorable.  I like the angle and framing/cropping are good too.  Focus seems a tad off, but that could just be a product of those speckles.  I really like the angle though.  He''s looking at you like "dude, get out of my tree" lol.  Is that a squirrel??  He looks so  huge and has a funny tail? Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Something just does not seem right here.  Speckles, or something.  Like little purple spots on his back, around his eye, and on the tree bark.  The photo its self is adorable.  I like the angle and framing/cropping are good too.  Focus seems a tad off, but that could just be a product of those speckles.  I really like the angle though.  He''s looking at you like "dude, get out of my tree" lol.  Is that a squirrel??  He looks so  huge and has a funny tail? Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-11 11:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(170197, 9473, 772, '<td valign="top">i think this photo setup has some very nice potential, but the background color and objects are clashing a bit with the rest of the image... - setzler</td>', 'i think this photo setup has some very nice potential, but the background color and objects are clashing a bit with the rest of the image... - setzler', '2002-12-11 11:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(170198, 9583, 2302, '<td valign="top">This shot gives me a strong sense of movement from the curves and waves. I love the colors althougth the yellow spots and white glare are a bit distracting. The rim of the glass is not equal on both sides at the top of the picture and seems to get sucked out the left side a bit. Perhaps cropping a bit more off the right to equal that out would help. Just an idea. I like the shot very much overall = 8</td>', 'This shot gives me a strong sense of movement from the curves and waves. I love the colors althougth the yellow spots and white glare are a bit distracting. The rim of the glass is not equal on both sides at the top of the picture and seems to get sucked out the left side a bit. Perhaps cropping a bit more off the right to equal that out would help. Just an idea. I like the shot very much overall = 8', '2002-12-11 11:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(170199, 9519, 3080, '<td valign="top">I''d have to say I''d be a little upset if that guy banged those snares in my ear.  I might have to push him over the edge. lol.  Looks like this was taken at a game or something.  The angle and framing/cropping are ok.  I''m really glad you didn''t cut off his foot here.  The focus and clarity seem good too.  I like the slight motion blurr on his sticks.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I''d have to say I''d be a little upset if that guy banged those snares in my ear.  I might have to push him over the edge. lol.  Looks like this was taken at a game or something.  The angle and framing/cropping are ok.  I''m really glad you didn''t cut off his foot here.  The focus and clarity seem good too.  I like the slight motion blurr on his sticks.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-11 11:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(170200, 9566, 1280, '<td valign="top">Color and tonal qualities are very good.  The expression is interesting. Composition and cropping good.</td>', 'Color and tonal qualities are very good.  The expression is interesting. Composition and cropping good.', '2002-12-11 12:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(170201, 9506, 2302, '<td valign="top">Just a bit too dark for my tastes. I like the lighting on the tree and water a lot, but the part at the bottom and top don''t add much to the picture. Maybe a tighter crop to only include the middle section would emphasis the light more. = 7</td>', 'Just a bit too dark for my tastes. I like the lighting on the tree and water a lot, but the part at the bottom and top don''t add much to the picture. Maybe a tighter crop to only include the middle section would emphasis the light more. = 7', '2002-12-11 12:00:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(170203, 9559, 1280, '<td valign="top">Interesting image with lots of diagonals and some curves thrown in for good measure.</td>', 'Interesting image with lots of diagonals and some curves thrown in for good measure.', '2002-12-11 12:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(170204, 9575, 4493, '<td valign="top">I''m probably not the first to mention this, but other than the size being so small it''s hard to see the details, this is a really good picture. Nice clean lines, good color and lighting.</td>', 'I''m probably not the first to mention this, but other than the size being so small it''s hard to see the details, this is a really good picture. Nice clean lines, good color and lighting.', '2002-12-11 12:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(170206, 9310, 4493, '<td valign="top">Nice candid shot. Colors are good, good use of fill flash to soften the shadows. You have good detail without blowing out any of the features with to much light. Well done.</td>', 'Nice candid shot. Colors are good, good use of fill flash to soften the shadows. You have good detail without blowing out any of the features with to much light. Well done.', '2002-12-11 12:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(170208, 9567, 2302, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors. The sun looks huge!  The bottom part of the picture is pretty dark and doesn''t add much. I think moving the angle up so a bit more of the sky was included while still getting the outline of the trees in the sunlight would have been more appealing. = 7</td>', 'beautiful colors. The sun looks huge!  The bottom part of the picture is pretty dark and doesn''t add much. I think moving the angle up so a bit more of the sky was included while still getting the outline of the trees in the sunlight would have been more appealing. = 7', '2002-12-11 12:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(170209, 9501, 4493, '<td valign="top">DOF may be a little to shallow on this one. In my opinion, if the whole stem as well as the leaves were in focus, and the background was not, you''d have a stronger compostition. Lighting and detail on the leaves is very well done.</td>', 'DOF may be a little to shallow on this one. In my opinion, if the whole stem as well as the leaves were in focus, and the background was not, you''d have a stronger compostition. Lighting and detail on the leaves is very well done.', '2002-12-11 12:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(170213, 9379, 749, '<td valign="top">The contrast between the grey sky, black stone, and the colours of the wreath works really well, and the composition is good too.</td>', 'The contrast between the grey sky, black stone, and the colours of the wreath works really well, and the composition is good too.', '2002-12-11 12:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(170214, 9494, 2302, '<td valign="top">Nice details here. Nice framing. I like how the pinata''s at the top seem to outline the man walking - lower to the right and opening up more as it moves to the left. I would be interested to see this in color. It looks as though there might be some very vibrant colors. As it is in b/w it doesn''t hold my interest very long. = 6</td>', 'Nice details here. Nice framing. I like how the pinata''s at the top seem to outline the man walking - lower to the right and opening up more as it moves to the left. I would be interested to see this in color. It looks as though there might be some very vibrant colors. As it is in b/w it doesn''t hold my interest very long. = 6', '2002-12-11 12:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(170215, 9383, 749, '<td valign="top">This looks like its been lit by a Christmas tree or some disco lights or something ;o) The shallow DoF is great, but the blown out highlights are a bit distracting. The rich colour contrasts well against the black background, and the framing is good.</td>', 'This looks like its been lit by a Christmas tree or some disco lights or something ;o) The shallow DoF is great, but the blown out highlights are a bit distracting. The rich colour contrasts well against the black background, and the framing is good.', '2002-12-11 12:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(170216, 9491, 2302, '<td valign="top">Very nice framing. Good details on the features on the girl and on the flowers. The only thing bothering me is that the tone of her skin seems a bit off - particularly on her hand. It almost looks as thought that part was painted rather than a photo. Overall very nice = 7</td>', 'Very nice framing. Good details on the features on the girl and on the flowers. The only thing bothering me is that the tone of her skin seems a bit off - particularly on her hand. It almost looks as thought that part was painted rather than a photo. Overall very nice = 7', '2002-12-11 12:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(170217, 9463, 772, '<td valign="top">very nice composition...  I also appreciate the shallow depth of field on this shot.  however, i would have possibly made a minor rearrangemente here :)  I would have swapped the whole lemon and the cut piece in the center to bring out some more detail of the ''section''.  Those pieces that are out of the dof in the background are attracting my attention because of the ''detail''... good work :) - setzler</td>', 'very nice composition...  I also appreciate the shallow depth of field on this shot.  however, i would have possibly made a minor rearrangemente here :)  I would have swapped the whole lemon and the cut piece in the center to bring out some more detail of the ''section''.  Those pieces that are out of the dof in the background are attracting my attention because of the ''detail''... good work :) - setzler', '2002-12-11 12:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(170220, 9459, 4493, '<td valign="top">They seem to be enjoying themselves. The snow nearest the camera may be a tad blown out. A crop cutting off the snow above them would make a stronger shot, so you only see the fence behind them. Good photo.</td>', 'They seem to be enjoying themselves. The snow nearest the camera may be a tad blown out. A crop cutting off the snow above them would make a stronger shot, so you only see the fence behind them. Good photo.', '2002-12-11 12:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(170221, 9519, 749, '<td valign="top">Great candid shot, beautifully focused. However, I personally would have cropped more to the right (if possible), since the uprights on the left don''t add anything to the shot. Also, since the colours are quite muted, this may have worked well as a b&amp;w shot.</td>', 'Great candid shot, beautifully focused. However, I personally would have cropped more to the right (if possible), since the uprights on the left don''t add anything to the shot. Also, since the colours are quite muted, this may have worked well as a b&w shot.', '2002-12-11 12:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(170223, 9497, 472, '<td valign="top">great wildlife shot. it''s oversharpened, and there is a green cast.</td>', 'great wildlife shot. it''s oversharpened, and there is a green cast.', '2002-12-11 12:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(170225, 9552, 2302, '<td valign="top">I like the compliment of the curves from where the leaf is sitting as well as the water and straight lines in the stem and veins on the leaf. Nice colors and lighting. The only thing distracting me is the the section of the leaf on the lower left does not seem to have as much focus on it. = 8</td>', 'I like the compliment of the curves from where the leaf is sitting as well as the water and straight lines in the stem and veins on the leaf. Nice colors and lighting. The only thing distracting me is the the section of the leaf on the lower left does not seem to have as much focus on it. = 8', '2002-12-11 12:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(170227, 9447, 4493, '<td valign="top">Nice soft portait. My only concern is the overall flatness of the photo. I would like to see a little more contrast so that her facial features stand out more. The crops is good as well as her pose and the beads of the neckless add a nice touch.</td>', 'Nice soft portait. My only concern is the overall flatness of the photo. I would like to see a little more contrast so that her facial features stand out more. The crops is good as well as her pose and the beads of the neckless add a nice touch.', '2002-12-11 12:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(170228, 9578, 749, '<td valign="top">Wow, great macro shot! The colours, DoF, and focus are all spot-on. I''m not so sure about the twig on the left though, and I would probably crop it out of the shot, but otherwise this is a superb shot.</td>', 'Wow, great macro shot! The colours, DoF, and focus are all spot-on. I''m not so sure about the twig on the left though, and I would probably crop it out of the shot, but otherwise this is a superb shot.', '2002-12-11 12:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(170229, 9369, 2302, '<td valign="top">This is cute. I would like to see a bit more room on the right side so it was equal to the left. A little more detail on the berries would also be good they seem a bit blurred. = 7</td>', 'This is cute. I would like to see a bit more room on the right side so it was equal to the left. A little more detail on the berries would also be good they seem a bit blurred. = 7', '2002-12-11 12:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(170230, 9521, 2, '<td valign="top">This is definitely another of my favorites from the week.  I love the background in this shot -- both the face and the slanted grey, cutting through the white.  The portrait itself is very nice.  Your subject really pops out of the background, and I think that''s what makes the shot.  The left side of the image seems to fade off pretty dark, and I''m not sure if that was intentional.  9.</td>', 'This is definitely another of my favorites from the week.  I love the background in this shot -- both the face and the slanted grey, cutting through the white.  The portrait itself is very nice.  Your subject really pops out of the background, and I think that''s what makes the shot.  The left side of the image seems to fade off pretty dark, and I''m not sure if that was intentional.  9.', '2002-12-11 12:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(170231, 9463, 4493, '<td valign="top">Good composition. The lighting may be a little harsh. I know you probably went with the tight DOF to capture the foreground lemon the most, but I feel that if all the lemons were in the same DOF it would make for a stronger shot.</td>', 'Good composition. The lighting may be a little harsh. I know you probably went with the tight DOF to capture the foreground lemon the most, but I feel that if all the lemons were in the same DOF it would make for a stronger shot.', '2002-12-11 12:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(170232, 9367, 2, '<td valign="top">Compositionally, this is really a cool shot, even if a little busy.  I''m wondering if it''s oversharpened a little or if that''s just the texture of the greenery.  Awesome choice to offset this image to the top right.</td>', 'Compositionally, this is really a cool shot, even if a little busy.  I''m wondering if it''s oversharpened a little or if that''s just the texture of the greenery.  Awesome choice to offset this image to the top right.', '2002-12-11 12:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(170236, 9336, 472, '<td valign="top">i personally LOVE the colors and extremely vivid effect you got here.</td>', 'i personally LOVE the colors and extremely vivid effect you got here.', '2002-12-11 12:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(170237, 9506, 4493, '<td valign="top">Very dark shot. You may want to see if you could lighten it up a bit in post processing. The composition is OK, I may have moved the crop so the tree is further down in the shot. Good clarity and sharpening.</td>', 'Very dark shot. You may want to see if you could lighten it up a bit in post processing. The composition is OK, I may have moved the crop so the tree is further down in the shot. Good clarity and sharpening.', '2002-12-11 12:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(170239, 9495, 2, '<td valign="top">I think I see a little flaring on the lights (and no blurring), so I''m assuming you had a tripod for this photograph.  I wonder if you could have gotten a little more flaring with the lights, to make this picture really blow up.  I''ve never shot anything like this before, so I may be out in left field.</td>', 'I think I see a little flaring on the lights (and no blurring), so I''m assuming you had a tripod for this photograph.  I wonder if you could have gotten a little more flaring with the lights, to make this picture really blow up.  I''ve never shot anything like this before, so I may be out in left field.', '2002-12-11 12:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(170240, 9543, 472, '<td valign="top">excellent nature abstract. may be oversharpened but works ok in this case</td>', 'excellent nature abstract. may be oversharpened but works ok in this case', '2002-12-11 12:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(170242, 9546, 749, '<td valign="top">The bare tree silhouetted against the cloud-covered sky really works well, and is enhanced even more by the (very appropriate) use of b&amp;w. The only niggle I have is that the lower left branches merge into the side of the building, but thats minor.</td>', 'The bare tree silhouetted against the cloud-covered sky really works well, and is enhanced even more by the (very appropriate) use of b&w. The only niggle I have is that the lower left branches merge into the side of the building, but thats minor.', '2002-12-11 12:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(170243, 9578, 472, '<td valign="top">like the pseudo BW and the red works well here.</td>', 'like the pseudo BW and the red works well here.', '2002-12-11 12:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(170244, 9531, 4493, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract and good colors. The noise in the shot is a little distracting. You may want to look into NeatImage as well as unmask sharpen. I like your crop for composition.</td>', 'Nice abstract and good colors. The noise in the shot is a little distracting. You may want to look into NeatImage as well as unmask sharpen. I like your crop for composition.', '2002-12-11 12:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(170246, 9433, 2302, '<td valign="top">I really like the harsh black &amp; white against the sky. Too bad there were not any clouds the day you were shooting an all blue sky would have looked great. Nice capture of the shadows on the left side of the tower. Good framing. = 8</td>', 'I really like the harsh black & white against the sky. Too bad there were not any clouds the day you were shooting an all blue sky would have looked great. Nice capture of the shadows on the left side of the tower. Good framing. = 8', '2002-12-11 12:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(170247, 9519, 472, '<td valign="top">i worry that he will fall.  i wonder how it would have looked with him more over in the left 3rd instead of centered. cool shot</td>', 'i worry that he will fall.  i wonder how it would have looked with him more over in the left 3rd instead of centered. cool shot', '2002-12-11 12:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(170249, 9496, 4493, '<td valign="top">Did you think about using your flash on the ? sign? It may have added the punch for this shot and added a WOW factor. The crop could also be tightened so as to hide the wood holding the sign. I like the colors of the foliage behind the sign. Sharpness is OK, may want to look into unmask sharpen.</td>', 'Did you think about using your flash on the ? sign? It may have added the punch for this shot and added a WOW factor. The crop could also be tightened so as to hide the wood holding the sign. I like the colors of the foliage behind the sign. Sharpness is OK, may want to look into unmask sharpen.', '2002-12-11 12:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(170250, 9501, 472, '<td valign="top">this is like the plant equivalent of a ''comb over'' lol : )</td>', 'this is like the plant equivalent of a ''comb over'' lol : )', '2002-12-11 12:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(170252, 9315, 4493, '<td valign="top">You are a victim of a low score. I''m bumping my original one. The more I look at it the better I like it. If I were cropping it though, I would have cropped to just above the right flowers. The light grey area between the flowers at the top is a little distracting for me. Good ability to not blow out the white of the flowers while leaving the leaves light enough to see their details.</td>', 'You are a victim of a low score. I''m bumping my original one. The more I look at it the better I like it. If I were cropping it though, I would have cropped to just above the right flowers. The light grey area between the flowers at the top is a little distracting for me. Good ability to not blow out the white of the flowers while leaving the leaves light enough to see their details.', '2002-12-11 12:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(170254, 9531, 4055, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Lovely colours. I´m mad at myself for not being able to tell how it is done. Anyhow a lovely shot (8)</td>', 'Interesting. Lovely colours. I´m mad at myself for not being able to tell how it is done. Anyhow a lovely shot (8)', '2002-12-11 12:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(170256, 9345, 4055, '<td valign="top">A good photo. Well taken. Interesting colours. The composition is also good. (7)<br/>By the way, I had probably made a black or dark brown border. But THAT is a matter of taste.</td>', 'A good photo. Well taken. Interesting colours. The composition is also good. (7)By the way, I had probably made a black or dark brown border. But THAT is a matter of taste.', '2002-12-11 12:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(170257, 9439, 4055, '<td valign="top">I think this one is rather nice. Nice soft colours. A little out of focus but that makes the atmosphere. Perhaps it would be more interesting if it was cropped so it was just the left shadow. (Not sure) Anyhow a nice shot to look at. (7)</td>', 'I think this one is rather nice. Nice soft colours. A little out of focus but that makes the atmosphere. Perhaps it would be more interesting if it was cropped so it was just the left shadow. (Not sure) Anyhow a nice shot to look at. (7)', '2002-12-11 12:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(170258, 9449, 2302, '<td valign="top">A nice shot - good detail, nice compostion. Unfortunately it just doesn''t have much impact on me.  = 6</td>', 'A nice shot - good detail, nice compostion. Unfortunately it just doesn''t have much impact on me.  = 6', '2002-12-11 12:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(170259, 9575, 2302, '<td valign="top">Nice details. Good colors and composition. I would have liked to see more lighting on the snail rather than on the fork though. = 7</td>', 'Nice details. Good colors and composition. I would have liked to see more lighting on the snail rather than on the fork though. = 7', '2002-12-11 12:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(170260, 9469, 4055, '<td valign="top">Don´t know how this is done but I like it very much. Nice colours and interesting composition. (7)</td>', 'Don´t know how this is done but I like it very much. Nice colours and interesting composition. (7)', '2002-12-11 12:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(170261, 9546, 4055, '<td valign="top">Lovely b&amp;w shot. Perfect background. Interesting details. (7)</td>', 'Lovely b&w shot. Perfect background. Interesting details. (7)', '2002-12-11 12:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(170262, 9310, 2302, '<td valign="top">I would have liked a bit more room around the subject here and perhaps a focus that blurred the background a bit. Nice lighting - no distracting shadows on the face. Good colors captured. Overall it doesn''t hold my attention for much more than a glance though. = 6</td>', 'I would have liked a bit more room around the subject here and perhaps a focus that blurred the background a bit. Nice lighting - no distracting shadows on the face. Good colors captured. Overall it doesn''t hold my attention for much more than a glance though. = 6', '2002-12-11 12:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(170264, 9436, 2302, '<td valign="top">Cute :)   Nice cature - great details here. = 9</td>', 'Cute :)   Nice cature - great details here. = 9', '2002-12-11 12:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(170266, 9538, 4055, '<td valign="top">This is a good photo. Perfect in b&amp;w. The focus is also perfect and the composition is good. Nice cropping. I was not sure when I commented this last time. But I am now and have changed the score from 7 to 8. Very interesting details made it an 8.</td>', 'This is a good photo. Perfect in b&w. The focus is also perfect and the composition is good. Nice cropping. I was not sure when I commented this last time. But I am now and have changed the score from 7 to 8. Very interesting details made it an 8.', '2002-12-11 12:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(170268, 9546, 3540, '<td valign="top">The mood set by this picture is awesome.  The skeleton tree and dark buildings in the distance really set this one apart from other B&amp;W shots.  Well captured moment. - Inspzil</td>', 'The mood set by this picture is awesome.  The skeleton tree and dark buildings in the distance really set this one apart from other B&W shots.  Well captured moment. - Inspzil', '2002-12-11 12:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(170269, 9558, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting shot, but I think it would be much more appealing with a different crop or possibly placed off center some... - setzler</td>', 'interesting shot, but I think it would be much more appealing with a different crop or possibly placed off center some... - setzler', '2002-12-11 12:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(170270, 9543, 749, '<td valign="top">The shapes, lines, and detail in the grain of the wood are amazing - it''s just a shame that large areas of it are blown out. Some levels adjustments might be able to rectify this, depending on what the original was like.</td>', 'The shapes, lines, and detail in the grain of the wood are amazing - it''s just a shame that large areas of it are blown out. Some levels adjustments might be able to rectify this, depending on what the original was like.', '2002-12-11 12:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(170272, 9482, 4055, '<td valign="top">I have seen this been made before and this one is very good too. The water is perfect but I´m not so happy about the background. Everything is perfect except the colours in the water. But it´s me - I´m not so fond of strong colours. (7)</td>', 'I have seen this been made before and this one is very good too. The water is perfect but I´m not so happy about the background. Everything is perfect except the colours in the water. But it´s me - I´m not so fond of strong colours. (7)', '2002-12-11 12:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(170279, 9531, 472, '<td valign="top">excellent layers and colors. image quality for some reason is not as good as it should be.</td>', 'excellent layers and colors. image quality for some reason is not as good as it should be.', '2002-12-11 12:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(170283, 9459, 749, '<td valign="top">A good candid action shot, but the shot needs rotating so that the verticals of the fencing are fully upright, which would also make the slope seem steeper, adding to the action. The colours are quite muted, so the pink jacket really jumps out, drawing attention to the action, which is good :o)</td>', 'A good candid action shot, but the shot needs rotating so that the verticals of the fencing are fully upright, which would also make the slope seem steeper, adding to the action. The colours are quite muted, so the pink jacket really jumps out, drawing attention to the action, which is good :o)', '2002-12-11 12:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(170284, 9436, 772, '<td valign="top">very cute critter!  This is quite a nice catch... I think this shot *may* be even stronger if you cropped out just the squirrel and left the tree trunk out maybe?  Just a thought... great shot :) - setzler</td>', 'very cute critter!  This is quite a nice catch... I think this shot *may* be even stronger if you cropped out just the squirrel and left the tree trunk out maybe?  Just a thought... great shot :) - setzler', '2002-12-11 12:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(170285, 9369, 4055, '<td valign="top">Here´s a great job. Good colours, focus, lighting  and background. The border is a little thick for my taste. I had probably mad it dark gray and 4-5 pixels. But this is a matter of taste. Overall a nice photo that could be a nice poster. (7)<br/>Sorry I have to come in here again. I´m looking at it for the 10th time and now I have made up my mind. I have to change my score from (7) to (8). I really can´t say why it´s not higher - it has something to do with the cropping (framing). Sorry for not being able to be more precise. (final-8)</td>', 'Here´s a great job. Good colours, focus, lighting  and background. The border is a little thick for my taste. I had probably mad it dark gray and 4-5 pixels. But this is a matter of taste. Overall a nice photo that could be a nice poster. (7)Sorry I have to come in here again. I´m looking at it for the 10th time and now I have made up my mind. I have to change my score from (7) to (8). I really can´t say why it´s not higher - it has something to do with the cropping (framing). Sorry for not being able to be more precise. (final-8)', '2002-12-11 12:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(170288, 9586, 772, '<td valign="top">The shape here is quite interesting, but I''m not sure that I really like the lighting or the post processing or what may have been done to this photo... it looks a bit harsh... now that the size restrictions on this site have been practically removed, a tighter crop of your subject may work better?  not sure... keep up the good work :) - setzler</td>', 'The shape here is quite interesting, but I''m not sure that I really like the lighting or the post processing or what may have been done to this photo... it looks a bit harsh... now that the size restrictions on this site have been practically removed, a tighter crop of your subject may work better?  not sure... keep up the good work :) - setzler', '2002-12-11 12:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(170289, 9561, 772, '<td valign="top">This would make an interesting windows wallpaper screen :) - setzler</td>', 'This would make an interesting windows wallpaper screen :) - setzler', '2002-12-11 13:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
