(170299, 9503, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting black and white :)  The only thing I may have done differently here would have been to remove the white ''stick'' from the corner... i can''t really see how it adds to the image, and it did make me look to try to figure out what it was... just my thoughts :) - setzler</td>', 'interesting black and white :)  The only thing I may have done differently here would have been to remove the white ''stick'' from the corner... i can''t really see how it adds to the image, and it did make me look to try to figure out what it was... just my thoughts :) - setzler', '2002-12-11 13:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
