(170536, 9390, 4162, '<td valign="top">Its clever how you have created the effect here, you have balanced the composition well and the lighting is pretty even across the picture and the objects in the foreground.</td>', 'Its clever how you have created the effect here, you have balanced the composition well and the lighting is pretty even across the picture and the objects in the foreground.', '2002-12-11 20:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(170537, 9566, 51167, '<td valign="top">I love the look on her face.  The shot is a tad soft.</td>', 'I love the look on her face.  The shot is a tad soft.', '2002-12-11 20:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(170541, 9312, 51167, '<td valign="top">On the first run through of these shots I didn''t really realize that there was a mirror.  I like the shot, it is a little too yellow for me though.</td>', 'On the first run through of these shots I didn''t really realize that there was a mirror.  I like the shot, it is a little too yellow for me though.', '2002-12-11 20:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(170543, 9510, 1280, '<td valign="top">The focus here is fabulous...Marco''s skin tones are beautifully captured, and I like how the sun hits his hair.  Good job!</td>', 'The focus here is fabulous...Marco''s skin tones are beautifully captured, and I like how the sun hits his hair.  Good job!', '2002-12-11 20:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(170545, 9566, 4162, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture, wonderful expression and use of DOF, focus seems to be on the white shirt instead of her face though. Maybe the hands could have been cropped off and therefore getting of the ear behind! The lighting is a bit yellow, creating a bit of a colour cast on her hair.  Great candid!</td>', 'Excellent capture, wonderful expression and use of DOF, focus seems to be on the white shirt instead of her face though. Maybe the hands could have been cropped off and therefore getting of the ear behind! The lighting is a bit yellow, creating a bit of a colour cast on her hair.  Great candid!', '2002-12-11 20:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(170547, 9447, 51167, '<td valign="top">Good profile shot.  It seems to have a slight white tint to the shot.  I''m not sure if this was intentional, but it can be fixed with a little contrast and brightness levels.  Great composition.</td>', 'Good profile shot.  It seems to have a slight white tint to the shot.  I''m not sure if this was intentional, but it can be fixed with a little contrast and brightness levels.  Great composition.', '2002-12-11 20:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(170548, 9340, 1280, '<td valign="top">This is a freaky picture, but I like it. Tones are very good.  I wanna know what it is...lol</td>', 'This is a freaky picture, but I like it. Tones are very good.  I wanna know what it is...lol', '2002-12-11 20:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(170549, 9583, 51167, '<td valign="top">I love the colors in this.  It seems a bit soft on the base.</td>', 'I love the colors in this.  It seems a bit soft on the base.', '2002-12-11 20:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(170550, 9298, 554, '<td valign="top">I fail to see the point of the tower and platform in this picture.  To me, for them to be in the shot, the top of tower should be visable (or some interesting feature) as well as some sky (clouds)  on the left.  I do like the colors, however, the sun is slightly too bright.</td>', 'I fail to see the point of the tower and platform in this picture.  To me, for them to be in the shot, the top of tower should be visable (or some interesting feature) as well as some sky (clouds)  on the left.  I do like the colors, however, the sun is slightly too bright.', '2002-12-11 20:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(170551, 9583, 4162, '<td valign="top">Fantastic compostion, lighting and use of colour. Focus seems a bit soft though.</td>', 'Fantastic compostion, lighting and use of colour. Focus seems a bit soft though.', '2002-12-11 20:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(170553, 9449, 51167, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  I wish the sky was a little nicer to you.  Nice work.</td>', 'Great capture.  I wish the sky was a little nicer to you.  Nice work.', '2002-12-11 20:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
