(170560, 9378, 554, '<td valign="top">Please try and get these marbles to Mousie asap.  He is suffering from catastropic marble shortage.</td>', 'Please try and get these marbles to Mousie asap.  He is suffering from catastropic marble shortage.', '2002-12-11 20:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(170561, 9447, 4162, '<td valign="top">Great portrait. Eyes are drawn to the highlight on the end of the nose and also above the eyebrow, maybe indirect lighting or bounced would have got rid of this. Lovely picture.</td>', 'Great portrait. Eyes are drawn to the highlight on the end of the nose and also above the eyebrow, maybe indirect lighting or bounced would have got rid of this. Lovely picture.', '2002-12-11 20:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(170562, 9551, 51167, '<td valign="top">Nice angle and perfect title for this shot.  It doesn''t quite seem centered.</td>', 'Nice angle and perfect title for this shot.  It doesn''t quite seem centered.', '2002-12-11 20:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(170564, 9526, 51167, '<td valign="top">Nice title.  I like the color and texture in those boats. The background is interesting with the snow.</td>', 'Nice title.  I like the color and texture in those boats. The background is interesting with the snow.', '2002-12-11 20:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(170565, 9558, 51167, '<td valign="top">A green moon.  Looks a little fuzzy.  Nice work in changing this around.</td>', 'A green moon.  Looks a little fuzzy.  Nice work in changing this around.', '2002-12-11 20:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(170566, 9439, 4162, '<td valign="top">There is definitely something appealing about this.  Not sure what the brown bit of furniture is, kind of the has the feel of moving house, the last morning in a much loved house.....</td>', 'There is definitely something appealing about this.  Not sure what the brown bit of furniture is, kind of the has the feel of moving house, the last morning in a much loved house.....', '2002-12-11 20:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(170567, 9436, 1280, '<td valign="top">Cute little fatling!  Good color capture here.  Although the color is minimal, the pink of his nose and mouth are evident, as well as the golden browns of his ears and face. The tree being out of focus bothers me a bit.  I want to see the detail in the bark, but I understand how quickly you must have had to capture this moment.  <br/>His tail is quite interesting.  I''ve never seen one like it in all the many squirrels i''ve seen.  <br/>I love that I can see his feet and toes.  You really captured a lot of his detail.  Good job!</td>', 'Cute little fatling!  Good color capture here.  Although the color is minimal, the pink of his nose and mouth are evident, as well as the golden browns of his ears and face. The tree being out of focus bothers me a bit.  I want to see the detail in the bark, but I understand how quickly you must have had to capture this moment.  His tail is quite interesting.  I''ve never seen one like it in all the many squirrels i''ve seen.  I love that I can see his feet and toes.  You really captured a lot of his detail.  Good job!', '2002-12-11 20:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(170568, 9553, 4162, '<td valign="top">Very cute! Think a red kiss would have been better, more contrast, but green is unexpected.</td>', 'Very cute! Think a red kiss would have been better, more contrast, but green is unexpected.', '2002-12-11 20:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(170572, 9543, 4162, '<td valign="top">This is amazing!!!!!!! Its almost like a drawing, what an impact it has!!!! Light is a little bit harsh on the upper left curve, maybe if it were toned down a bit it would be a bit easier on the eye. However, I love this!</td>', 'This is amazing!!!!!!! Its almost like a drawing, what an impact it has!!!! Light is a little bit harsh on the upper left curve, maybe if it were toned down a bit it would be a bit easier on the eye. However, I love this!', '2002-12-11 21:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(170574, 9531, 1280, '<td valign="top">Wow!  This is excellent with dramatic colors and good focus. Nice combo of cool and warm.  Great graphical lines.  Lots of interest. Good work.</td>', 'Wow!  This is excellent with dramatic colors and good focus. Nice combo of cool and warm.  Great graphical lines.  Lots of interest. Good work.', '2002-12-11 21:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(170575, 9491, 554, '<td valign="top">You should be very proud of this one. I love it. Should be in top three if ppl don''t count off because it is a child photo. NICE Work</td>', 'You should be very proud of this one. I love it. Should be in top three if ppl don''t count off because it is a child photo. NICE Work', '2002-12-11 21:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(170577, 9497, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, but there isn''t enough detail in the eyes and feathers to make it an outstanding image of a finch. Colors are real good.  The bg works very well. If it was just a bit lighter more detail would be visible...I think.</td>', 'Nice composition, but there isn''t enough detail in the eyes and feathers to make it an outstanding image of a finch. Colors are real good.  The bg works very well. If it was just a bit lighter more detail would be visible...I think.', '2002-12-11 21:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(170578, 9583, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice, interesting abstract.  Coloring combines warm and cool tones creating a juxtaposition of sorts. The composition is excellent.  Good work!</td>', 'Nice, interesting abstract.  Coloring combines warm and cool tones creating a juxtaposition of sorts. The composition is excellent.  Good work!', '2002-12-11 21:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(170579, 9340, 554, '<td valign="top">Hey, Put That Back!!!!!!!!..............nice graphic</td>', 'Hey, Put That Back!!!!!!!!..............nice graphic', '2002-12-11 21:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(170591, 9465, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good study!  Nice tones and interesting lighting.</td>', 'Good study!  Nice tones and interesting lighting.', '2002-12-11 21:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(170593, 9506, 1280, '<td valign="top">It''s dark and I expect it won''t be wildly popular, but I like it as a very moody image.</td>', 'It''s dark and I expect it won''t be wildly popular, but I like it as a very moody image.', '2002-12-11 21:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(170595, 9452, 554, '<td valign="top">I am having trouble understanding the dof here.  Parts of the bottle look out of focus while things both in front of and behind look ok.  I like the arangement but would like it better without the reflection I think. The colors go well together.</td>', 'I am having trouble understanding the dof here.  Parts of the bottle look out of focus while things both in front of and behind look ok.  I like the arangement but would like it better without the reflection I think. The colors go well together.', '2002-12-11 21:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(170597, 9463, 1280, '<td valign="top">Generally I''d prefer more dof to include the other lemon.  The highlights on the front lemon are harsh making them blown out and the dark spots on the lemon aren''t appealing.  I do like the color saturation, and the water droplets on the surface of the plate. The composition is very nice too.</td>', 'Generally I''d prefer more dof to include the other lemon.  The highlights on the front lemon are harsh making them blown out and the dark spots on the lemon aren''t appealing.  I do like the color saturation, and the water droplets on the surface of the plate. The composition is very nice too.', '2002-12-11 21:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(170598, 9531, 554, '<td valign="top">The black matte frames this unusual photo well. By capturing the red and orange colors you have created a pleasing abstract.</td>', 'The black matte frames this unusual photo well. By capturing the red and orange colors you have created a pleasing abstract.', '2002-12-11 21:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(170609, 9578, 1280, '<td valign="top">I love it.  When I lived up north (for most of my life) I loved photographing ice-encased flora.  You did a good job of exposing to get detail, and none of it is blown out. The colors are superb, with only the reds evident,  in an otherwise nearly monotone  composition.<br/>Dof is very good, isolating the foreground subject from the bg.  The bg shows just enough detail to give a sense of environment. <br/>The only thing I''d like to see differently is to eliminate the twig on the left. Maybe...but maybe not.  ;-0</td>', 'I love it.  When I lived up north (for most of my life) I loved photographing ice-encased flora.  You did a good job of exposing to get detail, and none of it is blown out. The colors are superb, with only the reds evident,  in an otherwise nearly monotone  composition.Dof is very good, isolating the foreground subject from the bg.  The bg shows just enough detail to give a sense of environment. The only thing I''d like to see differently is to eliminate the twig on the left. Maybe...but maybe not.  ;-0', '2002-12-11 22:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(170611, 9551, 5495, '<td valign="top">Pretty dynamic shot. Nicely done.</td>', 'Pretty dynamic shot. Nicely done.', '2002-12-11 22:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(170612, 9383, 1280, '<td valign="top">Sometimes a shallow dof works well.  In this case I''d prefer to see more of the subject in focus. The bg is good here and provides good contrast, and the lighting and exposure are fine. More detail in focus would greatly add to the appeal of this image.</td>', 'Sometimes a shallow dof works well.  In this case I''d prefer to see more of the subject in focus. The bg is good here and provides good contrast, and the lighting and exposure are fine. More detail in focus would greatly add to the appeal of this image.', '2002-12-11 22:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(170614, 9551, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very interesting abstract. Composition is good, exposure is too. The blue sky adds just the right amount of color.</td>', 'Very interesting abstract. Composition is good, exposure is too. The blue sky adds just the right amount of color.', '2002-12-11 22:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(170616, 9345, 5495, '<td valign="top">Very nice  photo. Great texture and color. Out of focus foreground slightly distracting. Perhaps could have been remedied by using a smaller aperture or pulling back a bit and cropping.</td>', 'Very nice  photo. Great texture and color. Out of focus foreground slightly distracting. Perhaps could have been remedied by using a smaller aperture or pulling back a bit and cropping.', '2002-12-11 22:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(170617, 9491, 5495, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait. Nicely done.</td>', 'Beautiful portrait. Nicely done.', '2002-12-11 22:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(170620, 9310, 1280, '<td valign="top">This is cute.  The coloring, lighting and exposure are all good.  The playful expression of the child is priceless.  <br/>The composition is cropped a little too tight, and the bg is distracting.  Because of these two things it loses some points.  I realize you probably had to seize the moment, but that makes it more of a snapshot than a "study" as I see it.<br/>That late afternoon sun really casts wonderful color on the skin and hair.</td>', 'This is cute.  The coloring, lighting and exposure are all good.  The playful expression of the child is priceless.  The composition is cropped a little too tight, and the bg is distracting.  Because of these two things it loses some points.  I realize you probably had to seize the moment, but that makes it more of a snapshot than a "study" as I see it.That late afternoon sun really casts wonderful color on the skin and hair.', '2002-12-11 22:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(170653, 9482, 1280, '<td valign="top">Omigosh!, this is awesome!  The first thing to strike me, as you might expect, is the vibrancy of the colors. Upon closer study I am captivated by the circles suggesting movement and the drop.  Very, very nice work.  You should be proud of this and this may be the winner! 10</td>', 'Omigosh!, this is awesome!  The first thing to strike me, as you might expect, is the vibrancy of the colors. Upon closer study I am captivated by the circles suggesting movement and the drop.  Very, very nice work.  You should be proud of this and this may be the winner! 10', '2002-12-11 22:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(170684, 9519, 3280, '<td valign="top">Unique shot.  I like the composition and subject. I''m formerly from Pittsburgh so this all looks familiar. Good Job.  DPz</td>', 'Unique shot.  I like the composition and subject. I''m formerly from Pittsburgh so this all looks familiar. Good Job.  DPz', '2002-12-11 23:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(170688, 9378, 3280, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Very colorful. So can a picture be too well focused? The little hairs on the marbles prove to be distracting in the light. The last marble on the right might be better left out as well.  DPz</td>', 'Nice shot. Very colorful. So can a picture be too well focused? The little hairs on the marbles prove to be distracting in the light. The last marble on the right might be better left out as well.  DPz', '2002-12-11 23:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(170691, 9465, 3280, '<td valign="top">Has a kind of a "Blair Witch" feel. I like the shot and the title. Dpz</td>', 'Has a kind of a "Blair Witch" feel. I like the shot and the title. Dpz', '2002-12-11 23:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(170709, 9439, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this and how the shadows become the focus of the picture.  The warm colors also give it an ambient feel I think.  Overall, though, the picture seems a little flat to me, for some reason; I can''t really put my finger on it right now.  I will think about it though.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this and how the shadows become the focus of the picture.  The warm colors also give it an ambient feel I think.  Overall, though, the picture seems a little flat to me, for some reason; I can''t really put my finger on it right now.  I will think about it though.', '2002-12-12 00:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(170716, 9402, 2, '<td valign="top">Awesome photograph.  One of my favorites for the week.  10.</td>', 'Awesome photograph.  One of my favorites for the week.  10.', '2002-12-12 00:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(170743, 9543, 4628, '<td valign="top">The right side is a little too dark, and the top is a little too light... But all in all its a well-taken photo</td>', 'The right side is a little too dark, and the top is a little too light... But all in all its a well-taken photo', '2002-12-12 03:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(170756, 9510, 2279, '<td valign="top">Very sharp photo and great use of DOF.</td>', 'Very sharp photo and great use of DOF.', '2002-12-12 03:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(170757, 9583, 2279, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice abstract. The colors complement each other well. The only thing I dont like is the two yellow dots on the glass, just having blues and reds would have made it a little better.</td>', 'This is a really nice abstract. The colors complement each other well. The only thing I dont like is the two yellow dots on the glass, just having blues and reds would have made it a little better.', '2002-12-12 03:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(170759, 9345, 2279, '<td valign="top">This is a great still life shot. You can really see the textures of the chain.</td>', 'This is a great still life shot. You can really see the textures of the chain.', '2002-12-12 03:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(170761, 9521, 2279, '<td valign="top">This is a nice, candid im assuming, portrait. The wall art behind definately adds to the shot.</td>', 'This is a nice, candid im assuming, portrait. The wall art behind definately adds to the shot.', '2002-12-12 03:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(170762, 9566, 2279, '<td valign="top">Nice candid shot and I love the expression you caught. Nice timing. Maybe using a wider apeture would have blurred the background and made it a little less distracting. Overall a good shot.</td>', 'Nice candid shot and I love the expression you caught. Nice timing. Maybe using a wider apeture would have blurred the background and made it a little less distracting. Overall a good shot.', '2002-12-12 03:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(170764, 9450, 2279, '<td valign="top">The black border is a nice touch to this shot.</td>', 'The black border is a nice touch to this shot.', '2002-12-12 03:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(170766, 9402, 2279, '<td valign="top">I think a little less of a green tint and maybe a little more contrast would have made this a little more eye popping.</td>', 'I think a little less of a green tint and maybe a little more contrast would have made this a little more eye popping.', '2002-12-12 03:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(170768, 9582, 2279, '<td valign="top">Nice simple shot. I like these kind of shots. The only thing I dont like is where the branch touches the blub looks out of focus.</td>', 'Nice simple shot. I like these kind of shots. The only thing I dont like is where the branch touches the blub looks out of focus.', '2002-12-12 03:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(170770, 9485, 2279, '<td valign="top">Good choice of B&amp;W.  The man definately makes the shot.</td>', 'Good choice of B&W.  The man definately makes the shot.', '2002-12-12 04:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(170771, 9388, 2279, '<td valign="top">Nice macro shot. I like how my eyes wanna go everyway at once.</td>', 'Nice macro shot. I like how my eyes wanna go everyway at once.', '2002-12-12 04:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(170772, 9417, 2279, '<td valign="top">I wish my dog would sit still for a second. This shot is composed very well. I like the white background with the blue collar and border.</td>', 'I wish my dog would sit still for a second. This shot is composed very well. I like the white background with the blue collar and border.', '2002-12-12 04:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(170773, 9526, 2279, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors in this shot.</td>', 'I really like the colors in this shot.', '2002-12-12 04:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(170775, 9538, 2279, '<td valign="top">Great close up. Im really glad you went with B&amp;W for this shot.</td>', 'Great close up. Im really glad you went with B&W for this shot.', '2002-12-12 04:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(170776, 9433, 2279, '<td valign="top">I really like the color contrast of this shot. The black and blue and white go really well together but it looks to me like the tower is a little crooked.</td>', 'I really like the color contrast of this shot. The black and blue and white go really well together but it looks to me like the tower is a little crooked.', '2002-12-12 04:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(170777, 9578, 2279, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. Ive never seen anything like it before. Great DOF and the sharpness is great.</td>', 'I really like this shot. Ive never seen anything like it before. Great DOF and the sharpness is great.', '2002-12-12 04:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(170784, 9546, 2437, '<td valign="top">tone is perfect</td>', 'tone is perfect', '2002-12-12 05:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(170800, 9417, 133, '<td valign="top">This is a very well-done portrait of a beautiful dog.</td>', 'This is a very well-done portrait of a beautiful dog.', '2002-12-12 07:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(170801, 9582, 133, '<td valign="top">A very beautifully done and festive photograph.</td>', 'A very beautifully done and festive photograph.', '2002-12-12 07:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(170804, 9459, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is a very engaging photo. The way you used the diagonal element of the fence in the overall composition is very effective. It juxtaposes against the slanted angle of the motion-blurred snowflakes really well. It helps me to feel the pressure of the wind against the man and girl''s faces. By positioning them far to the left, it draws my eyes to those details, and increases the pressure I perceive from the wind. Very astute compositional decisions :).</td>', 'This is a very engaging photo. The way you used the diagonal element of the fence in the overall composition is very effective. It juxtaposes against the slanted angle of the motion-blurred snowflakes really well. It helps me to feel the pressure of the wind against the man and girl''s faces. By positioning them far to the left, it draws my eyes to those details, and increases the pressure I perceive from the wind. Very astute compositional decisions :).', '2002-12-12 08:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(170805, 9482, 1826, '<td valign="top">Love this- I''ll be anxious to read the details! 10</td>', 'Love this- I''ll be anxious to read the details! 10', '2002-12-12 08:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(170806, 9501, 1037, '<td valign="top">I really like the shallow depth of field here. It reduces the twigs to graceful lines in a pleasant, soft background and throws all the focus on the overlapping leaves. I like the way the light filters through the leaves, showing the vein structure. You show a great eye for detail. The photo really evokes the feeling of changing seasons, winter setting in, etc. (a very northern hemisphere thing that I feel a bit removed from, since it was around 38C here today!).</td>', 'I really like the shallow depth of field here. It reduces the twigs to graceful lines in a pleasant, soft background and throws all the focus on the overlapping leaves. I like the way the light filters through the leaves, showing the vein structure. You show a great eye for detail. The photo really evokes the feeling of changing seasons, winter setting in, etc. (a very northern hemisphere thing that I feel a bit removed from, since it was around 38C here today!).', '2002-12-12 08:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(170807, 9379, 1826, '<td valign="top">Very well composed.</td>', 'Very well composed.', '2002-12-12 08:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(170808, 9417, 1037, '<td valign="top">The lighting and focus on this photo are superb, I feel like I could count every hair, but I don''t get any idea at all of the personality of this dog! The portrait is very stiff and formal, and a bit undoglike really. Centering her head in a landscape photo adds to this feeling. I like centred compositions if the subject benefits from formality, symmetry, etc. but unless the dog has a reason to appear regal or heroic, it doesn''t quite work for me.</td>', 'The lighting and focus on this photo are superb, I feel like I could count every hair, but I don''t get any idea at all of the personality of this dog! The portrait is very stiff and formal, and a bit undoglike really. Centering her head in a landscape photo adds to this feeling. I like centred compositions if the subject benefits from formality, symmetry, etc. but unless the dog has a reason to appear regal or heroic, it doesn''t quite work for me.', '2002-12-12 08:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(170809, 9558, 1037, '<td valign="top">Wow, this really grabs me! The amount of empty space here puts me in a contemplative mood, and that shimmering green crescent pulls my attention in, creating a surreal feeling. The colour is vivid. The more I look at it, the more I can just pick out the rest of the moon in its shadow. Very nice work :).</td>', 'Wow, this really grabs me! The amount of empty space here puts me in a contemplative mood, and that shimmering green crescent pulls my attention in, creating a surreal feeling. The colour is vivid. The more I look at it, the more I can just pick out the rest of the moon in its shadow. Very nice work :).', '2002-12-12 08:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(170810, 9482, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very good work, technically. The colours below the surface were a great idea. I just feel a bit cold looking at this though, because I''ve seen so many water drop photos before. For what it is, it''s very good, and deserves a high rating, and originality isn''t everything, but it doesn''t grab me on an emotional level I''m afraid.</td>', 'Very good work, technically. The colours below the surface were a great idea. I just feel a bit cold looking at this though, because I''ve seen so many water drop photos before. For what it is, it''s very good, and deserves a high rating, and originality isn''t everything, but it doesn''t grab me on an emotional level I''m afraid.', '2002-12-12 08:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(170811, 9586, 1037, '<td valign="top">Hmm... you''re reaching for something interesting, but I feel as though the contrast here is too high, and the composition could do with some rethinking. Look at the negative space here... it isn''t really doing anything to support the shapes of the twig and the icicles. The colours in the ice/water could have been brought up a bit better with some more work.</td>', 'Hmm... you''re reaching for something interesting, but I feel as though the contrast here is too high, and the composition could do with some rethinking. Look at the negative space here... it isn''t really doing anything to support the shapes of the twig and the icicles. The colours in the ice/water could have been brought up a bit better with some more work.', '2002-12-12 08:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(170812, 9571, 1826, '<td valign="top">Wonderful texture and color.</td>', 'Wonderful texture and color.', '2002-12-12 08:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(170813, 9436, 1826, '<td valign="top">Great catch- love that pink nose!</td>', 'Great catch- love that pink nose!', '2002-12-12 08:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(170817, 9546, 772, '<td valign="top">very nice black and white :)  the sharp contrast here is excellent and you did a nice job of catching a good exposure in the sky to show the light/dark cloud detail... good work :) - setzler</td>', 'very nice black and white :)  the sharp contrast here is excellent and you did a nice job of catching a good exposure in the sky to show the light/dark cloud detail... good work :) - setzler', '2002-12-12 08:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(170830, 9459, 772, '<td valign="top">I like this quite a bit :)  The slight left tilt of the fence slats seems to increase the sense of steepness on this hill... good shot :) - setzler</td>', 'I like this quite a bit :)  The slight left tilt of the fence slats seems to increase the sense of steepness on this hill... good shot :) - setzler', '2002-12-12 08:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(170832, 9447, 1037, '<td valign="top">This seems washed out. It would benefit a lot from a little bit of levels adjustment in your post processing software. There is a bit of shine to the girls face, on her nose, chin and forehead. That could have been avoided with some powder over her foundation :).  Other than that... I think the framing makes the photo seem flat overall. It brings out her eyes, but it makes her face seem like it''s trapped in a tiny box. It cuts out part of her hairline and also the edge of her jaw. These are important boundaries to the face, without them we don''t read a face very well, and when ALL the appeal in this photo is supposed to come from her attractiveness, you''re cutting down a bit on that.<br/> <br/>It''s not a photo that really appeals to me thematically, so I''ve focussed on technical details. Overall, the photo doesn''t really work for me.</td>', 'This seems washed out. It would benefit a lot from a little bit of levels adjustment in your post processing software. There is a bit of shine to the girls face, on her nose, chin and forehead. That could have been avoided with some powder over her foundation :).  Other than that... I think the framing makes the photo seem flat overall. It brings out her eyes, but it makes her face seem like it''s trapped in a tiny box. It cuts out part of her hairline and also the edge of her jaw. These are important boundaries to the face, without them we don''t read a face very well, and when ALL the appeal in this photo is supposed to come from her attractiveness, you''re cutting down a bit on that. It''s not a photo that really appeals to me thematically, so I''ve focussed on technical details. Overall, the photo doesn''t really work for me.', '2002-12-12 08:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(170862, 9583, 772, '<td valign="top">very nice shot!  I love the blue and the abstract quality here... the red and blue create a very nice contrast.. good work :) - setzler</td>', 'very nice shot!  I love the blue and the abstract quality here... the red and blue create a very nice contrast.. good work :) - setzler', '2002-12-12 10:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(170863, 9510, 772, '<td valign="top">this is an excellent portrait... great composition as well... the shallow depth of field works VERY nicely in this image... good work! - setzler</td>', 'this is an excellent portrait... great composition as well... the shallow depth of field works VERY nicely in this image... good work! - setzler', '2002-12-12 10:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(170864, 9501, 772, '<td valign="top">I love the title on this shot :)  These leaves are hanging on for dear life :)  The composition and shallow depth of field work very well here for me... great shot :) - setzler</td>', 'I love the title on this shot :)  These leaves are hanging on for dear life :)  The composition and shallow depth of field work very well here for me... great shot :) - setzler', '2002-12-12 10:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(170867, 9494, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is a really interesting scene, but the contrast is a little low and white areas are overexposed. I like how you caught the guy mid-stride, and although the background is a bit busy, I think that works in an evocative way. Perhaps black and white wasn''t the best decision when there must be a lot of interesting colour in this scene.</td>', 'This is a really interesting scene, but the contrast is a little low and white areas are overexposed. I like how you caught the guy mid-stride, and although the background is a bit busy, I think that works in an evocative way. Perhaps black and white wasn''t the best decision when there must be a lot of interesting colour in this scene.', '2002-12-12 10:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(170869, 9496, 3112, '<td valign="top">Nifty idea.  The sign is unfortunately not well lit.  There are some video-type artifacts on the sign edges.</td>', 'Nifty idea.  The sign is unfortunately not well lit.  There are some video-type artifacts on the sign edges.', '2002-12-12 10:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(170871, 9506, 3112, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture.  The branches in the foreground distract a little.</td>', 'Excellent capture.  The branches in the foreground distract a little.', '2002-12-12 10:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(170873, 9550, 1037, '<td valign="top">Hmm.... this is a really interesting idea, but the framing doesn''t work for me. It kind of undoes the dynamism of the arrangement of seeds. I don''t really know what would work better though. A square crop? We can do that now :).<br/> <br/>I really like the colours and textures of the seeds, and the way they''re arranged.</td>', 'Hmm.... this is a really interesting idea, but the framing doesn''t work for me. It kind of undoes the dynamism of the arrangement of seeds. I don''t really know what would work better though. A square crop? We can do that now :). I really like the colours and textures of the seeds, and the way they''re arranged.', '2002-12-12 10:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(170874, 9561, 3112, '<td valign="top">Very nice macro.  Is this reduced to blue-channel, or did you find blue BB''s ?</td>', 'Very nice macro.  Is this reduced to blue-channel, or did you find blue BB''s ?', '2002-12-12 10:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(170875, 9433, 3112, '<td valign="top">Good composition, generally.  I like your POV-orientation, to make the patterns on the lighthouse symmetric.  Good work.  Only comment:  Should be off-center OR tilted, but not both.  Great contrast.</td>', 'Good composition, generally.  I like your POV-orientation, to make the patterns on the lighthouse symmetric.  Good work.  Only comment:  Should be off-center OR tilted, but not both.  Great contrast.', '2002-12-12 10:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(170876, 9379, 3112, '<td valign="top">Moving subject, but the compostion appears a little cluttered, and dows not draw the eye like I would prefer.</td>', 'Moving subject, but the compostion appears a little cluttered, and dows not draw the eye like I would prefer.', '2002-12-12 10:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(170877, 9312, 1037, '<td valign="top">Great idea! I love the warm yellow tones and the lighting here. The rack and the shadows of the coat hangers are great shapes. I feel like I''d prefer the image to be framed a little further to the right though, to cut out some of the door and include all of that last coat hanger. The way it''s cropped creates lines that lead my eyes out of the photo, I think.</td>', 'Great idea! I love the warm yellow tones and the lighting here. The rack and the shadows of the coat hangers are great shapes. I feel like I''d prefer the image to be framed a little further to the right though, to cut out some of the door and include all of that last coat hanger. The way it''s cropped creates lines that lead my eyes out of the photo, I think.', '2002-12-12 10:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(170878, 9345, 3112, '<td valign="top">Good subject.  Your lens appears to get a little soft at the corners.  Perhaps stopping down a bit would help sharpen them up.</td>', 'Good subject.  Your lens appears to get a little soft at the corners.  Perhaps stopping down a bit would help sharpen them up.', '2002-12-12 10:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(170879, 9386, 3112, '<td valign="top">Flame is hard to capture.  Congratulations. Unfortunately, the composition lacks impact.  If I can come up with what''s missing, I''ll recomment.</td>', 'Flame is hard to capture.  Congratulations. Unfortunately, the composition lacks impact.  If I can come up with what''s missing, I''ll recomment.', '2002-12-12 10:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(170880, 9485, 3112, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  Nice and contrasty.  Good theme.  Moving in many ways.  Even the blown-out window contributes. 9</td>', 'Excellent.  Nice and contrasty.  Good theme.  Moving in many ways.  Even the blown-out window contributes. 9', '2002-12-12 10:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(170881, 9485, 1037, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!! There isn''t a thing I don''t like about this photo. I absolutely love the intensity of the light coming through that window. The composition is stunning, the tones are deep and rich. A 10 from me!</td>', 'Beautiful!! There isn''t a thing I don''t like about this photo. I absolutely love the intensity of the light coming through that window. The composition is stunning, the tones are deep and rich. A 10 from me!', '2002-12-12 10:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(170882, 9575, 3112, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  Good artistically and technically (though the small format makes it hard to judge photographic quality to the fullest.)  I will say that I might have been tempted to boost color saturation and contrast.</td>', 'Interesting.  Good artistically and technically (though the small format makes it hard to judge photographic quality to the fullest.)  I will say that I might have been tempted to boost color saturation and contrast.', '2002-12-12 10:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(170883, 9340, 1037, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. I like the intense colours and those faint rings of light. I can see your reflection... I kind of like that :). But overall, the image falls a little bit flat. Maybe an off-centre composition with a longer shadow would have been more dynamic?</td>', 'Interesting idea. I like the intense colours and those faint rings of light. I can see your reflection... I kind of like that :). But overall, the image falls a little bit flat. Maybe an off-centre composition with a longer shadow would have been more dynamic?', '2002-12-12 10:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(170884, 9571, 1037, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! The colours and the patterning on the leaves are amazing! The light is soft enough to bring out every tiny detail. The leaves have a kind of spongy feel to them, very tactile. The way the composition centres around that green leaf works really well. I''m giving it 10.</td>', 'Beautiful! The colours and the patterning on the leaves are amazing! The light is soft enough to bring out every tiny detail. The leaves have a kind of spongy feel to them, very tactile. The way the composition centres around that green leaf works really well. I''m giving it 10.', '2002-12-12 10:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(170885, 9583, 1037, '<td valign="top">I love it! What can I say? The colours, shapes, lighting... it''s all stunning. 10!</td>', 'I love it! What can I say? The colours, shapes, lighting... it''s all stunning. 10!', '2002-12-12 10:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(170888, 9388, 1037, '<td valign="top">I like the patterns you created, but the colours aren''t very appealing to me, and the composition seems a bit flat. Technically very good, but not the kind of abstract that excites me.</td>', 'I like the patterns you created, but the colours aren''t very appealing to me, and the composition seems a bit flat. Technically very good, but not the kind of abstract that excites me.', '2002-12-12 10:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(170889, 9369, 714, '<td valign="top">I am guessing, but I think this took a lot of work. And you did a fine job.  Nice framing and very festive looking.</td>', 'I am guessing, but I think this took a lot of work. And you did a fine job.  Nice framing and very festive looking.', '2002-12-12 10:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(170890, 9567, 714, '<td valign="top">I love the softness, Very beautiful!</td>', 'I love the softness, Very beautiful!', '2002-12-12 10:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(170891, 9571, 3112, '<td valign="top">Good choice of colors.  Light source is a little sharp.  Did you mean to have the DOF not encompass the most forward leaves?</td>', 'Good choice of colors.  Light source is a little sharp.  Did you mean to have the DOF not encompass the most forward leaves?', '2002-12-12 10:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(170893, 9459, 714, '<td valign="top">What a fun time.  The subjects are in the right spot.  the lighting is good. I love the way you captured the snow falling.   The people seem to bit out of focus.</td>', 'What a fun time.  The subjects are in the right spot.  the lighting is good. I love the way you captured the snow falling.   The people seem to bit out of focus.', '2002-12-12 10:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(170894, 9501, 714, '<td valign="top">Nice focus and framing.  It is a little to bright for my taste. Nice subject.</td>', 'Nice focus and framing.  It is a little to bright for my taste. Nice subject.', '2002-12-12 10:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(170897, 9390, 4493, '<td valign="top">Although this is technically a nice picture, the amount of activity going on in it is a bit distracting. The layout of the knives is good, but your highlights on them are a bit blown out. I was going to ask why you have both on there, and then I realized these are the swords the characters in the print are using.</td>', 'Although this is technically a nice picture, the amount of activity going on in it is a bit distracting. The layout of the knives is good, but your highlights on them are a bit blown out. I was going to ask why you have both on there, and then I realized these are the swords the characters in the print are using.', '2002-12-12 10:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(170899, 9495, 3112, '<td valign="top">Ho, ho , ho!</td>', 'Ho, ho , ho!', '2002-12-12 10:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(170902, 9336, 4493, '<td valign="top">Hmmm<br/> <br/>As I step back, I can see that by your use of this crop with the changing of the hues, you are taking a common subject  matter and giving it an artistic flair. It''s an interesting shot that I could see being hung in a loft overlooking Cental Park in NYC.<br/> <br/>You just got a score bump...</td>', 'Hmmm As I step back, I can see that by your use of this crop with the changing of the hues, you are taking a common subject  matter and giving it an artistic flair. It''s an interesting shot that I could see being hung in a loft overlooking Cental Park in NYC. You just got a score bump...', '2002-12-12 10:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(170903, 9567, 4493, '<td valign="top">Nice orange tones in the sky. Sharpness of the tree is a little soft as well as some minor noise in the sky. Composition is good, the sun is, pardon the pun, a little hot.</td>', 'Nice orange tones in the sky. Sharpness of the tree is a little soft as well as some minor noise in the sky. Composition is good, the sun is, pardon the pun, a little hot.', '2002-12-12 10:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(170904, 9559, 4493, '<td valign="top">Good zoom. The sky seems oversaturated. Composition is good.</td>', 'Good zoom. The sky seems oversaturated. Composition is good.', '2002-12-12 11:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(170905, 9586, 4493, '<td valign="top">This composition and lighting is a good concept. Unfortunately, I feel that the photo suffers from over post processing.</td>', 'This composition and lighting is a good concept. Unfortunately, I feel that the photo suffers from over post processing.', '2002-12-12 11:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(170907, 9497, 4493, '<td valign="top">Good closeup. There appears to be some over sharpening around the bird as well as noise in the background. The composition is good, I''d like to see the red enhanced a little more so the bird''s chest and head really jump off the screen.</td>', 'Good closeup. There appears to be some over sharpening around the bird as well as noise in the background. The composition is good, I''d like to see the red enhanced a little more so the bird''s chest and head really jump off the screen.', '2002-12-12 11:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(170910, 9558, 4493, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but this photo doesn''t envoke any emotion from me. All I see as a fuzzy crecent on a black background. I have sat here looking at it from an artistic eye, and although I can grasp the concept in relation to the title, I think a full green moon would have made a stronger impact. Unfortunately, we didn''t have a full moon last week.</td>', 'I''m sorry, but this photo doesn''t envoke any emotion from me. All I see as a fuzzy crecent on a black background. I have sat here looking at it from an artistic eye, and although I can grasp the concept in relation to the title, I think a full green moon would have made a stronger impact. Unfortunately, we didn''t have a full moon last week.', '2002-12-12 11:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(170912, 9501, 3112, '<td valign="top">Now THAT''S what I call shallow depth-of-field. Very nice.</td>', 'Now THAT''S what I call shallow depth-of-field. Very nice.', '2002-12-12 11:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(170913, 9567, 3112, '<td valign="top">wonderful sunrise.  I love how the tree LOOKS soft, but is, in reality, very sharp.</td>', 'wonderful sunrise.  I love how the tree LOOKS soft, but is, in reality, very sharp.', '2002-12-12 11:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(170914, 9538, 3112, '<td valign="top">Very clean photo.  Extremely sharp and contrasty.  I like it a lot.  Good choice of B/W, incidentally. 9</td>', 'Very clean photo.  Extremely sharp and contrasty.  I like it a lot.  Good choice of B/W, incidentally. 9', '2002-12-12 11:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(170916, 9473, 3112, '<td valign="top">Interesting color mix.  Softish looking.  very pleasing.</td>', 'Interesting color mix.  Softish looking.  very pleasing.', '2002-12-12 11:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(170918, 9552, 772, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo :)  I love the way the light is highlighted along the edge of the water on this leaf... great shot :) - setzler</td>', 'Excellent photo :)  I love the way the light is highlighted along the edge of the water on this leaf... great shot :) - setzler', '2002-12-12 11:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(170919, 9550, 772, '<td valign="top">very interesting shot :)  the textures here are quite nice... note: with the new rules on cropping and image size, this shot could have possibly been nice in a square frame... good shot :) - setzler</td>', 'very interesting shot :)  the textures here are quite nice... note: with the new rules on cropping and image size, this shot could have possibly been nice in a square frame... good shot :) - setzler', '2002-12-12 11:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(170921, 9568, 3112, '<td valign="top">I am wondering what prevented you from cropping to just the left side...  Otherwise, a wonderful capture.</td>', 'I am wondering what prevented you from cropping to just the left side...  Otherwise, a wonderful capture.', '2002-12-12 11:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(170922, 9491, 3112, '<td valign="top">Excellent example of portraiture.  7</td>', 'Excellent example of portraiture.  7', '2002-12-12 11:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(170924, 9558, 3112, '<td valign="top">This is a great example of using the limits of your camera to artistic advantage.</td>', 'This is a great example of using the limits of your camera to artistic advantage.', '2002-12-12 11:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(170925, 9459, 3112, '<td valign="top">Wonderful scene.  Could have been snapped at a higher shutter, though.  Freezing snow in midair could do a lot for this one.  Good luck!</td>', 'Wonderful scene.  Could have been snapped at a higher shutter, though.  Freezing snow in midair could do a lot for this one.  Good luck!', '2002-12-12 11:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(170928, 9494, 3112, '<td valign="top">Good subject.  I think the man walking through/away from the market detracts a bit, though.  Would have been helpful to see him doing market-things.  But, this is the risk we take in photographing life-as-is. 5</td>', 'Good subject.  I think the man walking through/away from the market detracts a bit, though.  Would have been helpful to see him doing market-things.  But, this is the risk we take in photographing life-as-is. 5', '2002-12-12 11:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(170935, 9396, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent black and white study... I love the patterns, shapes, and contrast in this image... nice shot :) - setzler</td>', 'This is an excellent black and white study... I love the patterns, shapes, and contrast in this image... nice shot :) - setzler', '2002-12-12 12:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(170939, 9491, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful portrait... I love the soft colors here and the look on her face... nice job with the catch lighting in her eyes as well :)  Something looks a bit odd here and i can''t really put my finger on it... her head looks to be slightly out of perspective... too large for the rest of her body maybe?  None-the-less, a great shot :) - setzler</td>', 'This is a beautiful portrait... I love the soft colors here and the look on her face... nice job with the catch lighting in her eyes as well :)  Something looks a bit odd here and i can''t really put my finger on it... her head looks to be slightly out of perspective... too large for the rest of her body maybe?  None-the-less, a great shot :) - setzler', '2002-12-12 12:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(170941, 9473, 4493, '<td valign="top">Good concept. The reflected light in the back and the curtain not being all the way across the back, breaks the continuity of the shot. I think the DOF is appropriate for this photo, but I feel some post processing sharpening could have brought out the texture in the stockings better.</td>', 'Good concept. The reflected light in the back and the curtain not being all the way across the back, breaks the continuity of the shot. I think the DOF is appropriate for this photo, but I feel some post processing sharpening could have brought out the texture in the stockings better.', '2002-12-12 12:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(170943, 9465, 4493, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. Colors and saturation are good.</td>', 'Interesting shot. Colors and saturation are good.', '2002-12-12 12:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(170945, 9298, 4493, '<td valign="top">I''m wondering if this shot would have been stronger without the tower. It also appears that you shot this through a window. That being the case, it threw a reflection at the top center of the picture. Adjustments to the contrast  might have made the foreground clouds pop of the page and give a nice contrast to the brightness of the sun.</td>', 'I''m wondering if this shot would have been stronger without the tower. It also appears that you shot this through a window. That being the case, it threw a reflection at the top center of the picture. Adjustments to the contrast  might have made the foreground clouds pop of the page and give a nice contrast to the brightness of the sun.', '2002-12-12 12:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(170948, 9531, 1037, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this, and the colours. It''s a really fetching abstract photo. The slight graininess is kind of nice, in my opinion. Photos that are very sharp sometimes seem harsh to me. However, I think the border is a bit too wide and dominates the photo rather than complimenting it.</td>', 'I like the composition of this, and the colours. It''s a really fetching abstract photo. The slight graininess is kind of nice, in my opinion. Photos that are very sharp sometimes seem harsh to me. However, I think the border is a bit too wide and dominates the photo rather than complimenting it.', '2002-12-12 12:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(170949, 9450, 772, '<td valign="top">great perspective and depth of field on this guitar... The only think I may have done differently here would have been to completely was out the background that is visible in the upper left corner... great shot :) - setzler</td>', 'great perspective and depth of field on this guitar... The only think I may have done differently here would have been to completely was out the background that is visible in the upper left corner... great shot :) - setzler', '2002-12-12 12:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(170956, 9496, 1037, '<td valign="top">Hmmm.... this seems flat and static. I''m trying to work out why.... the backlighting on the sign doesn''t help, making it dim in relation to the background. The leaves are lit too harshly, and seem washed out and unappealing. The composition doesn''t hit any of the right elements... it uses the rule of thirds but that isn''t always enough :). The post seems to drag my eyes out of the photo. I just don''t respond well to this image.</td>', 'Hmmm.... this seems flat and static. I''m trying to work out why.... the backlighting on the sign doesn''t help, making it dim in relation to the background. The leaves are lit too harshly, and seem washed out and unappealing. The composition doesn''t hit any of the right elements... it uses the rule of thirds but that isn''t always enough :). The post seems to drag my eyes out of the photo. I just don''t respond well to this image.', '2002-12-12 12:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(170958, 9543, 1037, '<td valign="top">Wiow! Beautiful! The high contrast black and white brings out all the detail in the wood, giving it a real sense of age and wear. The composition is very strong... it takes my eyes around the wood and then off towards the horizon, making me wonder what is out there in the distance. I love it! 10.</td>', 'Wiow! Beautiful! The high contrast black and white brings out all the detail in the wood, giving it a real sense of age and wear. The composition is very strong... it takes my eyes around the wood and then off towards the horizon, making me wonder what is out there in the distance. I love it! 10.', '2002-12-12 12:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(170959, 9585, 4055, '<td valign="top">The composition is just great. Coours and focus too. But I think the contrast is too hard. The hair and nose have become burnt out. Overall a nice work.</td>', 'The composition is just great. Coours and focus too. But I think the contrast is too hard. The hair and nose have become burnt out. Overall a nice work.', '2002-12-12 12:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(170961, 9386, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting, atmospheric image, but it really seems to need some levels adjustment. The dark areas are a little lighter than they could be, reducing the impact of the flame.</td>', 'This is an interesting, atmospheric image, but it really seems to need some levels adjustment. The dark areas are a little lighter than they could be, reducing the impact of the flame.', '2002-12-12 12:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(170963, 9433, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting light house, and a nice sky, but I think there are more interesting things you could do than just place it on a third. A steeper angle (ie. taken closer to the base of the light house and looking up) would be more dynamic. Otherwise, it is techinically very good. It just lacks a bit of interest.</td>', 'This is an interesting light house, and a nice sky, but I think there are more interesting things you could do than just place it on a third. A steeper angle (ie. taken closer to the base of the light house and looking up) would be more dynamic. Otherwise, it is techinically very good. It just lacks a bit of interest.', '2002-12-12 12:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(170964, 9447, 4055, '<td valign="top">The composition is really good. But the lighting is a little flat. But I think this in b&amp;w had got highest score from me. Rather high score anyway.</td>', 'The composition is really good. But the lighting is a little flat. But I think this in b&w had got highest score from me. Rather high score anyway.', '2002-12-12 12:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(170966, 9310, 1037, '<td valign="top">Cute portrait, well lit, well exposed, well focussed, well framed. It''s technically very good, and you deserve to be proud. It lacks a bit of interest for me personally, but still worth an objective 9 just for being so good!</td>', 'Cute portrait, well lit, well exposed, well focussed, well framed. It''s technically very good, and you deserve to be proud. It lacks a bit of interest for me personally, but still worth an objective 9 just for being so good!', '2002-12-12 12:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(170967, 9575, 4055, '<td valign="top">A good composition. But I´m not so sure about the dark background. Perhaps some light from the left had made this a really great shot. Now it´s just great. Rather high score anyhow.</td>', 'A good composition. But I´m not so sure about the dark background. Perhaps some light from the left had made this a really great shot. Now it´s just great. Rather high score anyhow.', '2002-12-12 12:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(170968, 9521, 1037, '<td valign="top">It''s amazing the way you caught the parallel between the guy''s profile and whatever is in the background! Beautiful, rich tones, and great diffuse lighting on the guy''s face. The framing/composition is tight. I like it a lot! 10.</td>', 'It''s amazing the way you caught the parallel between the guy''s profile and whatever is in the background! Beautiful, rich tones, and great diffuse lighting on the guy''s face. The framing/composition is tight. I like it a lot! 10.', '2002-12-12 12:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(170969, 9558, 811, '<td valign="top">the negative space works well here as it does focus the eyes on the subject.  However, I think if the green slice were in the lower right it would feel more balanced.  Being in the center like that makes it feel static to me.</td>', 'the negative space works well here as it does focus the eyes on the subject.  However, I think if the green slice were in the lower right it would feel more balanced.  Being in the center like that makes it feel static to me.', '2002-12-12 12:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(170970, 9450, 4055, '<td valign="top">A good photo. I think it had been better if the background (up left an center) had been darker. Good focus and composition.</td>', 'A good photo. I think it had been better if the background (up left an center) had been darker. Good focus and composition.', '2002-12-12 12:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(170971, 9383, 1037, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colours and lighting. I like your shallow depth of field, it really lifts this photo. The subject doesn''t inspire me greatly, but your treatment of it is masterful.</td>', 'Gorgeous colours and lighting. I like your shallow depth of field, it really lifts this photo. The subject doesn''t inspire me greatly, but your treatment of it is masterful.', '2002-12-12 12:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(170972, 9522, 1037, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous textures. The light is a little harsh. Being Australian, I don''t have any experience at all of photographing in the snow, but I think a polariser would help? The framing is very nice. The scene overall is very pleasant and serene.</td>', 'Gorgeous textures. The light is a little harsh. Being Australian, I don''t have any experience at all of photographing in the snow, but I think a polariser would help? The framing is very nice. The scene overall is very pleasant and serene.', '2002-12-12 12:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(170974, 9336, 1037, '<td valign="top">My goodness! What an explosion of colour!! I love it, and I want to know how you did it :). 10 from me!</td>', 'My goodness! What an explosion of colour!! I love it, and I want to know how you did it :). 10 from me!', '2002-12-12 12:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(170975, 9494, 3540, '<td valign="top">I''m curious to know why this was done in B&amp;W.  Looks like there are some good colorful items here.  It doesn''t look retro or dreary where B&amp;W would fit.  - Inspzil</td>', 'I''m curious to know why this was done in B&W.  Looks like there are some good colorful items here.  It doesn''t look retro or dreary where B&W would fit.  - Inspzil', '2002-12-12 12:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(170976, 9390, 1037, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... nice lighting, and interesting composition. Fantasy genre stuff isn''t my thing, but I appreciate that you have achieved something interesting here.</td>', 'Hmmm... nice lighting, and interesting composition. Fantasy genre stuff isn''t my thing, but I appreciate that you have achieved something interesting here.', '2002-12-12 12:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(170977, 9449, 811, '<td valign="top">Ah, nothing like a little roadside maintenance on a ride!  The composition in this, and the strong leading diagonals work really well to take the eyes from the bottom of the picture to the top.  Did you try it in black and white?  Since the red bike is the only real color, I was wondering if it might have a little more interest that way.</td>', 'Ah, nothing like a little roadside maintenance on a ride!  The composition in this, and the strong leading diagonals work really well to take the eyes from the bottom of the picture to the top.  Did you try it in black and white?  Since the red bike is the only real color, I was wondering if it might have a little more interest that way.', '2002-12-12 12:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(170978, 9578, 1005, '<td valign="top">While there were several this week I really like, this is my favorite!  I just love the cracked ice on the branches.  The drip off the leaf is great too.  Great color!!!!  An easy 10 in my book!  Swash</td>', 'While there were several this week I really like, this is my favorite!  I just love the cracked ice on the branches.  The drip off the leaf is great too.  Great color!!!!  An easy 10 in my book!  Swash', '2002-12-12 12:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(170979, 9578, 4055, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot. Good lighting and focus. VERY nice colours. I had probably framed it a little harder to leave the left twig out. (Well, not SO sure). Anyhow a nice photo to look at.</td>', 'Lovely shot. Good lighting and focus. VERY nice colours. I had probably framed it a little harder to leave the left twig out. (Well, not SO sure). Anyhow a nice photo to look at.', '2002-12-12 12:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(170980, 9298, 811, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and texture of the sky and cloud.  My only comment is regarding the structure on the left.  In my opinion, you need more of it, or it needs to be eliminated all together.  Right now, it seems to me that being in the frame was an accident!  Also, if it is going to be included, maybe have it in a little sharper focus so that it really stands out.</td>', 'I love the colors and texture of the sky and cloud.  My only comment is regarding the structure on the left.  In my opinion, you need more of it, or it needs to be eliminated all together.  Right now, it seems to me that being in the frame was an accident!  Also, if it is going to be included, maybe have it in a little sharper focus so that it really stands out.', '2002-12-12 12:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(170981, 9495, 1037, '<td valign="top">Wow, tacky! It''s a good photo, even if those decorations are way over the top :). The composition could be a bit tighter.</td>', 'Wow, tacky! It''s a good photo, even if those decorations are way over the top :). The composition could be a bit tighter.', '2002-12-12 12:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(170983, 9449, 1037, '<td valign="top">The light in this photo is nice and soft, and it''s well framed, exposed, etc. It just doesn''t grab me thematically.</td>', 'The light in this photo is nice and soft, and it''s well framed, exposed, etc. It just doesn''t grab me thematically.', '2002-12-12 12:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(170984, 9495, 1005, '<td valign="top">Great color and a very steady hand!  Feels alot like christmas.  There''s something about the setup/framing that I just can''t put my finger on, but it''s not enough to really kill your score (esp. since I can''t figure out what it is!)  9 Swash</td>', 'Great color and a very steady hand!  Feels alot like christmas.  There''s something about the setup/framing that I just can''t put my finger on, but it''s not enough to really kill your score (esp. since I can''t figure out what it is!)  9 Swash', '2002-12-12 12:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(170986, 9583, 1005, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Great color, very nice set up.  Really minor things in the glass/water that seem somehow out of place, but still it''s not enough to harm a really cool view.  How about a 9?  Swash</td>', 'Wow!  Great color, very nice set up.  Really minor things in the glass/water that seem somehow out of place, but still it''s not enough to harm a really cool view.  How about a 9?  Swash', '2002-12-12 12:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(170987, 9506, 811, '<td valign="top">I think the curves in this picture do well to give movement to the picture.  Also, the dead tree adds some interest as well.  I am gathering from the title that this is a picture that is supposed to be dark, but on my monitor, it is a touch too much so. I think a touch more exposure, or a bit of adjusting of the lightness and contrast might make the interesting details more obvious.</td>', 'I think the curves in this picture do well to give movement to the picture.  Also, the dead tree adds some interest as well.  I am gathering from the title that this is a picture that is supposed to be dark, but on my monitor, it is a touch too much so. I think a touch more exposure, or a bit of adjusting of the lightness and contrast might make the interesting details more obvious.', '2002-12-12 12:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(170988, 9482, 1005, '<td valign="top">Gosh, this is soooo colorful!  Very nicely stopped action.  The colorful background both confuses and adds interest to this (usually great, but cliche) shot.  I really like this and your addition really makes this photo much more unique and very, very striking!  9  Swash</td>', 'Gosh, this is soooo colorful!  Very nicely stopped action.  The colorful background both confuses and adds interest to this (usually great, but cliche) shot.  I really like this and your addition really makes this photo much more unique and very, very striking!  9  Swash', '2002-12-12 12:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(170989, 9550, 4055, '<td valign="top">I don´t know what this is (kind of food-ball for birds?) but I like it anyway. Good lighting and focus. The composition is a little too centered for my taste. I had probably placed the "ball" a little right. Well done.</td>', 'I don´t know what this is (kind of food-ball for birds?) but I like it anyway. Good lighting and focus. The composition is a little too centered for my taste. I had probably placed the "ball" a little right. Well done.', '2002-12-12 12:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(170990, 9531, 811, '<td valign="top">The abstract part of this is awesome.   I like the different "layers," for lack of a better word, of each of the sections.  And the orange/red gives the appearance of fire.  It is just real grainy to me, and I think a crisper picture would have been more effective.<br/>Also, and this is just my opinion, the black in the border works well, but I think a wee bit more narrow would be better.</td>', 'The abstract part of this is awesome.   I like the different "layers," for lack of a better word, of each of the sections.  And the orange/red gives the appearance of fire.  It is just real grainy to me, and I think a crisper picture would have been more effective.Also, and this is just my opinion, the black in the border works well, but I think a wee bit more narrow would be better.', '2002-12-12 12:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(170992, 9585, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this picture in that by eliminating much of her head, the viewer is forced to focus on her face.  Also the background color sets up a nice contrast.  To me, there is a bit too much light on the face, especially the right side.  If it is sunlight, maybe a thin or sheer material over the window would help diffuse it.  If it is artificial, bouncing it off of a reflector (or wall or ceiling) might be nice.  This is also an example I think would work well with a soft focus or gaussian blur, BUT I can understand why someone would do that because they don''t traditionally score well on dpc.</td>', 'I like the composition of this picture in that by eliminating much of her head, the viewer is forced to focus on her face.  Also the background color sets up a nice contrast.  To me, there is a bit too much light on the face, especially the right side.  If it is sunlight, maybe a thin or sheer material over the window would help diffuse it.  If it is artificial, bouncing it off of a reflector (or wall or ceiling) might be nice.  This is also an example I think would work well with a soft focus or gaussian blur, BUT I can understand why someone would do that because they don''t traditionally score well on dpc.', '2002-12-12 13:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(170993, 9298, 1005, '<td valign="top">The distraction on the left really turns me off this pic.  IMO, it needed to be either more fully in the shot, or better yet, fully out of it.  The clouds and distorted sun are fairly nice, but not very striking.  There''s an odd greenish cast in the upper middle/right that doesn''t look right/good, too.  Sorry, 5 Swash</td>', 'The distraction on the left really turns me off this pic.  IMO, it needed to be either more fully in the shot, or better yet, fully out of it.  The clouds and distorted sun are fairly nice, but not very striking.  There''s an odd greenish cast in the upper middle/right that doesn''t look right/good, too.  Sorry, 5 Swash', '2002-12-12 13:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(170994, 9552, 4055, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and good composition. A little disturbing light at top center. Overall a nice photo.</td>', 'Nice colours and good composition. A little disturbing light at top center. Overall a nice photo.', '2002-12-12 13:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(170995, 9559, 1005, '<td valign="top">Kinda grainy, possibly you might want to consider turning off your digital zoom, too (I need to as well!)  Sharpness is pretty good, esp. considering the grain, so you have a steady hand.  Interest, for me is on the lower side.  Sorry,  5 Swash</td>', 'Kinda grainy, possibly you might want to consider turning off your digital zoom, too (I need to as well!)  Sharpness is pretty good, esp. considering the grain, so you have a steady hand.  Interest, for me is on the lower side.  Sorry,  5 Swash', '2002-12-12 13:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(170996, 9559, 811, '<td valign="top">Ooops, I completely missed the bird the first time around!  &lt;hits forehead&gt;  The structure itself is interesting I think, but it is really grainy to me.  Did you use digital zoom or crop it from a larger pic?  Or did you intend it to be that way?  I''m not sure, but converting it to black and white might help some since the sky is so white and the colors are almost monotone anyway.</td>', 'Ooops, I completely missed the bird the first time around!  <hits forehead>  The structure itself is interesting I think, but it is really grainy to me.  Did you use digital zoom or crop it from a larger pic?  Or did you intend it to be that way?  I''m not sure, but converting it to black and white might help some since the sky is so white and the colors are almost monotone anyway.', '2002-12-12 13:05:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(170998, 9558, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cool idea, but extremely grainy.  Sorry, but I just can''t think of anything else to add.  5 Swash</td>', 'Cool idea, but extremely grainy.  Sorry, but I just can''t think of anything else to add.  5 Swash', '2002-12-12 13:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(170999, 9578, 4628, '<td valign="top">This photo just has an awesome effect. The focus clarity and exposure are good, the overall impact is great. Well done</td>', 'This photo just has an awesome effect. The focus clarity and exposure are good, the overall impact is great. Well done', '2002-12-12 13:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(171000, 9551, 4055, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Good composition. I had probably cropped it a little at left to make the blue corner up left disappear. And make the lower left corner look like the lower right corner. Just a thought. Overall a nice photo.</td>', 'Interesting. Good composition. I had probably cropped it a little at left to make the blue corner up left disappear. And make the lower left corner look like the lower right corner. Just a thought. Overall a nice photo.', '2002-12-12 13:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(171001, 9402, 4628, '<td valign="top">Well taken, but it just doesn''t do much for me. Perhaps if the background in the top left had been black i would like it better.</td>', 'Well taken, but it just doesn''t do much for me. Perhaps if the background in the top left had been black i would like it better.', '2002-12-12 13:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(171002, 9473, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, but where is your focal point?  This might have worked better with more distance and a little zoom (distance increases your focal depth, too)  A less obtuse angle might have helped this, too.  (Straight on might be boring, but it will be fully in focus)  5 Swash</td>', 'Nice colors, but where is your focal point?  This might have worked better with more distance and a little zoom (distance increases your focal depth, too)  A less obtuse angle might have helped this, too.  (Straight on might be boring, but it will be fully in focus)  5 Swash', '2002-12-12 13:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(171003, 9452, 4628, '<td valign="top">I love the reflections and the backdrop. A tighter crop on the top might have been nice though.</td>', 'I love the reflections and the backdrop. A tighter crop on the top might have been nice though.', '2002-12-12 13:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(171004, 9566, 4628, '<td valign="top">The focal point seems to be more on the shirt than the head area. The hair looks a little fuzzy. Not bad, though</td>', 'The focal point seems to be more on the shirt than the head area. The hair looks a little fuzzy. Not bad, though', '2002-12-12 13:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(171005, 9494, 4628, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice shot, but I think it might have been nicer with more contrast. My eyes kind of get lost in a see of gray, not enough black and white in the mid section of the photo</td>', 'It''s a nice shot, but I think it might have been nicer with more contrast. My eyes kind of get lost in a see of gray, not enough black and white in the mid section of the photo', '2002-12-12 13:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(171006, 9313, 3540, '<td valign="top">This would be a great shot for an advertisement.  Nice macro and great choice of backgrounds</td>', 'This would be a great shot for an advertisement.  Nice macro and great choice of backgrounds', '2002-12-12 13:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(171007, 9551, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like the symmetry of this and how it "pulls" you to the top of the  frame.  Something is lacking, though, but for the life of me, I can not figure out what it is.  I will think on it!</td>', 'I really like the symmetry of this and how it "pulls" you to the top of the  frame.  Something is lacking, though, but for the life of me, I can not figure out what it is.  I will think on it!', '2002-12-12 13:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(171009, 9388, 4055, '<td valign="top">I did this a couple of weeks ago with pens but it was a disaster. But yours is better - far better. Simple and interesting. Focus and light OK. My shot ended at 4.476 and I hope you are doing better.</td>', 'I did this a couple of weeks ago with pens but it was a disaster. But yours is better - far better. Simple and interesting. Focus and light OK. My shot ended at 4.476 and I hope you are doing better.', '2002-12-12 13:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(171010, 9506, 1005, '<td valign="top">I like the dead tree and would have liked to see more of it.  I feel conflicted between saying it''s too dark and being just right.  Were you attempting to "set a mood"?  Maybe a dramatic view of the tree would help.  6 Swash</td>', 'I like the dead tree and would have liked to see more of it.  I feel conflicted between saying it''s too dark and being just right.  Were you attempting to "set a mood"?  Maybe a dramatic view of the tree would help.  6 Swash', '2002-12-12 13:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(171011, 9378, 4493, '<td valign="top">Composition is OK. The lighting is a bit harsh. The dust on the marbles is distracting. Your macro is nice and the sharpening and colors are true. I just would like to see a little more interesting of a composition.<br/></td>', 'Composition is OK. The lighting is a bit harsh. The dust on the marbles is distracting. Your macro is nice and the sharpening and colors are true. I just would like to see a little more interesting of a composition.', '2002-12-12 13:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(171013, 9538, 3102, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done!  I like the use of B&amp;W here, and the composition is great.</td>', 'Beautifully done!  I like the use of B&W here, and the composition is great.', '2002-12-12 13:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(171014, 9452, 3540, '<td valign="top">Honestly I don''t like the mirror under it.  Still a fine image though - Inspzil</td>', 'Honestly I don''t like the mirror under it.  Still a fine image though - Inspzil', '2002-12-12 13:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(171015, 9482, 3102, '<td valign="top">This is, of course, something we''ve seen before, but this is a very well done attempt!  Great colors!</td>', 'This is, of course, something we''ve seen before, but this is a very well done attempt!  Great colors!', '2002-12-12 13:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(171016, 9519, 1005, '<td valign="top">Good focus, a little action (title''s a little "off"), but medium low "wow" factor.          6 Swash</td>', 'Good focus, a little action (title''s a little "off"), but medium low "wow" factor.          6 Swash', '2002-12-12 13:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(171017, 9298, 4055, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Lovely colours. I had probably straightened it a little. Interesting to look at.</td>', 'Nice shot. Lovely colours. I had probably straightened it a little. Interesting to look at.', '2002-12-12 13:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(171019, 9312, 1005, '<td valign="top">I''m not seeing the illusion the title refers to, and I''m afraid I don''t know what Gestalt means (little help from title for me)  Nice patterns, but kinda low on the wow scale.  6 Swash</td>', 'I''m not seeing the illusion the title refers to, and I''m afraid I don''t know what Gestalt means (little help from title for me)  Nice patterns, but kinda low on the wow scale.  6 Swash', '2002-12-12 13:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(171020, 9439, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice, well done photo, but very low interest (for me, low "wow" factor).  6 Swash</td>', 'Nice, well done photo, but very low interest (for me, low "wow" factor).  6 Swash', '2002-12-12 13:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(171021, 9463, 3540, '<td valign="top">I personally would''ve put the other 2 lemons further back so that the shallow DOF would be a little more understood.  They seem pretty close to be out of focus to that degree.  The lemon in front though is remarkably sharp.  - Inspzil</td>', 'I personally would''ve put the other 2 lemons further back so that the shallow DOF would be a little more understood.  They seem pretty close to be out of focus to that degree.  The lemon in front though is remarkably sharp.  - Inspzil', '2002-12-12 13:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(171022, 9345, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very well done photo, but I''ve never liked rust shots.  (my bad, I''ll try to be better!)  Very good color, focus, framing.  Tell you what, I scored you a 6, but I''ll bump that one point for bias factor and hope that helps.  7 Swash</td>', 'Very well done photo, but I''ve never liked rust shots.  (my bad, I''ll try to be better!)  Very good color, focus, framing.  Tell you what, I scored you a 6, but I''ll bump that one point for bias factor and hope that helps.  7 Swash', '2002-12-12 13:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(171023, 9575, 2, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''ve heard it a number of times now, but this photograph is way too small to do any kind of accurate critique on.  The shot itself, if big enough to view, would have been awesome.  The yellow and silver on maroon works incredibly well.</td>', 'I''m sure you''ve heard it a number of times now, but this photograph is way too small to do any kind of accurate critique on.  The shot itself, if big enough to view, would have been awesome.  The yellow and silver on maroon works incredibly well.', '2002-12-12 13:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(171025, 9566, 811, '<td valign="top">The color, tone, and clarity of this shot is simply amazing.  Very well done.  Also, the expression on her face is hilarious.  My only nit is that I think it would feel more balanced if she were further to the right in the frame, even if you had to crop part of her elbow off.</td>', 'The color, tone, and clarity of this shot is simply amazing.  Very well done.  Also, the expression on her face is hilarious.  My only nit is that I think it would feel more balanced if she were further to the right in the frame, even if you had to crop part of her elbow off.', '2002-12-12 13:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(171026, 9482, 3540, '<td valign="top">amazing.  I think this one should win and will be surprised if it doesn''t.  It has definite visual appeal in the composition, and is taken as well as a photo can be.  I''m sure someone will grumble about the rule of 3rds or something like that.  This is super.   This is my odds on favorite though - Inspzil</td>', 'amazing.  I think this one should win and will be surprised if it doesn''t.  It has definite visual appeal in the composition, and is taken as well as a photo can be.  I''m sure someone will grumble about the rule of 3rds or something like that.  This is super.   This is my odds on favorite though - Inspzil', '2002-12-12 13:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(171028, 9313, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very good photo!  The lighting and composition are really nice, but even with all that, it doesn''t move me in any way.  7 Swash</td>', 'Very good photo!  The lighting and composition are really nice, but even with all that, it doesn''t move me in any way.  7 Swash', '2002-12-12 13:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(171029, 9402, 3080, '<td valign="top">The bulbs on a couple of the lights are a bit washed out by the bright light.  The ones around the neck and the ones farthest down seem ok.  There is a guy on photosig named Dan Hood that did a shot with this same theme.  I know this seems silly to mention, but It would have been nice to have the 3 greens at the top spaced out better, so that there were not the 3 greens right in the same spot.  Otherwise, I think the angle and framing/cropping are good.  I like how the person is moved to the right of the photo, and the lighting is ok.  focus and clarity seem to be just fine.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The bulbs on a couple of the lights are a bit washed out by the bright light.  The ones around the neck and the ones farthest down seem ok.  There is a guy on photosig named Dan Hood that did a shot with this same theme.  I know this seems silly to mention, but It would have been nice to have the 3 greens at the top spaced out better, so that there were not the 3 greens right in the same spot.  Otherwise, I think the angle and framing/cropping are good.  I like how the person is moved to the right of the photo, and the lighting is ok.  focus and clarity seem to be just fine.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-12 13:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(171030, 9552, 1005, '<td valign="top">Pretty shot, very well taken.  Initially gave this a 7, for not enough good reasons.  How about an 8?  Swash</td>', 'Pretty shot, very well taken.  Initially gave this a 7, for not enough good reasons.  How about an 8?  Swash', '2002-12-12 13:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(171031, 9538, 811, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite instruments!  (I was  trumpet major in college, and played this as my "secondary").  You have done an excellent job of capturing the texture of the horn and lighting it well without having a lot of blown out spots.  The contrasts between the curves and straight tubes is also effective.  Nicely done, on of my favorites this week. 10</td>', 'One of my favorite instruments!  (I was  trumpet major in college, and played this as my "secondary").  You have done an excellent job of capturing the texture of the horn and lighting it well without having a lot of blown out spots.  The contrasts between the curves and straight tubes is also effective.  Nicely done, on of my favorites this week. 10', '2002-12-12 13:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(171032, 9501, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, well taken and good framing.  I''ve played with similar shots, but didn''t find them to be of high interest (I had hopes, but it just doesn''t translate into a photo as well as the concept).  7 Swash</td>', 'Nice photo, well taken and good framing.  I''ve played with similar shots, but didn''t find them to be of high interest (I had hopes, but it just doesn''t translate into a photo as well as the concept).  7 Swash', '2002-12-12 13:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(171033, 9433, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like the simplicity of the blue, black, adn white in this shot.  The geometric shapes are really eyecatching, and the clouds are a nice addition as well.  This would look really good hanging on my wall (hint, hint)! 10</td>', 'I really like the simplicity of the blue, black, adn white in this shot.  The geometric shapes are really eyecatching, and the clouds are a nice addition as well.  This would look really good hanging on my wall (hint, hint)! 10', '2002-12-12 13:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(171034, 9315, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very sharp photo.  Interesting flowers.  Good contrast.  Either it''s growing on me or I''m getting soft.  Initial score 7, bumped to 8.  Swash</td>', 'Very sharp photo.  Interesting flowers.  Good contrast.  Either it''s growing on me or I''m getting soft.  Initial score 7, bumped to 8.  Swash', '2002-12-12 13:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(171035, 9531, 1005, '<td valign="top">Seems a little grainy.  I like the colors.  7 Swash</td>', 'Seems a little grainy.  I like the colors.  7 Swash', '2002-12-12 13:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(171036, 9452, 1005, '<td valign="top">Well taken photo, but what''s the connection between the feather and the bottle?  7 Swash</td>', 'Well taken photo, but what''s the connection between the feather and the bottle?  7 Swash', '2002-12-12 13:36:07.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(171037, 9521, 811, '<td valign="top">This is simply an awesome portrait.  The angle of his jaw is very powerful, yet is expression is one of a more subdued look.  The black and white works very well here, I think.  Great work.</td>', 'This is simply an awesome portrait.  The angle of his jaw is very powerful, yet is expression is one of a more subdued look.  The black and white works very well here, I think.  Great work.', '2002-12-12 13:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(171039, 9583, 3080, '<td valign="top">My only comment about this is an observation really more than it is a complaint.  The class seems to not be perfectly even within the frame.  That''s not a bad thing at all, doesn''t matter much to me.  just seems at the very top to be more to the left than to the right.  Also, another observation is that the black lines that go down the stem make the glass look like it''s leaning, when it in fact isn''t. (that I can tell)  Focus and clarity are great. Colors are wonderful!  I think that''s what draws my attention to the photo the most is the color.  Nice shot. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'My only comment about this is an observation really more than it is a complaint.  The class seems to not be perfectly even within the frame.  That''s not a bad thing at all, doesn''t matter much to me.  just seems at the very top to be more to the left than to the right.  Also, another observation is that the black lines that go down the stem make the glass look like it''s leaning, when it in fact isn''t. (that I can tell)  Focus and clarity are great. Colors are wonderful!  I think that''s what draws my attention to the photo the most is the color.  Nice shot. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-12 13:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(171040, 9567, 811, '<td valign="top">Nothing I can say to improve this shot.  I love the interplay between the dark foreground and tree and the oranges in the sky.  Very nicely done!</td>', 'Nothing I can say to improve this shot.  I love the interplay between the dark foreground and tree and the oranges in the sky.  Very nicely done!', '2002-12-12 13:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(171042, 9575, 811, '<td valign="top">So what is it with dpc adn small animals on eating utensils.  Just kidding.<br/> <br/>This shot is very well done.  The background color lends a bit of sophistication to it, and the lighting illuminates everything well without blowing out in spots.  Great focus, as well.</td>', 'So what is it with dpc adn small animals on eating utensils.  Just kidding. This shot is very well done.  The background color lends a bit of sophistication to it, and the lighting illuminates everything well without blowing out in spots.  Great focus, as well.', '2002-12-12 13:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(171043, 9552, 3080, '<td valign="top">I like the subtle difference in the wet part of the leaf and the dry part.  The white light reflections add to this shot in my opinion.  I think they put just enough variation in the photo that it stays interesting.  The colors is very nice, as is your focus and clarity.  Good shot. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the subtle difference in the wet part of the leaf and the dry part.  The white light reflections add to this shot in my opinion.  I think they put just enough variation in the photo that it stays interesting.  The colors is very nice, as is your focus and clarity.  Good shot. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-12 13:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(171045, 9485, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice hair cut ;)<br/>I like the lovely big archway and the mood of this shot. Works well in BW.<br/>Exposure feels off - too dark at very top and too blown out around stained glass window and roof of that area. I don''t know that this would be easy to fix!!! It''s a sure candidate for a PhotoShop job!<br/>Like the way the arches at the right reflect the arch shape - nice light and shadow. Also like the sheen of the wooden pews and the positioning of the bloke.<br/>Not what I''d call a postcard shot but interesting.</td>', 'Nice hair cut ;)I like the lovely big archway and the mood of this shot. Works well in BW.Exposure feels off - too dark at very top and too blown out around stained glass window and roof of that area. I don''t know that this would be easy to fix!!! It''s a sure candidate for a PhotoShop job!Like the way the arches at the right reflect the arch shape - nice light and shadow. Also like the sheen of the wooden pews and the positioning of the bloke.Not what I''d call a postcard shot but interesting.', '2002-12-12 13:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(171048, 9578, 811, '<td valign="top">Great composition and color (or general lack thereof).  The red really stands out and grabs attention for this picture.  The detail of the ice is simply awesome and this is a great use of a narrow depth of field.  The picture, if focused entirely, would be way too busy, but the blurry background really emphasizes the subject.</td>', 'Great composition and color (or general lack thereof).  The red really stands out and grabs attention for this picture.  The detail of the ice is simply awesome and this is a great use of a narrow depth of field.  The picture, if focused entirely, would be way too busy, but the blurry background really emphasizes the subject.', '2002-12-12 13:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(171049, 9383, 3087, '<td valign="top">Very nice... GREAT use of DOF. Excellent orangey colour - lighting spot on.<br/>How did you get those weird traffic light blobs at the back?</td>', 'Very nice... GREAT use of DOF. Excellent orangey colour - lighting spot on.How did you get those weird traffic light blobs at the back?', '2002-12-12 13:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(171052, 9313, 3080, '<td valign="top">Could this background be becoming a trend?  The background is nice, the subject isn''t super thrilling, but it does make for a nice abstract-ish photo.  The shadows bother me.  It has like a double (maybe tripple) shadow and that is what I find myself trying to figure out, rather than looking at the block.  The light on the top of the cube seems to me just a tad bright, it almost blends in with the white background.  I love the angle and framing/cropping you have chosen.  And your focus and clarity are good as well.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Could this background be becoming a trend?  The background is nice, the subject isn''t super thrilling, but it does make for a nice abstract-ish photo.  The shadows bother me.  It has like a double (maybe tripple) shadow and that is what I find myself trying to figure out, rather than looking at the block.  The light on the top of the cube seems to me just a tad bright, it almost blends in with the white background.  I love the angle and framing/cropping you have chosen.  And your focus and clarity are good as well.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-12 13:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(171056, 9501, 3080, '<td valign="top">I swear I left my comment on this, but apparently it didn\''t stick, or didn\''t go through or something.  Anyway, I love the angle and framing/cropping.  I like how you have ONLY the leaves in sharp focus and the rest is a blurr.  The background is very nice for the shot, and is not distracting in any way.  the subtle color is nice, and I like the title very much, it really goes with this shot.  Lighting conditions are very nice as well.  I like how we see the shadow of the other leaf through this one. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I swear I left my comment on this, but apparently it didn\''t stick, or didn\''t go through or something.  Anyway, I love the angle and framing/cropping.  I like how you have ONLY the leaves in sharp focus and the rest is a blurr.  The background is very nice for the shot, and is not distracting in any way.  the subtle color is nice, and I like the title very much, it really goes with this shot.  Lighting conditions are very nice as well.  I like how we see the shadow of the other leaf through this one. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-12 13:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(171058, 9543, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the motion this shot has and the black adn white is truly effective<br/></td>', 'I like the motion this shot has and the black adn white is truly effective', '2002-12-12 13:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(171059, 9449, 3080, '<td valign="top">They sky is a bit bland, and the buildings in the background are really quite tilted.  Taking the background out of the picture though (figuratively speaking) the subject is good.  I like how you have a photo of a moment.  You can see the concentration on your friends face.  I think portraits are best when  you get the person doing something to like to do, or something that relates to their person.  Focus and clarity are nice.  Good luck in the chalelnge.</td>', 'They sky is a bit bland, and the buildings in the background are really quite tilted.  Taking the background out of the picture though (figuratively speaking) the subject is good.  I like how you have a photo of a moment.  You can see the concentration on your friends face.  I think portraits are best when  you get the person doing something to like to do, or something that relates to their person.  Focus and clarity are nice.  Good luck in the chalelnge.', '2002-12-12 13:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(171060, 9469, 3080, '<td valign="top">You have leveled your horizon very nicely. That is something a lot of people (including myself) often forget to do.  The pattern is nice.  The horizontal lines in combination with the vertical lines on the deck are nice.  focus and clarity on the bay seems good to me, however the stair railging in the foreground is a bit distracting to me.  Otherwise a nice shot. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'You have leveled your horizon very nicely. That is something a lot of people (including myself) often forget to do.  The pattern is nice.  The horizontal lines in combination with the vertical lines on the deck are nice.  focus and clarity on the bay seems good to me, however the stair railging in the foreground is a bit distracting to me.  Otherwise a nice shot. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-12 13:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(171061, 9567, 3080, '<td valign="top">I think this shot would be improved by either darkening or lightening the foreground.  Right now, it''s dark, like it''s suposed to be a silhouette, bt there is still somewhat of detail in it.  The black looks cloudy.  I think it would be better if totally blacked out.  Otherwise, the color is very pretty.  Focus seems good to me.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I think this shot would be improved by either darkening or lightening the foreground.  Right now, it''s dark, like it''s suposed to be a silhouette, bt there is still somewhat of detail in it.  The black looks cloudy.  I think it would be better if totally blacked out.  Otherwise, the color is very pretty.  Focus seems good to me.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-12 14:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(171064, 9496, 1005, '<td valign="top">Exactly!  well taken photo, but it just doesn''t "grab" me (interest wise).  It might have looked a little better w/o the sign post.  Colorful leaves!  7 Swash</td>', 'Exactly!  well taken photo, but it just doesn''t "grab" me (interest wise).  It might have looked a little better w/o the sign post.  Colorful leaves!  7 Swash', '2002-12-12 14:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(171067, 9522, 1005, '<td valign="top">Well taken photo!  It''s a little low interest for me, but photographically, it''s fine.  <br/>7  Swash</td>', 'Well taken photo!  It''s a little low interest for me, but photographically, it''s fine.  7  Swash', '2002-12-12 14:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(171070, 9543, 1005, '<td valign="top">Well taken photo.  The whole is nearly shaped like an eye (I wonder if something couldn''t have been done to accentuate that!)  7 Swash</td>', 'Well taken photo.  The whole is nearly shaped like an eye (I wonder if something couldn''t have been done to accentuate that!)  7 Swash', '2002-12-12 14:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(171071, 9546, 1005, '<td valign="top">I like the tree and the cloud background works well with it.  The buildings I could have easily lived w/o.  7 Swash</td>', 'I like the tree and the cloud background works well with it.  The buildings I could have easily lived w/o.  7 Swash', '2002-12-12 14:11:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(171072, 9494, 1005, '<td valign="top">This shot seems like it would have been so very colorful!  (but I''m guessing!)  Nice composition, framing and focus are all good.  The glare off the man''s shirt is a tad harsh.  7 Swash</td>', 'This shot seems like it would have been so very colorful!  (but I''m guessing!)  Nice composition, framing and focus are all good.  The glare off the man''s shirt is a tad harsh.  7 Swash', '2002-12-12 14:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(171073, 9379, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very well taken photo.  Good emotion.  Too bad it''s cloudy (definately not YOUR fault!).  I''m guessing, but this must be a "local" monument, it might have helped to know that by including a reference to it (just a thought).  7 Swash</td>', 'Very well taken photo.  Good emotion.  Too bad it''s cloudy (definately not YOUR fault!).  I''m guessing, but this must be a "local" monument, it might have helped to know that by including a reference to it (just a thought).  7 Swash', '2002-12-12 14:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(171074, 9485, 1005, '<td valign="top">Well taken photo.  Sepia seems well used in this case.  The glare in the stained glass - I don''t know, it might be a good thing, but I just don''t care for glare.  <br/>7 Swash</td>', 'Well taken photo.  Sepia seems well used in this case.  The glare in the stained glass - I don''t know, it might be a good thing, but I just don''t care for glare.  7 Swash', '2002-12-12 14:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(171075, 9433, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, neat pattern on the lighthouse.  Prudy clouds and blue sky.  Low interest for me. (it needs something, what I dunno)  7 Swash</td>', 'Nice picture, neat pattern on the lighthouse.  Prudy clouds and blue sky.  Low interest for me. (it needs something, what I dunno)  7 Swash', '2002-12-12 14:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(171076, 9383, 1005, '<td valign="top">Crazy shot!  Interesting perspective, but hard to view.  7 Swash</td>', 'Crazy shot!  Interesting perspective, but hard to view.  7 Swash', '2002-12-12 14:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(171077, 9538, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very sharp shot!  This is a different view.  Sorry, I don''t get your title.  Which instrument is this?  (a tuba? or french horn?)  This deserves a score bump, raising from 7 to 8.  Swash</td>', 'Very sharp shot!  This is a different view.  Sorry, I don''t get your title.  Which instrument is this?  (a tuba? or french horn?)  This deserves a score bump, raising from 7 to 8.  Swash', '2002-12-12 14:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(171081, 9469, 1005, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea for a photo.  Nice patterns.  Score bump, from 7 to 8.  Swash</td>', 'Interesting idea for a photo.  Nice patterns.  Score bump, from 7 to 8.  Swash', '2002-12-12 14:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(171082, 9450, 1005, '<td valign="top">This is really nice.  Very good depth of field.   Sorry to ask, but what are the two smears on the (I think it''s called) bridge?  (The dark brown piece where the strings are anchored).  A touch of glare, but nothing horrible.  8 Swash</td>', 'This is really nice.  Very good depth of field.   Sorry to ask, but what are the two smears on the (I think it''s called) bridge?  (The dark brown piece where the strings are anchored).  A touch of glare, but nothing horrible.  8 Swash', '2002-12-12 14:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(171083, 9386, 1005, '<td valign="top">Love fire shots.  Seems like the red needs more emphasis (esp. the coals).  Nice shot.  8 Swash</td>', 'Love fire shots.  Seems like the red needs more emphasis (esp. the coals).  Nice shot.  8 Swash', '2002-12-12 14:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(171084, 9551, 1005, '<td valign="top">Interesting pattern.  Honestly, I''m liking this less as I review the rest of the photos.  The wow/interest factor is a bit low for me, still, it''s a very well taken shot.  Started with an 8, almost lowered it to a 7, but I''ll let it stand as close enough.  <br/>8 Swash</td>', 'Interesting pattern.  Honestly, I''m liking this less as I review the rest of the photos.  The wow/interest factor is a bit low for me, still, it''s a very well taken shot.  Started with an 8, almost lowered it to a 7, but I''ll let it stand as close enough.  8 Swash', '2002-12-12 14:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(171085, 9465, 1005, '<td valign="top">Neat portrait.  Nice color.  Good focus.  Interesting, but not fully flattering pose.<br/>8 Swash</td>', 'Neat portrait.  Nice color.  Good focus.  Interesting, but not fully flattering pose.8 Swash', '2002-12-12 14:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(171086, 9553, 1005, '<td valign="top">Wheee, fun shot, but almost too much negative space.  The background color and the tag are just too close (IMO).  Maybe you wanted them blended.  8 Swash</td>', 'Wheee, fun shot, but almost too much negative space.  The background color and the tag are just too close (IMO).  Maybe you wanted them blended.  8 Swash', '2002-12-12 14:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(171087, 9521, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait.  Did he know you were taking his picture?  It has a good, candid feel to it.  Good contrasts, both in lighting and with the second face in the background.  8 Swash</td>', 'Very nice portrait.  Did he know you were taking his picture?  It has a good, candid feel to it.  Good contrasts, both in lighting and with the second face in the background.  8 Swash', '2002-12-12 14:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(171088, 9388, 1005, '<td valign="top">Well taken photo.  Kinda has a optical illusion to it with the ends jumping out at you. 8 Swash</td>', 'Well taken photo.  Kinda has a optical illusion to it with the ends jumping out at you. 8 Swash', '2002-12-12 14:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(171127, 9567, 772, '<td valign="top">I like this one much better :) - setzler</td>', 'I like this one much better :) - setzler', '2002-12-12 16:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(171129, 9522, 772, '<td valign="top">This is nice.. i think this would also look good in black and white :) - setzler</td>', 'This is nice.. i think this would also look good in black and white :) - setzler', '2002-12-12 16:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(171144, 9473, 811, '<td valign="top">You have captured the texture of these stockings well.  For some reason, I think if the red was in the middle it would seem more balanced to me.  The purple and blue kinda run together, it seems.</td>', 'You have captured the texture of these stockings well.  For some reason, I think if the red was in the middle it would seem more balanced to me.  The purple and blue kinda run together, it seems.', '2002-12-12 16:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(171147, 9496, 811, '<td valign="top">Good use of humor.  Is that like a sign for general information or something?  Good contrast of colors (foliage vs. blue/white sign)</td>', 'Good use of humor.  Is that like a sign for general information or something?  Good contrast of colors (foliage vs. blue/white sign)', '2002-12-12 16:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(171149, 9388, 4967, '<td valign="top">Very interesting... not really a subject I would ever think of shooting.  Very nice macro, as I assume those aren''t gigantic spaghetti sticks!  Hehehe... there is some loss of color and clarity at the corners, this can be due to the lens that makes up your lens.  To correct this, you have to shoot a subject that you can crop.  Just a suggestion though.  Pretty good lighting, I love this pic!  -7</td>', 'Very interesting... not really a subject I would ever think of shooting.  Very nice macro, as I assume those aren''t gigantic spaghetti sticks!  Hehehe... there is some loss of color and clarity at the corners, this can be due to the lens that makes up your lens.  To correct this, you have to shoot a subject that you can crop.  Just a suggestion though.  Pretty good lighting, I love this pic!  -7', '2002-12-12 16:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(171151, 9503, 811, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of black and white.  And a picture I can definitely relate to!</td>', 'Excellent use of black and white.  And a picture I can definitely relate to!', '2002-12-12 16:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(171152, 9463, 4967, '<td valign="top">Beatiful colors, and I''m so glad you put in the droplets and the seeds for extra interest.  Although I often like a shallow DOF, I think this picture may have been better with a wide one.  Just personal preference though.  Nice job though, and good luck!  - 7</td>', 'Beatiful colors, and I''m so glad you put in the droplets and the seeds for extra interest.  Although I often like a shallow DOF, I think this picture may have been better with a wide one.  Just personal preference though.  Nice job though, and good luck!  - 7', '2002-12-12 16:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
