(171278, 9503, 3080, '<td valign="top">Not really a overly thrilling image, however technically well done.  I think that this has a good angle and framing/cropping. Focus and clarity are good, and the use of black and white is nice as well.  Overall a well taken photo. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Not really a overly thrilling image, however technically well done.  I think that this has a good angle and framing/cropping. Focus and clarity are good, and the use of black and white is nice as well.  Overall a well taken photo. Good luck in the challenge.', '2002-12-12 18:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(171282, 9566, 5475, '<td valign="top">The expressionon her face really draws my attention.  It''s not the expression I would expect for a kids chior leader.  It adds a lot of interest to the photo.  The action seems to be in front of her, so I would have cropped this with more space in front of her and less behind.  Good job of capturing her in action.  You did a good job of not having the highlights get too hot on her white clothing, which is tough to do.  Smellyfish1002</td>', 'The expressionon her face really draws my attention.  It''s not the expression I would expect for a kids chior leader.  It adds a lot of interest to the photo.  The action seems to be in front of her, so I would have cropped this with more space in front of her and less behind.  Good job of capturing her in action.  You did a good job of not having the highlights get too hot on her white clothing, which is tough to do.  Smellyfish1002', '2002-12-12 19:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(171283, 9561, 5475, '<td valign="top">Your focus and clarity is excellent in this shot, and I like the bluish tone instead of a brassy or copper tone.  It is a nice macro, but is missing something in developing interest.  Maybe something mixed in with the bb''s...  Maybe a red ball orsomething that would stand out and break up the pattern a little.  JD</td>', 'Your focus and clarity is excellent in this shot, and I like the bluish tone instead of a brassy or copper tone.  It is a nice macro, but is missing something in developing interest.  Maybe something mixed in with the bb''s...  Maybe a red ball orsomething that would stand out and break up the pattern a little.  JD', '2002-12-12 19:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
