(171958, 9369, 255, '<td valign="top">hehehe, how cool is this?! awesome idea and very well executed. perhaps cropped just a tad too close on the right, but not that big of a deal. i love it!</td>', 'hehehe, how cool is this?! awesome idea and very well executed. perhaps cropped just a tad too close on the right, but not that big of a deal. i love it!', '2002-12-14 04:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
