(171982, 9485, 1128, '<td valign="top">That''s a beautiful structure and  I like the perspective from which this was taken.  The light through the large window seems a little blow out to me.</td>', 'That''s a beautiful structure and  I like the perspective from which this was taken.  The light through the large window seems a little blow out to me.', '2002-12-14 08:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(171983, 9561, 1128, '<td valign="top">They look like tiny Xmas ornaments!  You handled the glare well, I think.</td>', 'They look like tiny Xmas ornaments!  You handled the glare well, I think.', '2002-12-14 08:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(171984, 9436, 1128, '<td valign="top">I really like the perspective of this shot.  It would have been a totally different photo if you hadn''t had the tree in it.  The "expression" on the squirrel''s face is priceless!</td>', 'I really like the perspective of this shot.  It would have been a totally different photo if you hadn''t had the tree in it.  The "expression" on the squirrel''s face is priceless!', '2002-12-14 08:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(171985, 9378, 1128, '<td valign="top">This is a nice crop for this photo.  Good colors, too.  A nit-picky comment: for macros, I am distracted by any little piece of dirt or dust.  My eye traveled to the dust on the top of the marbles.  Not a big deal by any means, but you may want to consider it.  Otherwise, good job.</td>', 'This is a nice crop for this photo.  Good colors, too.  A nit-picky comment: for macros, I am distracted by any little piece of dirt or dust.  My eye traveled to the dust on the top of the marbles.  Not a big deal by any means, but you may want to consider it.  Otherwise, good job.', '2002-12-14 08:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(171986, 9553, 1128, '<td valign="top">This is a cute idea.  I like the placement of the kiss.  I also like that the label clearly reads "Kisses".  You have a perfectly white background, which makes it stand out.  I would have bumped the saturation up a touch to make the green really pop!</td>', 'This is a cute idea.  I like the placement of the kiss.  I also like that the label clearly reads "Kisses".  You have a perfectly white background, which makes it stand out.  I would have bumped the saturation up a touch to make the green really pop!', '2002-12-14 08:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(171987, 9582, 1128, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely shot.  I really like the white background and I am very fond of the color of the ornament.  You left in just enough of the tree so as not to be distracting.  The focus seems soft on the top of the ornament.</td>', 'This is a lovely shot.  I really like the white background and I am very fond of the color of the ornament.  You left in just enough of the tree so as not to be distracting.  The focus seems soft on the top of the ornament.', '2002-12-14 08:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(171988, 9310, 1128, '<td valign="top">Cute. I like the lighting.</td>', 'Cute. I like the lighting.', '2002-12-14 08:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(171989, 9583, 1128, '<td valign="top">Wow, the frame color matches the "stripe" in the martini exactly!  This is a cool shot.</td>', 'Wow, the frame color matches the "stripe" in the martini exactly!  This is a cool shot.', '2002-12-14 08:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(171990, 9390, 1128, '<td valign="top">It''s not "my thing", but I like the placement of the knives so as not to block important parts of the art.</td>', 'It''s not "my thing", but I like the placement of the knives so as not to block important parts of the art.', '2002-12-14 08:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(171991, 9538, 1128, '<td valign="top">Great choice of black background, and you handled the shiny surface well.</td>', 'Great choice of black background, and you handled the shiny surface well.', '2002-12-14 08:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
