(171993, 9473, 1128, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this.  However, when I look at the image, my eye doesn''t know where to "rest".  It seems, from my perspective, that there is a lack of focal point.   I would love to see your outtakes of this challenge, and see if there is a photo that has more of a focal point.</td>', 'I like the idea of this.  However, when I look at the image, my eye doesn''t know where to "rest".  It seems, from my perspective, that there is a lack of focal point.   I would love to see your outtakes of this challenge, and see if there is a photo that has more of a focal point.', '2002-12-14 08:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
