(172206, 9566, 3540, '<td valign="top">She looks like she has the attitude of a day-after-thanksgiving shopper.  Well captured emotion and action.  The whole pic is a little bit dark though IMO - Inspzil</td>', 'She looks like she has the attitude of a day-after-thanksgiving shopper.  Well captured emotion and action.  The whole pic is a little bit dark though IMO - Inspzil', '2002-12-15 07:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(172207, 9447, 3540, '<td valign="top">I''m not wild about how this portrait is framed.  It think it should include more of her hair and stuff at the top of the pic.  Maybe even her hand too.  She could use a speck of powder so shes not so shiny.  For my taste, it needs a little less light - Inspzil</td>', 'I''m not wild about how this portrait is framed.  It think it should include more of her hair and stuff at the top of the pic.  Maybe even her hand too.  She could use a speck of powder so shes not so shiny.  For my taste, it needs a little less light - Inspzil', '2002-12-15 07:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(172208, 9495, 3540, '<td valign="top">Wonderful color on this.  i like the fact that we can''t see anything but the lights.  Very well done and good job finding this place.  Inspzil</td>', 'Wonderful color on this.  i like the fact that we can''t see anything but the lights.  Very well done and good job finding this place.  Inspzil', '2002-12-15 07:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(172209, 9585, 3540, '<td valign="top">Too tight of a crop for my tastes.  Great job with the DOF.  Most of the face is very well focused.  I think she should be looking down and to the viewers left though.  I''m not sure if that''s right, but when I look at her, that''s what comes to mind mostly due to the framing - Inspzil</td>', 'Too tight of a crop for my tastes.  Great job with the DOF.  Most of the face is very well focused.  I think she should be looking down and to the viewers left though.  I''m not sure if that''s right, but when I look at her, that''s what comes to mind mostly due to the framing - Inspzil', '2002-12-15 07:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(172210, 9367, 3540, '<td valign="top">Lines and shapes make for wonderful pics.  Add a little holiday color and voila!  Great subject, composition and well taken - Inspzil</td>', 'Lines and shapes make for wonderful pics.  Add a little holiday color and voila!  Great subject, composition and well taken - Inspzil', '2002-12-15 07:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
