(172214, 9402, 3540, '<td valign="top">Original idea.  Not so sure why you made her look like the Grinch.  I don''t like the overall green tint.  Perhaps  red would''ve been better. - Inspzil</td>', 'Original idea.  Not so sure why you made her look like the Grinch.  I don''t like the overall green tint.  Perhaps  red would''ve been better. - Inspzil', '2002-12-15 08:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
