(172216, 9559, 3540, '<td valign="top">The concept of the pic is  pretty good.  I don''t like how it looks grainy, out of focus.  The sky is really washed out, considering it is the sky.  The bird is not particularly well captured either.  You could''ve increased the saturation to make him really stand out.  Inspzil</td>', 'The concept of the pic is  pretty good.  I don''t like how it looks grainy, out of focus.  The sky is really washed out, considering it is the sky.  The bird is not particularly well captured either.  You could''ve increased the saturation to make him really stand out.  Inspzil', '2002-12-15 08:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(172217, 9433, 3540, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous capture of architecture.  It looks like its leaning to the left to me.  Great job getting the sky nice and blue.  Overall a good pic - Inspzil</td>', 'Gorgeous capture of architecture.  It looks like its leaning to the left to me.  Great job getting the sky nice and blue.  Overall a good pic - Inspzil', '2002-12-15 08:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
