(172219, 9568, 3540, '<td valign="top">Sky being bluer would help this as it is fairly colorless lie it is.  The angle the pic was taken at could''ve moved a little to hide a little more of the sun.  The buildings in the background are a little distracting to me. - Inspzil</td>', 'Sky being bluer would help this as it is fairly colorless lie it is.  The angle the pic was taken at could''ve moved a little to hide a little more of the sun.  The buildings in the background are a little distracting to me. - Inspzil', '2002-12-15 08:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(172220, 9436, 3540, '<td valign="top">This is a really great capture.  Not every technical aspect of this pic is perfect.  The perspective of peeking out from behind the tree is excellent and makes this photo as great as it is IMO.  The squirrel sitting there all fat and looking like he''s responding to the photographer is adorable.  Like he stopped to say "cheese" like a kid.  Nice Capture - Inspzil</td>', 'This is a really great capture.  Not every technical aspect of this pic is perfect.  The perspective of peeking out from behind the tree is excellent and makes this photo as great as it is IMO.  The squirrel sitting there all fat and looking like he''s responding to the photographer is adorable.  Like he stopped to say "cheese" like a kid.  Nice Capture - Inspzil', '2002-12-15 08:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
