(172231, 9345, 1202, '<td valign="top">You have made this otherwise overlooked chain into an attention grabber, but it just doesn''t keep my interest.   Quite short term, but good job.</td>', 'You have made this otherwise overlooked chain into an attention grabber, but it just doesn''t keep my interest.   Quite short term, but good job.', '2002-12-15 09:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
