(172235, 9378, 1202, '<td valign="top">You may know better than I but the light seems a littleunderstated.   The lint is distracting too.</td>', 'You may know better than I but the light seems a littleunderstated.   The lint is distracting too.', '2002-12-15 09:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(172236, 9566, 1202, '<td valign="top">Great skin tones.   The little bright spot behind her shoulder is kind of bothersome and does not help you.   Nice human interest shot though.</td>', 'Great skin tones.   The little bright spot behind her shoulder is kind of bothersome and does not help you.   Nice human interest shot though.', '2002-12-15 09:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(172237, 9310, 1202, '<td valign="top">Spot on focus and great little subject.   The background is a little too busy and does cause a definate distraction.</td>', 'Spot on focus and great little subject.   The background is a little too busy and does cause a definate distraction.', '2002-12-15 09:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(172238, 9485, 1202, '<td valign="top">I feel that this picture would have been sooo much better if the window in the background was not blown out.   It seems to be an important part of the picture but has no detail.</td>', 'I feel that this picture would have been sooo much better if the window in the background was not blown out.   It seems to be an important part of the picture but has no detail.', '2002-12-15 09:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(172240, 9582, 1202, '<td valign="top">This one makes me want to turn it over to look for the Hallmark mark. I think they would have managed to get the tree in focus also, and that is all I can find.</td>', 'This one makes me want to turn it over to look for the Hallmark mark. I think they would have managed to get the tree in focus also, and that is all I can find.', '2002-12-15 09:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(172241, 9506, 1202, '<td valign="top">It looks like you had an excellent picture taking opportunity here.   I feel that it would have been a much better shot if you had been closer to the dried up limb in the pond and used it to fill your frame.   That may have been imposible, but this distant shot leaves me disinterested.   I take pictures like this one too.</td>', 'It looks like you had an excellent picture taking opportunity here.   I feel that it would have been a much better shot if you had been closer to the dried up limb in the pond and used it to fill your frame.   That may have been imposible, but this distant shot leaves me disinterested.   I take pictures like this one too.', '2002-12-15 09:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(172243, 9586, 1202, '<td valign="top">Good use of your photographic eye.   The little hornlike portion sticking up disrupts the flowing lines of the main part of your twig.   I would also wonder what it was without your title, sometimes a title is necessary, but I like pictures better if they are self explanatory.   Just my opinion.</td>', 'Good use of your photographic eye.   The little hornlike portion sticking up disrupts the flowing lines of the main part of your twig.   I would also wonder what it was without your title, sometimes a title is necessary, but I like pictures better if they are self explanatory.   Just my opinion.', '2002-12-15 09:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(172245, 9450, 1202, '<td valign="top">Dead on focus and good DOF.   With this type of subject, why do you have anything at all in the background?   I scroll down and eliminate the background and then your picture pops.</td>', 'Dead on focus and good DOF.   With this type of subject, why do you have anything at all in the background?   I scroll down and eliminate the background and then your picture pops.', '2002-12-15 10:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(172247, 9522, 1202, '<td valign="top">It looks to me that you might have accomplished a better shot if you had come in closer and just simply took the picture through the stump, framing the trees with it. The background all around the subject steals your intended image from you.   IMO.</td>', 'It looks to me that you might have accomplished a better shot if you had come in closer and just simply took the picture through the stump, framing the trees with it. The background all around the subject steals your intended image from you.   IMO.', '2002-12-15 10:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(172248, 9567, 1202, '<td valign="top">We all like a sunrise and yours is a good one.   I don\''t think it is outstanding though, and this is a question we must ask ourselves when taking their picture.   The sun is blown out, and iI realize you had to expose long enough to get the wonderful tree.   Maybe some sort of filter might have helped.   Good luck in the future.</td>', 'We all like a sunrise and yours is a good one.   I don\''t think it is outstanding though, and this is a question we must ask ourselves when taking their picture.   The sun is blown out, and iI realize you had to expose long enough to get the wonderful tree.   Maybe some sort of filter might have helped.   Good luck in the future.', '2002-12-15 10:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(172251, 9465, 1202, '<td valign="top">Nice effect with the lighting, but the bright spots in her eyes are very distracting to me.</td>', 'Nice effect with the lighting, but the bright spots in her eyes are very distracting to me.', '2002-12-15 10:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(172252, 9367, 1202, '<td valign="top">Technically a nice picture, but it leaves me kind of empty on the interest side of things.   Maybe this would have been a time to forget the thirds thing and go for the whole effect and center it in your frame.   It is a kind of vertigo shot, so go for the gusto.</td>', 'Technically a nice picture, but it leaves me kind of empty on the interest side of things.   Maybe this would have been a time to forget the thirds thing and go for the whole effect and center it in your frame.   It is a kind of vertigo shot, so go for the gusto.', '2002-12-15 10:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(172254, 9551, 1202, '<td valign="top">A nice symetrical shot.   The spot of sky in the top left side kind of fouls it all up, and I wish there was something at the end of your tunnel.</td>', 'A nice symetrical shot.   The spot of sky in the top left side kind of fouls it all up, and I wish there was something at the end of your tunnel.', '2002-12-15 10:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(172255, 9386, 1202, '<td valign="top">Even though the fire is inviting, I doesn\''t fire me up.  No pun intended.   I feel it needs something more in the picture to set the mood.   Books, bear rug, a girl, etc.</td>', 'Even though the fire is inviting, I doesn\''t fire me up.  No pun intended.   I feel it needs something more in the picture to set the mood.   Books, bear rug, a girl, etc.', '2002-12-15 10:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(172260, 9571, 1202, '<td valign="top">Nice picture of your leaves, good focus, DOF and exposure.   It doesn''t particulary WOW me but it might look good, great big on an office wall .</td>', 'Nice picture of your leaves, good focus, DOF and exposure.   It doesn''t particulary WOW me but it might look good, great big on an office wall .', '2002-12-15 10:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(172263, 9315, 1202, '<td valign="top">I would like to see this in color and without the top left leaf.   It leaves me kind of empty now.</td>', 'I would like to see this in color and without the top left leaf.   It leaves me kind of empty now.', '2002-12-15 10:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(172264, 9459, 1202, '<td valign="top">A kind of snapshot type of picture to me.   Maybe if you could have placed your subject (people) more in the foreground to separate them from the fence it would have a better effect.</td>', 'A kind of snapshot type of picture to me.   Maybe if you could have placed your subject (people) more in the foreground to separate them from the fence it would have a better effect.', '2002-12-15 10:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(172265, 9340, 1202, '<td valign="top">Nice technical shot, It just doesn\''t fire my rocket.   It reminds me of something that should be in my opthomologists office.</td>', 'Nice technical shot, It just doesn\''t fire my rocket.   It reminds me of something that should be in my opthomologists office.', '2002-12-15 10:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(172266, 9503, 1202, '<td valign="top">I feel that you could have put a little more effort into this picture and helped it a bit.   The focus is soft and exposure need some more light.  The spots on the wall and the extra piece of metal do not help it at all.   A discarded pizza box would have been nice though.</td>', 'I feel that you could have put a little more effort into this picture and helped it a bit.   The focus is soft and exposure need some more light.  The spots on the wall and the extra piece of metal do not help it at all.   A discarded pizza box would have been nice though.', '2002-12-15 10:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(172268, 9465, 772, '<td valign="top">very interesting use of lighting on this shot... she''s looking up into the unknown... nice idea and good work :) - setzler</td>', 'very interesting use of lighting on this shot... she''s looking up into the unknown... nice idea and good work :) - setzler', '2002-12-15 10:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(172408, 9578, 3724, '<td valign="top">9........   I like the colours.  i like it with a tighter crop on the left of the picture.  I think you sharpened, but not sure.....   I think i can see a bit of it.</td>', '9........   I like the colours.  i like it with a tighter crop on the left of the picture.  I think you sharpened, but not sure.....   I think i can see a bit of it.', '2002-12-15 12:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
