(172446, 9482, 1379, '<td valign="top">Circus psychotropics!</td>', 'Circus psychotropics!', '2002-12-15 14:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(172448, 9566, 1379, '<td valign="top">Perfect for the photojournalism challenge.  She is so animated!</td>', 'Perfect for the photojournalism challenge.  She is so animated!', '2002-12-15 14:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(172515, 9345, 4411, '<td valign="top">A fantastic shot. Love the colours. My no.1 for this challenge.</td>', 'A fantastic shot. Love the colours. My no.1 for this challenge.', '2002-12-15 16:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(172521, 9583, 4411, '<td valign="top">Good simple composition with nice shapes and strong colour.<br/>It doesn''t seem quite straight, and there''s a bit of stray shadow in the top right, but I still like this a lot.</td>', 'Good simple composition with nice shapes and strong colour.It doesn''t seem quite straight, and there''s a bit of stray shadow in the top right, but I still like this a lot.', '2002-12-15 16:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(172528, 9367, 4411, '<td valign="top">Great choice of framing and kudos for having the imagination to look up! I like it a lot.</td>', 'Great choice of framing and kudos for having the imagination to look up! I like it a lot.', '2002-12-15 16:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(172532, 9551, 4411, '<td valign="top">Great mix of colours &amp; textures here, along with a nice composition. I like this a lot.</td>', 'Great mix of colours & textures here, along with a nice composition. I like this a lot.', '2002-12-15 16:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(172606, 9575, 4411, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice shot, but why so small?<br/>Would have loved to see it a lot bigger.</td>', 'This is a really nice shot, but why so small?Would have loved to see it a lot bigger.', '2002-12-15 17:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(172616, 9436, 2553, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, and what a cute little pink nose!  None of "our" squirrels would ever let us get that close!  I like that you kept the tree in the shot instead of having the little guy just out there kind of "floating" in the snow.  8</td>', 'Cool shot, and what a cute little pink nose!  None of "our" squirrels would ever let us get that close!  I like that you kept the tree in the shot instead of having the little guy just out there kind of "floating" in the snow.  8', '2002-12-15 18:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(172618, 9575, 2553, '<td valign="top">I really wish the photo was a little bigger, I''d love to see the snail better.  I like the shot, and the unique idea, and I love your background, it gives the shot a very rich, warm feeling that I like.  8</td>', 'I really wish the photo was a little bigger, I''d love to see the snail better.  I like the shot, and the unique idea, and I love your background, it gives the shot a very rich, warm feeling that I like.  8', '2002-12-15 18:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(172667, 9582, 554, '<td valign="top">looks like a Christmas card..very pretty and profesional</td>', 'looks like a Christmas card..very pretty and profesional', '2002-12-15 20:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(172674, 9494, 1847, '<td valign="top">I like this photo.   Lots of things to see.  I wonder if it might have been better in color, what with the array of different things in the shot.</td>', 'I like this photo.   Lots of things to see.  I wonder if it might have been better in color, what with the array of different things in the shot.', '2002-12-15 21:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(172675, 9336, 1847, '<td valign="top">Interesting, looks almost computer generated.</td>', 'Interesting, looks almost computer generated.', '2002-12-15 21:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(172677, 9497, 1847, '<td valign="top">Very well done technical shot.  Looks a little grainy.</td>', 'Very well done technical shot.  Looks a little grainy.', '2002-12-15 21:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(172679, 9482, 2079, '<td valign="top">This is just a pleasure to look at. This is my highest rated photo in the members'' challenge, congratulations. The colors are to die for. I have no idea how to improve on this shot, this is not typically my favorite type of art, but I can''t help but smile when I look at this. Good Luck, I think this will do well for you in the challenge. - 10    Gotcha</td>', 'This is just a pleasure to look at. This is my highest rated photo in the members'' challenge, congratulations. The colors are to die for. I have no idea how to improve on this shot, this is not typically my favorite type of art, but I can''t help but smile when I look at this. Good Luck, I think this will do well for you in the challenge. - 10    Gotcha', '2002-12-15 21:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(172681, 9485, 2079, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot. I like the lines, curves and angles. The blown out lighting brings a lot of interest to the shot for me. The humble body language of the man in prayer and the divine lighting entering the window bring an unusual balance to the shot. (From a technical perspective, I would NOT say this is lacking in any way, but the window may cause you some grief with the voters).  This is one of my favorite shots in the members challenge this week. Congratulations  and good luck with the other voters.  _ Gotcha - 9</td>', 'This is a great shot. I like the lines, curves and angles. The blown out lighting brings a lot of interest to the shot for me. The humble body language of the man in prayer and the divine lighting entering the window bring an unusual balance to the shot. (From a technical perspective, I would NOT say this is lacking in any way, but the window may cause you some grief with the voters).  This is one of my favorite shots in the members challenge this week. Congratulations  and good luck with the other voters.  _ Gotcha - 9', '2002-12-15 21:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(172682, 9538, 2079, '<td valign="top">This is great work. Good detail, no harsh lighting. I''d love to hang this on my wall, but i can''t see enough of the instrument to keep my interest. Not knowing what the rest of it looks like, I''m not sure if zooming out a little will hurt or help. None the less, great photography - 9   Gotcha</td>', 'This is great work. Good detail, no harsh lighting. I''d love to hang this on my wall, but i can''t see enough of the instrument to keep my interest. Not knowing what the rest of it looks like, I''m not sure if zooming out a little will hurt or help. None the less, great photography - 9   Gotcha', '2002-12-15 21:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(172688, 9543, 2079, '<td valign="top">This has some serious potential, but it\''s missing something, I can\''t put a finger on it. I don\''t know what the rest of the wood looks like, so I\''m not sure if you can step back a bit without bringing something ugly into the shot. Or maybe something of greater interest in the window like a sunset or a flower, maybe a tree??? I like the subject - 8    Gotcha</td>', 'This has some serious potential, but it\''s missing something, I can\''t put a finger on it. I don\''t know what the rest of the wood looks like, so I\''m not sure if you can step back a bit without bringing something ugly into the shot. Or maybe something of greater interest in the window like a sunset or a flower, maybe a tree??? I like the subject - 8    Gotcha', '2002-12-15 21:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(172690, 9450, 2079, '<td valign="top">This is a great capture. Good color, great subject nice angel and framing. The lighting is just a little harsh for my taste, but it does add some interest to the shot by bringing out some additional grain in the wood. Nice work 8   - Gotcha</td>', 'This is a great capture. Good color, great subject nice angel and framing. The lighting is just a little harsh for my taste, but it does add some interest to the shot by bringing out some additional grain in the wood. Nice work 8   - Gotcha', '2002-12-15 21:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(172691, 9396, 1847, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but it''s too backlit.  It woulda been nice if we could have gotten just a bit of detail in the thread and needles.</td>', 'I like the concept, but it''s too backlit.  It woulda been nice if we could have gotten just a bit of detail in the thread and needles.', '2002-12-15 21:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(172693, 9469, 1128, '<td valign="top">Great perspective and coloring.</td>', 'Great perspective and coloring.', '2002-12-15 21:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(172694, 9582, 2079, '<td valign="top">It''s only missing the words..... Nice Work    7 - Gotcha</td>', 'It''s only missing the words..... Nice Work    7 - Gotcha', '2002-12-15 21:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(172695, 9310, 1847, '<td valign="top">Very well lit.  Colors are really well-saturated and rich.  Composition is a little uninteresting.</td>', 'Very well lit.  Colors are really well-saturated and rich.  Composition is a little uninteresting.', '2002-12-15 21:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(172696, 9566, 1128, '<td valign="top">She''s into her job, eh?  Without the title, I am not sure I would know what she was doing.</td>', 'She''s into her job, eh?  Without the title, I am not sure I would know what she was doing.', '2002-12-15 21:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(172702, 9491, 1128, '<td valign="top">Cute smile.  The coloring seems a bit dull to me.  Maybe that was the intention.</td>', 'Cute smile.  The coloring seems a bit dull to me.  Maybe that was the intention.', '2002-12-15 22:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(172703, 9503, 1128, '<td valign="top">I like the choice of blackand white, and the dust is a great touch!</td>', 'I like the choice of blackand white, and the dust is a great touch!', '2002-12-15 22:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(172704, 9494, 1128, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see this in color.  It would have probably been very vivid.</td>', 'I would have liked to see this in color.  It would have probably been very vivid.', '2002-12-15 22:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(172705, 9546, 1128, '<td valign="top">Like the sky and the tree.  The buildings provide some perspective.</td>', 'Like the sky and the tree.  The buildings provide some perspective.', '2002-12-15 22:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(172706, 9450, 1128, '<td valign="top">Good detail!</td>', 'Good detail!', '2002-12-15 22:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(172707, 9510, 1128, '<td valign="top">What a cutie!  This is a very crisp image.  Good work.</td>', 'What a cutie!  This is a very crisp image.  Good work.', '2002-12-15 22:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(172708, 9501, 1128, '<td valign="top">I like the way the focus is on the leaves, and the branch fades into the background.</td>', 'I like the way the focus is on the leaves, and the branch fades into the background.', '2002-12-15 22:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(172709, 9459, 1128, '<td valign="top">A great image.  I like the slanting effect of the fence.</td>', 'A great image.  I like the slanting effect of the fence.', '2002-12-15 22:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(172710, 9551, 1128, '<td valign="top">Good perspective.  I am a little distracted by the fact that it is nearly centered at the bottom, but not centered at the top.</td>', 'Good perspective.  I am a little distracted by the fact that it is nearly centered at the bottom, but not centered at the top.', '2002-12-15 22:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(172711, 9402, 1128, '<td valign="top">Weird coloring, but great composition.  I like the goosebumps.</td>', 'Weird coloring, but great composition.  I like the goosebumps.', '2002-12-15 22:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(172712, 9585, 1128, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting of this.   It''s a lovely, casual portrait.</td>', 'I like the lighting of this.   It''s a lovely, casual portrait.', '2002-12-15 22:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(172713, 9506, 1128, '<td valign="top">I really like the motion of this.  It''s got wonderful coloring too.</td>', 'I really like the motion of this.  It''s got wonderful coloring too.', '2002-12-15 22:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(172714, 9447, 1128, '<td valign="top">Seems a little overexposed.  Saturate the colors a little, and you would have a more vivid portrait.  I like the composition.</td>', 'Seems a little overexposed.  Saturate the colors a little, and you would have a more vivid portrait.  I like the composition.', '2002-12-15 22:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(172715, 9379, 1128, '<td valign="top">The wreath adds a nice touch.</td>', 'The wreath adds a nice touch.', '2002-12-15 22:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(172716, 9497, 1128, '<td valign="top">good crop.   Seems a little pixelated.  Did you use digital zoom?</td>', 'good crop.   Seems a little pixelated.  Did you use digital zoom?', '2002-12-15 22:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(172717, 9586, 1128, '<td valign="top">Looks like a psychedelic caterpillar.  Seems a little grainy to me.  I like the black background.</td>', 'Looks like a psychedelic caterpillar.  Seems a little grainy to me.  I like the black background.', '2002-12-15 22:20:50.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(172718, 9396, 1128, '<td valign="top">Very abstract and cool.  I really like this, and especially the different sized eyes.  Wonderful!</td>', 'Very abstract and cool.  I really like this, and especially the different sized eyes.  Wonderful!', '2002-12-15 22:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(172719, 9465, 1128, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective.  I like the way her eyelashes cast shadows.    The crop works for this image, I think.</td>', 'Interesting perspective.  I like the way her eyelashes cast shadows.    The crop works for this image, I think.', '2002-12-15 22:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(172720, 9369, 1128, '<td valign="top">Very creative!  :)</td>', 'Very creative!  :)', '2002-12-15 22:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(172723, 9312, 1128, '<td valign="top">Good crop!  I like the coloring of this image.</td>', 'Good crop!  I like the coloring of this image.', '2002-12-15 22:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(172729, 9575, 2079, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea, but way too small to give this any kind of critique on quality. - Good Luck</td>', 'This is a great idea, but way too small to give this any kind of critique on quality. - Good Luck', '2002-12-15 22:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(172734, 9550, 2279, '<td valign="top">Is this some kind of hat or did you really stack all these sunflower seeds? Its a little dark to me but an overall visually appealing image.</td>', 'Is this some kind of hat or did you really stack all these sunflower seeds? Its a little dark to me but an overall visually appealing image.', '2002-12-15 23:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(172736, 9369, 2279, '<td valign="top">Very creative. Wish the glare wasnt there on the red slice of the apple. Good job.</td>', 'Very creative. Wish the glare wasnt there on the red slice of the apple. Good job.', '2002-12-15 23:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(172737, 9546, 2279, '<td valign="top">Nice B&amp;W shot. This shot keeps reminding me how cold im gonna be when I move to Mighigan next month. Great sharpness but I think a little tiny bit more of the foreground would have improved the shot.</td>', 'Nice B&W shot. This shot keeps reminding me how cold im gonna be when I move to Mighigan next month. Great sharpness but I think a little tiny bit more of the foreground would have improved the shot.', '2002-12-15 23:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(172738, 9396, 2279, '<td valign="top">Nice macro. I can see the tiny hairs of the thread. Good clarity and nice composition.</td>', 'Nice macro. I can see the tiny hairs of the thread. Good clarity and nice composition.', '2002-12-15 23:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(172739, 9497, 2279, '<td valign="top">This is a great capture of this bird. Everything is perfect except for a little too many JPEG artifacts. Makes it look a little fuzzy.</td>', 'This is a great capture of this bird. Everything is perfect except for a little too many JPEG artifacts. Makes it look a little fuzzy.', '2002-12-15 23:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(172740, 9449, 2279, '<td valign="top">Everything looks a little too centered to me and theres not enough color contrast in this shot. The cloudy day doesnt help with that either.</td>', 'Everything looks a little too centered to me and theres not enough color contrast in this shot. The cloudy day doesnt help with that either.', '2002-12-15 23:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(172741, 9452, 2279, '<td valign="top">Great composition and I love the reflections. Could be a little brighter in my opinion but none the less a great shot.</td>', 'Great composition and I love the reflections. Could be a little brighter in my opinion but none the less a great shot.', '2002-12-15 23:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(172743, 9433, 2079, '<td valign="top">This is a difficult shot to critique for me. Shades of blacks and whites with this level of extreme contrast are not easy to shoot. I love lighthouses, so it has my interest. The blue of the sky is rich in color and the detail is clear throughout the picture. The contrails are a little distracting to me but theres not a lot you can do to fix that short of re-shooting in an hour. I want to see something else in the picture to give me an idea of the size of the tower. (Only because it almost looks like a toy). The black frame is a nice addition. Good Luck  Gotcha 7</td>', 'This is a difficult shot to critique for me. Shades of blacks and whites with this level of extreme contrast are not easy to shoot. I love lighthouses, so it has my interest. The blue of the sky is rich in color and the detail is clear throughout the picture. The contrails are a little distracting to me but theres not a lot you can do to fix that short of re-shooting in an hour. I want to see something else in the picture to give me an idea of the size of the tower. (Only because it almost looks like a toy). The black frame is a nice addition. Good Luck  Gotcha 7', '2002-12-15 23:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(172745, 9315, 2279, '<td valign="top">Nice flower shot. I would have moved in for a closer shot and cropped out some of the background at the top.</td>', 'Nice flower shot. I would have moved in for a closer shot and cropped out some of the background at the top.', '2002-12-15 23:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(172747, 9522, 2279, '<td valign="top">This is a really neat shot. The lighting and composition are great and its showing me what I get to look forward to next month when I leave the heat and move to the cold.</td>', 'This is a really neat shot. The lighting and composition are great and its showing me what I get to look forward to next month when I leave the heat and move to the cold.', '2002-12-15 23:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(172748, 9310, 2279, '<td valign="top">This is a good snapshot but the background looks a little busy and the wire going right through his head is distracting.</td>', 'This is a good snapshot but the background looks a little busy and the wire going right through his head is distracting.', '2002-12-15 23:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(172749, 9491, 2279, '<td valign="top">Cute kid shot. The composition is great but I wish the shot overall was a little brighter and maybe some more contrast.</td>', 'Cute kid shot. The composition is great but I wish the shot overall was a little brighter and maybe some more contrast.', '2002-12-15 23:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(172751, 9553, 2279, '<td valign="top">Great use of negative space. The kisses points my eyes to move through the photo. Good job.</td>', 'Great use of negative space. The kisses points my eyes to move through the photo. Good job.', '2002-12-15 23:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(172752, 9551, 2279, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective. Looks like its really tall.</td>', 'Nice perspective. Looks like its really tall.', '2002-12-15 23:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(172753, 9463, 2279, '<td valign="top">Ive learned from the Fruits and Vegetables challenge that if your going to use fruit you have to make sure you pick the best ones. These have a lot of black spots on them. The shadows cast across the back ones are a little dark and I think for this shot having all three of the lemons in focus would have helped.</td>', 'Ive learned from the Fruits and Vegetables challenge that if your going to use fruit you have to make sure you pick the best ones. These have a lot of black spots on them. The shadows cast across the back ones are a little dark and I think for this shot having all three of the lemons in focus would have helped.', '2002-12-15 23:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(172754, 9519, 2279, '<td valign="top">Looks cold out there. He must be dedicated.</td>', 'Looks cold out there. He must be dedicated.', '2002-12-15 23:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(172755, 9465, 2279, '<td valign="top">This would have been a 10 if her whole face was lit up and not just the lower part.</td>', 'This would have been a 10 if her whole face was lit up and not just the lower part.', '2002-12-15 23:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(172756, 9383, 2279, '<td valign="top">This is a nice perspective of the trumpet but I think that the DOF would have been better for this shot having the entire trumpet in focus. But thats just my opinion.</td>', 'This is a nice perspective of the trumpet but I think that the DOF would have been better for this shot having the entire trumpet in focus. But thats just my opinion.', '2002-12-15 23:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(172757, 9390, 2279, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot but the reflections on the sword hilts could have been avoided by changing the angle of the lights.</td>', 'This is a great shot but the reflections on the sword hilts could have been avoided by changing the angle of the lights.', '2002-12-15 23:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(172758, 9497, 4162, '<td valign="top">What a fantastic capture! Great use of DOF, great background! A little grainy but wonderful picture.</td>', 'What a fantastic capture! Great use of DOF, great background! A little grainy but wonderful picture.', '2002-12-15 23:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(172773, 9310, 2079, '<td valign="top">This is a great portrait shot. Kid shots seem to loose a few points on DPC, but this one has that little extra element that I think will work wonders. The lighting is perfect, bringing rich color to the skin tones.   8   - Gotcha<br/> <br/>He looks just like his dad, .   (Must be the nose).  <br/>Nice Shot <br/></td>', 'This is a great portrait shot. Kid shots seem to loose a few points on DPC, but this one has that little extra element that I think will work wonders. The lighting is perfect, bringing rich color to the skin tones.   8   - Gotcha He looks just like his dad, .   (Must be the nose).  Nice Shot ', '2002-12-15 23:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(172782, 9402, 2, '<td valign="top">Very, very disappointed with 24th place for this shot.  Great job regardless, Kimbly.</td>', 'Very, very disappointed with 24th place for this shot.  Great job regardless, Kimbly.', '2002-12-16 00:02:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(172800, 9582, 714, '<td valign="top">I think this should have taken 1st place.  This is so awesome.  My favorite.</td>', 'I think this should have taken 1st place.  This is so awesome.  My favorite.', '2002-12-16 00:20:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(172815, 9336, 714, '<td valign="top">This should have done better. But you messed up by putting some cool effects on it. ;)  Very nice shot Gordon!</td>', 'This should have done better. But you messed up by putting some cool effects on it. ;)  Very nice shot Gordon!', '2002-12-16 00:24:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(172844, 9482, 806, '<td valign="top">Congrats!!! I think this is tangible.. Luv it!<br/></td>', 'Congrats!!! I think this is tangible.. Luv it!', '2002-12-16 00:30:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(172862, 9340, 1280, '<td valign="top">Right from the start I liked this a lot.  It is very different and I find the coloring to be appealing.  <br/>I love the background you chose...I still don''t know what it is.  Pudding??? <br/>I''m really surprised that this didn''t score higher.  It''s well composed, exposure is good, focus is fine.  <br/>I really don''t see anything I''d change.  I really like this and I scored it high.<br/>Nice work!  <br/>Please email me and tell me what the bg is.</td>', 'Right from the start I liked this a lot.  It is very different and I find the coloring to be appealing.  I love the background you chose...I still don''t know what it is.  Pudding??? I''m really surprised that this didn''t score higher.  It''s well composed, exposure is good, focus is fine.  I really don''t see anything I''d change.  I really like this and I scored it high.Nice work!  Please email me and tell me what the bg is.', '2002-12-16 00:35:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(172868, 9436, 255, '<td valign="top">wow! i loved this, mag! i cant believe it didn''t score higher! :)</td>', 'wow! i loved this, mag! i cant believe it didn''t score higher! :)', '2002-12-16 00:36:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(172895, 9575, 806, '<td valign="top">Gosh, what an idea! Again, I really liked this shot...</td>', 'Gosh, what an idea! Again, I really liked this shot...', '2002-12-16 00:46:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(172899, 9559, 2003, '<td valign="top">a great example of a good idea gone horribly awry (sorry to say this, you two, but at least i wasn''t last)</td>', 'a great example of a good idea gone horribly awry (sorry to say this, you two, but at least i wasn''t last)', '2002-12-16 00:48:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(172927, 9553, 714, '<td valign="top">I am surprised this didn''t do better.  I like it. One of my favorites.</td>', 'I am surprised this didn''t do better.  I like it. One of my favorites.', '2002-12-16 01:00:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(172947, 9491, 714, '<td valign="top">I do feel like this is some of my best work yet.  I am very pleased with the results.<br/> <br/>This was taken with the lighting from my livingroom window.  The original seemed to bright.  The effect I was looking for was a painted effect.  I toned the colors down with some sepia color. <br/> <br/>I didn''t tell her to pose in any way. She was playing with the flowers and I was just taking pictures. This is naturally her style. Grrr.... She is also going through a stage where she refuses to let me put her hair up except when she goes to dance.  <br/> <br/>Thanks everyone for the comments.</td>', 'I do feel like this is some of my best work yet.  I am very pleased with the results. This was taken with the lighting from my livingroom window.  The original seemed to bright.  The effect I was looking for was a painted effect.  I toned the colors down with some sepia color.  I didn''t tell her to pose in any way. She was playing with the flowers and I was just taking pictures. This is naturally her style. Grrr.... She is also going through a stage where she refuses to let me put her hair up except when she goes to dance.   Thanks everyone for the comments.', '2002-12-16 01:08:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(173020, 9482, 4156, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the nice comments and for taking the time to do so!  You are all very kind and helpful, and I really do appreciate it a lot!  ~Kate</td>', 'Thanks for all the nice comments and for taking the time to do so!  You are all very kind and helpful, and I really do appreciate it a lot!  ~Kate', '2002-12-16 01:56:59.000000', NULL, 0),
