(4282478, 9482, 87284, '<td valign="top">I am sad when I watch this photo.  All is unavoidable.  A drop has fallen.   I till not rise back.  That bounce up, "action and reaction", when caught as a slice in in the dimension of time, is a hopeless attempt to escape from inevitability.  The tiny column of water will fall down and then push up a similar hope.  Temporary.  Sad...  Colours are sharp and crude.  Nothing subtle.  Almost like black and white, only multidimensional.  This is why it is so BEAUTIFUL.  So CRUEL !!!</td>', 'I am sad when I watch this photo.  All is unavoidable.  A drop has fallen.   I till not rise back.  That bounce up, "action and reaction", when caught as a slice in in the dimension of time, is a hopeless attempt to escape from inevitability.  The tiny column of water will fall down and then push up a similar hope.  Temporary.  Sad...  Colours are sharp and crude.  Nothing subtle.  Almost like black and white, only multidimensional.  This is why it is so BEAUTIFUL.  So CRUEL !!!', '2007-12-02 11:20:10.000000', NULL, 0),
